window.JP_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"about – above","cards":[{"w":"talk about the weather","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"聊天氣","s":"When my grandfather meets his old friends in the park, they always talk about the weather for a long time."},{"w":"a book about animals","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"一本關於動物的書","s":"For my birthday, my aunt gave me a book about animals, and I read it every night before I go to bed."},{"w":"How about a cup of tea?","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"喝杯茶如何？","s":"You look very tired after washing all the dishes, so how about a cup of tea and some cookies?"},{"w":"What about you?","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"你呢？","s":"I want to go swimming at the beach this Saturday because the weather will be hot, but what about you?"},{"w":"worry about the test","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"擔心考試","s":"Jenny did not sleep well last night because she kept worrying about the test in math class today."},{"w":"be excited about the trip","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"對旅行感到興奮","s":"The students are so excited about the trip to Japan that they have already packed their bags a week early."},{"w":"be sorry about it","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"為此感到抱歉","s":"Tom broke his sister's favorite cup this morning, and he said he was really sorry about it."},{"w":"What is it about?","p":"prep.","d":"about · 慣用語","c":"這是關於什麼的？","s":"My brother is watching a long movie in the living room, so I asked him what it is about."},{"w":"about ten o'clock","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"大約十點","s":"The train to Kaohsiung leaves at about ten o'clock, so we should get to the station a little earlier."},{"w":"about 20 people","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"大約二十人","s":"There were about 20 people waiting in line outside the new bakery before it opened this morning."},{"w":"about to leave","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"即將離開","s":"We were about to leave for the movie theater when it suddenly started to rain very hard outside."},{"w":"be about to cry","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"快要哭了","s":"The little girl was about to cry because she could not find her mother in the crowded market."},{"w":"walk about the park","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"在公園裡四處走","s":"On Sunday mornings my grandmother likes to walk about the park and say hello to her neighbors."},{"w":"There is no doubt about it.","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"這點毫無疑問。","s":"Lisa is the best singer in our class, and there is no doubt about it because everyone loves her voice."},{"w":"be careful about money","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"小心用錢","s":"My mother always tells me to be careful about money, so I write down everything I buy each week."},{"w":"be crazy about baseball","p":"prep.","d":"about · 方式","c":"對棒球很著迷","s":"My cousin is crazy about baseball, and he watches every game on TV even when it is very late at night."},{"w":"about","p":"prep.","d":"about · 易混淆","c":"around (大約)=about 等於 around","s":"The bus ride to the museum takes about an hour, or around an hour, so bring a book to read."},{"w":"about three days (大約)","p":"prep.","d":"about · 易混淆","c":"大約三天","s":"It took my father about three days to fix the old bicycle, but now it runs better than before."},{"w":"the sky above us","p":"prep.","d":"above · 地點","c":"我們頭頂的天空","s":"We lay on the grass after the picnic and looked at the sky above us, which was full of white clouds."},{"w":"above the clouds","p":"prep.","d":"above · 地點","c":"雲層之上","s":"When the plane flew above the clouds, the sun came out and everything outside the window turned bright."},{"w":"the picture above the sofa","p":"prep.","d":"above · 地點","c":"沙發上方的畫","s":"The picture above the sofa was painted by my grandmother when she was a young art student in Taipei."},{"w":"fly above the sea","p":"prep.","d":"above · 地點","c":"飛越海面上方","s":"We watched many white birds fly above the sea while we were eating ice cream on the beach."},{"w":"a few lines above","p":"prep.","d":"above · 地點","c":"上面幾行","s":"If you do not understand this word, you can find its meaning a few lines above on the same page."},{"w":"the floor above","p":"prep.","d":"above · 地點","c":"樓上那一層","s":"The family on the floor above plays loud music every night, so my father went to talk to them."},{"w":"above all","p":"prep.","d":"above · 慣用語","c":"最重要的是","s":"You should study hard and eat well, but above all, remember to get enough sleep before the big test."},{"w":"above zero","p":"prep.","d":"above · 慣用語","c":"零度以上","s":"It was very cold this morning, but the weather report says it will stay just above zero this afternoon."},{"w":"children above ten","p":"prep.","d":"above · 慣用語","c":"十歲以上的孩子","s":"Children above ten have to buy a full ticket at this zoo, but younger kids can get in for free."},{"w":"above the law","p":"prep.","d":"above · 慣用語","c":"不受法律約束","s":"Nobody is above the law in our country, so even famous and rich people must follow the same rules."},{"w":"above and beyond","p":"prep.","d":"above · 慣用語","c":"超出預期","s":"Our teacher stayed after school every day to help us, which went above and beyond what we expected."},{"w":"the above rules","p":"prep.","d":"above · 慣用語","c":"上述規定","s":"Everyone who joins the school sports club must read and follow the above rules at all times."},{"w":"See the picture above.","p":"prep.","d":"above · 慣用語","c":"見上圖。","s":"To learn how to make this paper bird, see the picture above and follow the six easy steps."},{"w":"above sea level","p":"prep.","d":"above · 易混淆","c":"海平面以上","s":"Our hotel in the mountains was two thousand meters above sea level, so the nights were very cold."}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"across – after","cards":[{"w":"walk across the street","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"走過馬路","s":"Always look left and right before you walk across the street, even when the light is green."},{"w":"swim across the river","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"游過河","s":"My uncle can swim across the river in ten minutes, but I am still afraid of the deep water."},{"w":"across the road from school","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"在學校對面馬路邊","s":"There is a small bookstore across the road from school, and many students go there after class."},{"w":"live across the street","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"住在對街","s":"Mrs. Lin lives across the street from us, and she often brings us fruit from her garden."},{"w":"a bridge across the river","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"一座跨河的橋","s":"A new bridge across the river opened last month, so now it takes only five minutes to get to town."},{"w":"run across the field","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"跑過田野","s":"The dog saw a rabbit and started to run across the field as fast as it could."},{"w":"across Taiwan","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"全台灣各地","s":"Heavy rain fell across Taiwan last weekend, and many baseball games had to be stopped."},{"w":"all across the world","p":"prep.","d":"across · 地點","c":"全世界各地","s":"People all across the world watched the final game on TV and cheered for their favorite teams."},{"w":"come across an old friend","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"偶然遇到老友","s":"I came across an old friend from my old school at the night market, and we talked for an hour."},{"w":"come across a word","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"碰到一個字","s":"When you come across a word you do not know, write it down and look it up in the dictionary later."},{"w":"run across sb.","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"偶然碰到某人","s":"You will never guess who I ran across at the train station this morning before I went to work."},{"w":"get across one's idea","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"讓人了解自己的想法","s":"It was hard for Amy to get across her idea in English, so she drew a picture to explain it."},{"w":"across from the bank","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"在銀行對面","s":"The post office is across from the bank, so you can send the letter after you get your money."},{"w":"put a line across the page","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"在頁面上畫一條線","s":"The teacher asked us to put a line across the page and write the new words under it."},{"w":"sit across from me","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"坐在我對面","s":"At the family dinner, my little cousin sat across from me and kept making funny faces during the meal."},{"w":"right across the hall","p":"prep.","d":"across · 慣用語","c":"就在走廊對面","s":"The music room is right across the hall from our class, so we can hear the piano every afternoon."},{"w":"walk across the park (穿越空地)","p":"prep.","d":"across · 易混淆","c":"走過公園","s":"It is faster to walk across the park than to go around it, so we take that way to school."},{"w":"after school","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"放學後","s":"After school, Peter and his friends usually play basketball in the park until it gets dark."},{"w":"after dinner","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"晚餐後","s":"My family likes to take a short walk around the block after dinner when the weather is nice."},{"w":"the day after tomorrow","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"後天","s":"We are going to visit my grandmother in Tainan the day after tomorrow, so I need to pack my bag."},{"w":"after a while","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"過了一會兒","s":"The baby cried loudly at first, but after a while she fell asleep in her mother's arms."},{"w":"after all these years","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"這麼多年之後","s":"After all these years, my mother still remembers the name of her first English teacher at school."},{"w":"ten after six","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"六點十分","s":"The school bus comes at ten after six every morning, so I have to get up very early to catch it."},{"w":"one after another","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"一個接一個","s":"The students walked into the gym one after another and sat down quietly for the morning meeting."},{"w":"day after day","p":"prep.","d":"after · 時間","c":"日復一日","s":"Day after day, the old man sat by the window and waited for a letter from his son in America."},{"w":"after all","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"畢竟","s":"I was angry that my brother ate my cake, but after all, he is only five years old."},{"w":"look after the baby","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"照顧寶寶","s":"My mother asked me to look after the baby while she went to the supermarket to buy some milk."},{"w":"run after the bus","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"追公車","s":"We had to run after the bus this morning because we spent too much time eating breakfast."},{"w":"take after one's father","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"長得像父親","s":"Everyone says that Jack takes after his father because they both have big eyes and love to tell jokes."},{"w":"be after money","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"追求金錢","s":"I do not think he is a true friend, because he is only after money and never helps anyone for free."},{"w":"name the baby after her grandmother","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"以祖母的名字為寶寶命名","s":"My parents decided to name the baby after her grandmother, so my little sister is also called Mei."},{"w":"ask after sb.","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"問候某人","s":"When I met Mr. Wang at the market, he asked after my grandfather, who has been sick for a month."},{"w":"after you","p":"prep.","d":"after · 慣用語","c":"您先請","s":"When we got to the door at the same time, the tall man smiled at me and said, After you."},{"w":"after two days (從某時起)","p":"prep.","d":"after · 易混淆","c":"兩天後","s":"After two days of heavy rain, the sun finally came out and the children ran outside to play."}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"against – along","cards":[{"w":"against the law","p":"prep.","d":"against · 慣用語","c":"違法","s":"Riding a motorcycle without a safety hat is against the law in Taiwan, and you may have to pay money."},{"w":"against the rules","p":"prep.","d":"against · 慣用語","c":"違規","s":"Using your phone during the test is against the rules, so please put it in your bag now."},{"w":"be against the plan","p":"prep.","d":"against · 慣用語","c":"反對這個計畫","s":"Most of the students are against the plan to have classes on Saturday because they want to rest."},{"w":"play against another team","p":"prep.","d":"against · 慣用語","c":"對抗另一隊","s":"Our school team will play against another team from Taichung in the final game next Sunday afternoon."},{"w":"stand against the door","p":"prep.","d":"against · 慣用語","c":"靠門站著","s":"The tired boy had to stand against the door on the crowded train because there were no empty seats."},{"w":"fight against the enemy","p":"prep.","d":"against · 慣用語","c":"對抗敵人","s":"In the story, the brave young soldier had to fight against the enemy alone to save his village."},{"w":"vote against it","p":"prep.","d":"against · 慣用語","c":"投票反對","s":"When the class leader asked about having a party, many students voted for it but a few voted against it."},{"w":"against the wind","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"逆風","s":"It was hard to ride my bicycle against the wind this morning, so I was late for school."},{"w":"swim against the water","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"逆流而上","s":"The little fish had to swim against the water for hours to get back to the place where it was born."},{"w":"protect against the cold","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"防寒","s":"Grandma made me a thick sweater to protect against the cold because winter in the mountains is hard."},{"w":"against one's will","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"違背意願","s":"Nobody should make a child join a club against his will, because he will not enjoy it at all."},{"w":"against the clock","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"搶時間","s":"The doctors worked against the clock all night to save the man who was hurt in the car accident."},{"w":"a race against time","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"與時間賽跑","s":"Finishing the school report before midnight became a race against time because I started too late."},{"w":"the dark hills against the sky","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"天空映襯下的黑色山丘","s":"From the beach we could see the dark hills against the sky as the sun went down behind them."},{"w":"have nothing against him","p":"prep.","d":"against · 方式","c":"對他沒有意見","s":"I have nothing against him, but I do not want to sit next to him because he talks too much in class."},{"w":"Are you for or against it?","p":"prep.","d":"against · 易混淆","c":"你贊成還是反對？","s":"The teacher wants to change the time of the class trip, so are you for or against it?"},{"w":"walk along the river","p":"prep.","d":"along · 地點","c":"沿著河走","s":"On warm evenings, my parents and I walk along the river and watch the lights of the city."},{"w":"along the road","p":"prep.","d":"along · 地點","c":"沿路","s":"There were many beautiful flowers along the road, so we stopped the car to take some pictures."},{"w":"trees along the street","p":"prep.","d":"along · 地點","c":"街道兩旁的樹","s":"The tall trees along the street keep us cool when we walk home on hot summer afternoons."},{"w":"drive along the coast","p":"prep.","d":"along · 地點","c":"沿著海岸開車","s":"Last summer we drove along the coast for three hours and ate fresh fish at a small town."},{"w":"shops along the way","p":"prep.","d":"along · 地點","c":"沿路的商店","s":"We stopped at several small shops along the way to buy drinks and snacks before we reached the beach."},{"w":"get along with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"與某人相處融洽","s":"Although my sister and I are very different, we get along with each other well and seldom fight."},{"w":"come along with us","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"跟我們一起來","s":"We are going to the night market tonight, so why don't you come along with us and try some food?"},{"w":"bring your friend along","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"帶你朋友一起來","s":"The party on Friday will be a lot of fun, so you can bring your friend along if you want."},{"w":"go along with the plan","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"贊同這個計畫","s":"At first Tom did not like the idea, but in the end he decided to go along with the plan."},{"w":"move along, please","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"請往前走","s":"The police officer told the people on the street to move along, please, because the big show was coming."},{"w":"sing along with the music","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"跟著音樂唱","s":"When our favorite song came on the radio, everyone in the car started to sing along with the music."},{"w":"all along","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"一直以來","s":"My mother knew all along that I broke the window, but she waited for me to tell her the truth."},{"w":"along with his family","p":"prep.","d":"along · 片語動詞","c":"和他的家人一起","s":"Mr. Chen moved to Kaohsiung along with his family last year because he found a better job there."},{"w":"How are you getting along?","p":"prep.","d":"along · 慣用語","c":"你過得如何？","s":"I have not seen you since you started your new school, so how are you getting along these days?"},{"w":"Come along!","p":"prep.","d":"along · 慣用語","c":"快點來！","s":"Come along! The movie starts in ten minutes, and we still have to buy the tickets and some popcorn."},{"w":"take an umbrella along","p":"prep.","d":"along · 慣用語","c":"隨身帶把傘","s":"The sky looks gray this morning, so you should take an umbrella along when you go to school."},{"w":"along the way","p":"prep.","d":"along · 慣用語","c":"一路上","s":"On our trip to the mountains we met many kind people along the way who gave us food and water."},{"w":"run along now","p":"prep.","d":"along · 慣用語","c":"現在快走吧","s":"Grandpa gave us each a cookie and said, Run along now, because he wanted to take a short sleep."},{"w":"read along with me","p":"prep.","d":"along · 慣用語","c":"跟著我一起讀","s":"The English teacher played the story and asked the whole class to read along with her slowly."}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"among – around","cards":[{"w":"among friends","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"在朋友之間","s":"I feel most comfortable when I am among friends, because I can say anything without being afraid."},{"w":"popular among students","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"在學生之間很受歡迎","s":"Bubble tea is very popular among students in Taiwan, and many of them buy a cup after school."},{"w":"one among many","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"眾多之一","s":"Our school is just one among many schools in the city, but we are the only one with a swimming pool."},{"w":"share the cake among the children","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"把蛋糕分給孩子們","s":"Grandma cut the big cake into eight pieces and shared it among the children at the birthday party."},{"w":"among other things","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"除了其他事情以外","s":"At the meeting we talked about the school trip, the new uniforms, and the sports day, among other things."},{"w":"a house among the trees","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"樹林中的一棟房子","s":"My grandfather lives in a small house among the trees, and you can hear birds singing all day long."},{"w":"talk among themselves","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"他們彼此交談","s":"The students talked among themselves for a few minutes before the teacher asked for their answer."},{"w":"among the best","p":"prep.","d":"among · 慣用語","c":"名列最佳之一","s":"Our basketball team is among the best in the country, and we won the first prize again this year."},{"w":"among the three of us","p":"prep.","d":"among · 易混淆","c":"我們三人之間","s":"Among the three of us, Lisa is the tallest, so she always gets the things on the top shelf."},{"w":"among the crowd","p":"prep.","d":"among · 易混淆","c":"人群之中","s":"I lost my little brother among the crowd at the night market, but we found him near the ice cream shop."},{"w":"choose among many","p":"prep.","d":"among · 易混淆","c":"在多者中選擇","s":"There were so many colors of shoes in the store that it took me an hour to choose among many."},{"w":"around the corner","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"在轉角處","s":"The new bakery is just around the corner from our school, and the bread smells wonderful every morning."},{"w":"sit around the table","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"圍著桌子坐","s":"On New Year's Eve the whole family sits around the table and eats a big dinner together."},{"w":"walk around the lake","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"繞著湖走","s":"My grandmother and her friends walk around the lake every morning before they have breakfast together."},{"w":"look around the room","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"環顧房間","s":"When I woke up in the hotel, I looked around the room and could not remember where I was."},{"w":"all around the world","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"全世界","s":"Children all around the world love to play games, even if the games are different in each country."},{"w":"travel around Taiwan","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"環島旅行","s":"My uncle wants to travel around Taiwan by bicycle this summer, and he plans to finish in nine days."},{"w":"turn around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"轉身","s":"When someone called my name on the street, I turned around but saw no one that I knew."},{"w":"the other way around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 地點","c":"反過來","s":"People think my sister is older than me, but actually it is the other way around; I am older."},{"w":"around nine o'clock","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"大約九點","s":"The movie ends around nine o'clock, so I will call you when I get home a little later."},{"w":"around 50 dollars","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"大約五十元","s":"A ticket to the water park costs around 50 dollars for students, so bring your student card."},{"w":"around ten years old","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"大約十歲","s":"When I was around ten years old, my family moved from a small town to a big city."},{"w":"be around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"在附近","s":"Please be around at three o'clock this afternoon, because the man is coming to fix the computer."},{"w":"show sb. around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"帶某人參觀","s":"When my cousin came to visit from Japan, I showed her around the school and my favorite night market."},{"w":"stick around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"留在這裡別走","s":"The game will start again in ten minutes after the rain stops, so please stick around if you can."},{"w":"fool around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"混時間","s":"If you fool around in class instead of listening, you will not pass the English test next week."},{"w":"hang around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 方式","c":"閒晃","s":"Some students like to hang around at the park after school instead of going straight home."},{"w":"just around the corner","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"即將到來","s":"Summer vacation is just around the corner, so the students are already planning trips to the beach."},{"w":"look around for a job","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"到處找工作","s":"After he finished school, my brother looked around for a job for two months before a bank hired him."},{"w":"get around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"四處走動","s":"My grandfather hurt his leg last month, so now he needs a stick to get around the house."},{"w":"around the clock","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"日夜不停","s":"The hospital near our house is open around the clock, so you can go there even at three in the morning."},{"w":"have been around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"見多識廣","s":"You can ask my grandmother any question about cooking, because she has been around for a long time."},{"w":"run around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"跑來跑去","s":"The little children ran around in the yard for an hour and then fell asleep right after lunch."},{"w":"ask around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"到處問問","s":"I lost my cat yesterday, so I will ask around the neighbors to see if anyone has seen a white cat."},{"w":"all year around","p":"prep.","d":"around · 慣用語","c":"一年到頭","s":"Because the weather in the south of Taiwan is warm all year around, farmers there can grow fruit in winter."}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"as – at (1)","cards":[{"w":"work as a teacher","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"當老師","s":"My aunt has worked as a teacher at a small school in the mountains for more than twenty years."},{"w":"use the box as a chair","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"把箱子當椅子用","s":"We did not have enough seats for the party, so my brother used a big box as a chair."},{"w":"as a child","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"小時候","s":"As a child, my father often went fishing with his grandfather at the river near their village."},{"w":"as a result","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"結果","s":"Tom stayed up late playing computer games last night, and as a result, he fell asleep in math class."},{"w":"as a matter of fact","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"事實上","s":"Many people think Jenny is shy, but as a matter of fact, she loves to sing in front of a big crowd."},{"w":"as far as I know","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"就我所知","s":"As far as I know, the library closes at nine on weekdays, but you should check the time on the Internet."},{"w":"as long as","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"只要","s":"You can borrow my bicycle this weekend as long as you bring it back before Monday morning."},{"w":"as soon as possible","p":"prep.","d":"as · 方式","c":"盡快","s":"The teacher asked us to hand in our homework as soon as possible because he must give the grades on Friday."},{"w":"as well","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"也","s":"We had noodles and dumplings for lunch, and my little brother wanted a bowl of hot soup as well."},{"w":"as well as","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"以及","s":"My mother speaks English as well as Japanese, so she often helps the visitors who come to our shop."},{"w":"as usual","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"像往常一樣","s":"As usual, my grandfather got up at five o'clock, drank a cup of tea, and read the newspaper."},{"w":"as follows","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"如下","s":"The rules for the school library are as follows: no food, no loud talking, and return books on time."},{"w":"as for me","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"至於我","s":"My friends want to go to the mountains this weekend, but as for me, I would rather stay home and rest."},{"w":"such as","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"例如","s":"My little sister loves sweet food, such as chocolate cake, ice cream, and cookies with milk."},{"w":"the same as","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"和…一樣","s":"My new phone is the same as my brother's, so sometimes we pick up the wrong one by mistake."},{"w":"as if","p":"prep.","d":"as · 慣用語","c":"好像","s":"The sky turned very dark in the afternoon, as if a big storm was going to hit the city soon."},{"w":"work as a nurse (真的是)","p":"prep.","d":"as · 易混淆","c":"當護士","s":"My mother works as a nurse at the hospital near our house, so she often comes home very late."},{"w":"as a friend (身分)","p":"prep.","d":"as · 易混淆","c":"以朋友的身分","s":"I am telling you this as a friend, not as your teacher: you should spend less time on your phone."},{"w":"think of A as B","p":"prep.","d":"as · 易混淆","c":"把 A 當成 B","s":"I have known Kevin since we were five, and I think of him as my brother, not just a friend."},{"w":"at seven o'clock","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在七點","s":"My alarm clock rings at seven o'clock every morning, but I usually stay in bed for ten more minutes."},{"w":"at noon","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在中午","s":"The sun is very strong at noon in summer, so remember to wear a hat when you go outside."},{"w":"at night","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在夜晚","s":"My cat sleeps all day, but at night it runs around the house and wakes everyone up."},{"w":"at midnight","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在半夜","s":"On New Year's Eve we stayed up until midnight, and at midnight we watched the beautiful lights in the sky together."},{"w":"at the weekend","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在週末","s":"At the weekend my family likes to drive to the mountains and have a picnic by the river."},{"w":"at Christmas","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在聖誕節","s":"At Christmas, my aunt in America always sends us a big box of gifts and chocolate cookies."},{"w":"at the moment","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"此刻","s":"My father is busy cooking dinner at the moment, so he will call you back in about half an hour."},{"w":"at that time","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在那時","s":"My parents met at a bookstore twenty years ago, and at that time my mother was still a student."},{"w":"at first","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"起初","s":"At first I did not like living in the city, but now I enjoy the busy streets and night markets."},{"w":"at last","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"最後","s":"After waiting for the bus for forty minutes in the rain, we got home at last and had hot soup."},{"w":"at the same time","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"同時","s":"It is hard to do your homework and watch TV at the same time, so turn off the TV first."},{"w":"at the age of ten","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在十歲時","s":"At the age of ten, my sister already knew how to cook simple dishes like fried rice and egg soup."},{"w":"at the end of the month","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"在月底","s":"My father gets paid at the end of the month, so that is when we usually go shopping for new clothes."},{"w":"at present","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"目前","s":"My grandmother is living with us at present because she needs help after she hurt her back."},{"w":"at once","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"立刻","s":"When the fire alarm rang, the teacher told everyone to leave the building at once and not take anything."},{"w":"at times","p":"prep.","d":"at · 時間","c":"有時","s":"My grandfather usually eats healthy food, but at times he enjoys a big bowl of beef noodles with friends."},{"w":"at home","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在家","s":"My mother stayed at home with my sick brother, so she could not come to my basketball game today."},{"w":"at school","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在學校","s":"The students have to be at school by seven thirty, and the first class begins at eight o'clock."},{"w":"at work","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在工作","s":"My father is at work until six, so please do not call him unless it is something very important."},{"w":"at the bus stop","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在公車站","s":"I waited at the bus stop for half an hour this morning, but the bus never came because of the rain."},{"w":"at the door","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在門口","s":"Someone is knocking at the door, so could you open it and see who is there while I finish cooking?"}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"at (2)","cards":[{"w":"at the top of the hill","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在山頂","s":"When we reached the top of the hill, we sat at the top and enjoyed the view of the whole city."},{"w":"at the bottom of the page","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在頁面底部","s":"Write your name and class at the bottom of the page before you hand in your test paper to the teacher."},{"w":"at the corner","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在角落","s":"My cat likes to sleep at the corner of the living room, where the afternoon sun shines through the window."},{"w":"at the party","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在派對上","s":"Everyone had a great time at the party last night because the music was loud and the food was delicious."},{"w":"at the table","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在餐桌旁","s":"My family sits at the table together every evening, and we talk about our day while we eat dinner."},{"w":"at the back of the room","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在房間後面","s":"Tom could not see the board well because he was sitting at the back of the room."},{"w":"at the front of the class","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在班上前面","s":"The teacher asked Mary to stand at the front of the class and read her story to everyone."},{"w":"at the station","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在車站","s":"We waited at the station for twenty minutes, but the train was late because of the heavy rain."},{"w":"at sea","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在海上","s":"My uncle is a sailor, so he spends many months at sea and only comes home twice a year."},{"w":"at a hotel","p":"prep.","d":"at · 地點","c":"在旅館","s":"When we travel to Japan next summer, we will stay at a hotel near the beach for five days."},{"w":"be good at math","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"擅長數學","s":"My sister is good at math, so she always helps me with my homework when I have problems."},{"w":"be bad at singing","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"不擅長唱歌","s":"I am bad at singing, but I still enjoy singing songs with my friends at the KTV on weekends."},{"w":"look at the picture","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"看圖","s":"Please look at the picture on page ten and tell me what the children are doing in the park."},{"w":"laugh at him","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"笑他","s":"It is not nice to laugh at him just because he gave the wrong answer in class today."},{"w":"be angry at sb.","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"生某人的氣","s":"Mom was angry at Tom because he came home very late and did not call her first."},{"w":"be surprised at the news","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"對消息感到驚訝","s":"We were all surprised at the news that our English teacher is going to move to Japan next month."},{"w":"smile at me","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"對我微笑","s":"The little girl smiled at me when I gave her my seat on the crowded bus this morning."},{"w":"shout at the kids","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"對孩子大吼","s":"The coach did not shout at the kids after they lost the game; instead, he told them to try again."},{"w":"point at the map","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"指著地圖","s":"The tour guide pointed at the map and showed us the fastest way to get to the night market."},{"w":"at least","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"至少","s":"You should drink at least eight glasses of water every day, especially when the weather is hot."},{"w":"at most","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"最多","s":"The small boat can carry at most six people, so some of us have to wait for the next one."},{"w":"at all","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"完全（否定）","s":"I did not understand the movie at all because everyone in it spoke French very quickly."},{"w":"not at all","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"一點也不","s":"When I thanked my neighbor for carrying my heavy bags, she smiled and said, Not at all."},{"w":"at first sight","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"一見之下","s":"At first sight, the old house looked dark and strange, but inside it was warm, clean, and full of books."},{"w":"at the age of","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"在…歲時","s":"My grandfather started working on a farm at the age of twelve because his family was very poor."},{"w":"at a low price","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"以低價","s":"We bought these fresh vegetables at a low price because the market was about to close for the day."},{"w":"at full speed","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"全速","s":"The driver went at full speed down the hill, and everyone on the bus held their seats and closed their eyes."},{"w":"at hand","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"在手邊","s":"Always keep a pen and some paper at hand so that you can write down important things quickly."},{"w":"at a time","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"一次","s":"Please come into the office one at a time because the doctor can only see one student now."},{"w":"two at a time","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"一次兩個","s":"The boys ran up the stairs two at a time because they did not want to miss the start of the game."},{"w":"be at a loss","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"不知所措","s":"When the teacher asked me a hard question in front of everyone, I was at a loss for words."},{"w":"at ease","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"放鬆","s":"After the big test was over, all the students felt at ease and went out to play basketball."},{"w":"at the thought of","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"一想到","s":"Little Amy feels sick at the thought of eating fish, so her mother cooks chicken for her instead."},{"w":"at the sight of","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"一看到","s":"The children shouted with joy at the sight of the big birthday cake on the kitchen table."},{"w":"at the sound of","p":"prep.","d":"at · 慣用語","c":"一聽到","s":"At the sound of the school bell, everyone ran out of the room and hurried to the playground to play."},{"w":"at (時刻) / on (日子) / in (月年)","p":"prep.","d":"at · 易混淆","c":"at 時刻 / on 日期 / in 月年","s":"My piano class starts at seven on Friday, and in July my teacher will give a big show for us."},{"w":"at 3:00 / on Monday / in May","p":"prep.","d":"at · 易混淆","c":"三點／星期一／五月","s":"Let us meet at 3:00 on Monday because in May the library is very crowded in the afternoon."},{"w":"at (地點一點) / in (範圍內) / on (表面)","p":"prep.","d":"at · 易混淆","c":"at 點 / in 內 / on 面","s":"Tom waited at the bus stop, his sister stayed in the car, and their dog slept on the roof."}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"before – behind","cards":[{"w":"before dinner","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"晚餐前","s":"Wash your hands before dinner, and remember to help your grandmother set the plates on the table."},{"w":"the day before yesterday","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"前天","s":"The day before yesterday, we visited the zoo and saw a baby elephant playing with its mother."},{"w":"before long","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"不久之後","s":"Keep practicing the piano every day, and before long you will be able to play your favorite songs."},{"w":"long before","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"很久以前","s":"My grandmother says that long before I was born, this busy street was just a quiet field with cows."},{"w":"before dark","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"天黑前","s":"We should get back to the camp before dark because it is easy to get lost in the mountains at night."},{"w":"the night before","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"前一晚","s":"The night before the big test, Lisa went to bed early instead of watching TV with her brother."},{"w":"ten minutes before the show","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"表演前十分鐘","s":"Please be in your seats ten minutes before the show, because the doors will close when it starts."},{"w":"before it is too late","p":"prep.","d":"before · 時間","c":"趁還來得及","s":"You should see a doctor about your cough before it is too late and you get really sick."},{"w":"stand before the class","p":"prep.","d":"before · 地點","c":"站在全班面前","s":"Jack was nervous when he had to stand before the class and talk about his trip to Japan."},{"w":"before the judge","p":"prep.","d":"before · 地點","c":"在法官面前","s":"The man stood quietly before the judge and said he was sorry for taking the money from the store."},{"w":"put the family before work","p":"prep.","d":"before · 地點","c":"把家庭放在工作之前","s":"My father always puts the family before work, so he never misses our birthday dinners or school shows."},{"w":"right before your eyes","p":"prep.","d":"before · 地點","c":"就在你眼前","s":"The magician made the coin disappear right before your eyes, and nobody in the room knew how he did it."},{"w":"B comes before C","p":"prep.","d":"before · 地點","c":"B 在 C 之前","s":"In the alphabet, B comes before C, so you will find the word bread before the word cake in a dictionary."},{"w":"ladies before gentlemen","p":"prep.","d":"before · 地點","c":"女士優先","s":"My grandfather always opens the door for my grandmother because he believes in ladies before gentlemen."},{"w":"two days before (距某時)","p":"prep.","d":"before · 易混淆","c":"在那之前兩天","s":"Lisa moved to Taipei last May, and two days before the move she said goodbye to all her old friends."},{"w":"behind the door","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 地點","c":"在門後","s":"Your umbrella is behind the door, so please take it with you because it will rain this afternoon."},{"w":"hide behind the tree","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 地點","c":"躲在樹後","s":"During the game of hide and seek, my little brother always tries to hide behind the tree in the yard."},{"w":"sit behind me","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 地點","c":"坐在我後面","s":"In the movie theater, a very tall man came to sit behind me, so he could still see the screen well."},{"w":"the garden behind the house","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 地點","c":"屋後的花園","s":"Every spring, my grandmother grows tomatoes and pretty flowers in the small garden behind the house."},{"w":"look behind you","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 地點","c":"看你後面","s":"Look behind you before you step back, or you might knock over the glass of juice on the small table."},{"w":"the car behind us","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 地點","c":"我們後面的車","s":"The car behind us kept making loud noises, but Dad stayed calm and drove slowly in the heavy rain."},{"w":"fall behind","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"落後","s":"If you miss too many classes when you are sick, you will fall behind and need extra help with math."},{"w":"be behind in one's work","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"工作進度落後","s":"Peter is behind in his work because he spent the whole weekend playing computer games with his friends."},{"w":"leave sb. behind","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"把某人丟下","s":"When we go hiking, we never leave Tom behind, even though he walks much slower than the rest of us."},{"w":"stay behind after class","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"課後留下來","s":"The teacher asked me to stay behind after class because she wanted to talk about my science project."},{"w":"behind the times","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"落伍","s":"My grandfather still sends letters by mail, and my sister says he is behind the times because everyone uses email now."},{"w":"behind one's back","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"背著某人","s":"It is wrong to talk about your friends behind their backs; if you have a problem, tell them directly."},{"w":"the reason behind it","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"背後的原因","s":"Nobody understood the reason behind his sudden decision to leave the soccer team in the middle of the season."},{"w":"be behind the plan","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"是計畫的推手","s":"Everyone loved the school festival, and we learned later that our music teacher was behind the whole plan."},{"w":"ten minutes behind","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"晚了十分鐘","s":"The train was ten minutes behind this morning, so I had to run to school in order not to be late."},{"w":"behind closed doors","p":"prep.","d":"behind · 慣用語","c":"關起門來（祕密地）","s":"The two teachers talked about the new rules behind closed doors, so the students did not know anything about them."}]},{"unit":8,"theme":"below – besides","cards":[{"w":"below the window","p":"prep.","d":"below · 地點","c":"窗戶下方","s":"There is a long wood bench below the window, and my cat loves to sleep there in the warm afternoon sun."},{"w":"below the surface","p":"prep.","d":"below · 地點","c":"表面之下","s":"The lake looked quiet, but below the surface of the water, hundreds of small fish were swimming around the rocks."},{"w":"the valley below","p":"prep.","d":"below · 地點","c":"下方的山谷","s":"From the top of the mountain, we could see the green valley below and a small river running through it."},{"w":"below sea level","p":"prep.","d":"below · 地點","c":"海平面以下","s":"Parts of that country are below sea level, so the people there build strong walls to keep the water out."},{"w":"look below","p":"prep.","d":"below · 地點","c":"看下方","s":"When you stand on the tall bridge and look below, you can see boats moving slowly on the river."},{"w":"see the notes below","p":"prep.","d":"below · 地點","c":"見下方註解","s":"If you do not understand the new words in the story, please see the notes below for their meanings."},{"w":"below zero","p":"prep.","d":"below · 慣用語","c":"零度以下","s":"It was five degrees below zero last night, so the water in the garden turned into ice."},{"w":"children below 12","p":"prep.","d":"below · 慣用語","c":"十二歲以下的孩子","s":"Children below 12 can enter the museum for free, but they must come with a parent or a teacher."},{"w":"below the line","p":"prep.","d":"below · 慣用語","c":"在線以下","s":"Please write your name below the line at the bottom of the page and hand the paper to the teacher."},{"w":"far below","p":"prep.","d":"below · 慣用語","c":"遠低於","s":"His test score was far below the class, so his parents asked an older student to help him after school."},{"w":"the floor below","p":"prep.","d":"below · 慣用語","c":"樓下那一層","s":"The noise from the floor below woke me up at midnight, so I could not sleep well before the test."},{"w":"below the picture (較低處)","p":"prep.","d":"below · 易混淆","c":"在圖下方","s":"The teacher wrote the date below the picture on the board so that everyone could copy it into their notebooks."},{"w":"sit beside me","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 地點","c":"坐在我旁邊","s":"Come and sit beside me on the bus so that we can share my snacks and talk about the game."},{"w":"the house beside the river","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 地點","c":"河邊的房子","s":"My grandmother lives in the white house beside the river, and we often go fishing there in summer."},{"w":"stand beside the door","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 地點","c":"站在門旁","s":"A tall man was standing beside the door, and he smiled and held it open for the old lady."},{"w":"a lamp beside the bed","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 地點","c":"床邊的燈","s":"There is a small lamp beside the bed, so I can read a book for a while before I go to sleep."},{"w":"walk beside her","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 地點","c":"走在她身旁","s":"I like to walk beside her on the way home because she always tells me funny stories about her cat."},{"w":"beside the point","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 地點","c":"離題","s":"The teacher said my answer was beside the point because the question was about history, not science."},{"w":"sit beside him (旁邊)","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 易混淆","c":"坐在他旁邊","s":"At the movie theater, I sat beside him, and we shared a big box of popcorn during the whole film."},{"w":"beside oneself with joy","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 易混淆","c":"高興得忘了自己","s":"When Amy heard that she won first prize in the drawing game, she was beside herself with joy."},{"w":"be beside the point","p":"prep.","d":"beside · 易混淆","c":"與主題無關","s":"What you had for breakfast is beside the point; we are talking about why you were late for school."},{"w":"Besides, it is late.","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 慣用語","c":"此外，很晚了。","s":"We should go home now because it is cold outside. Besides, it is late and Mom is waiting for us."},{"w":"besides me","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 慣用語","c":"除了我之外（還有）","s":"Besides me, three other students in our class also joined the school swimming team this year."},{"w":"What do you do besides study?","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 慣用語","c":"你除了讀書還做什麼？","s":"What do you do besides study on weekends, and do you ever go to the park with your friends?"},{"w":"besides that","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 慣用語","c":"除此之外","s":"The bus is slow and crowded, and besides that, the ticket costs more than the train now."},{"w":"Besides reading, she likes music.","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 慣用語","c":"除了閱讀，她也喜歡音樂。","s":"Besides reading, she likes music, so she plays the piano for an hour every day after dinner."},{"w":"Who else came besides Tom?","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 慣用語","c":"除了湯姆還有誰來？","s":"Who else came to the party besides Tom, and did anyone bring a cake or some drinks?"},{"w":"Besides John, Mary came too.","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 易混淆","c":"除了約翰，瑪麗也來了。","s":"Besides John, Mary came too, so we had enough people to play a game of basketball in the park."},{"w":"besides","p":"prep.","d":"besides · 易混淆","c":"in addition=此外","s":"The food at that restaurant is cheap and delicious, and besides, the waiters are always very friendly to kids."}]},{"unit":9,"theme":"between – beyond","cards":[{"w":"sit between Tom and me","p":"prep.","d":"between · 地點","c":"坐在湯姆和我之間","s":"On the school bus, Jenny always likes to sit between Tom and me because we tell the funniest jokes."},{"w":"the river between the two towns","p":"prep.","d":"between · 地點","c":"兩鎮之間的河","s":"The river between the two towns is very wide, so people have to take a boat to cross it."},{"w":"a wall between the rooms","p":"prep.","d":"between · 地點","c":"房間之間的牆","s":"There is only a thin wall between the rooms, so I can hear my brother playing the guitar at night."},{"w":"between the lines","p":"prep.","d":"between · 地點","c":"字裡行間","s":"The teacher wrote some notes between the lines of my story to show me how to make it better."},{"w":"between the sofa and the wall","p":"prep.","d":"between · 地點","c":"沙發與牆之間","s":"My cat likes to hide between the sofa and the wall when strangers come to visit our house."},{"w":"between eight and nine","p":"prep.","d":"between · 時間","c":"八點到九點之間","s":"The doctor sees patients between eight and nine in the morning, so please arrive early to get a number."},{"w":"between meals","p":"prep.","d":"between · 時間","c":"兩餐之間","s":"My mother says I should not eat too many cookies between meals because they are bad for my teeth."},{"w":"between classes","p":"prep.","d":"between · 時間","c":"下課時間","s":"Between classes, the students usually run to the playground to play basketball for ten minutes."},{"w":"between now and Friday","p":"prep.","d":"between · 時間","c":"從現在到週五之間","s":"You have to finish the science report between now and Friday, or the teacher will not accept it."},{"w":"between 2010 and 2020","p":"prep.","d":"between · 時間","c":"2010 到 2020 年間","s":"Between 2010 and 2020, our small town grew quickly, and many new shops and schools were built."},{"w":"the difference between A and B","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"A 與 B 的差別","s":"Can you tell me the difference between a frog and a fish, because both of them can live in the water?"},{"w":"choose between the two","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"二選一","s":"Mom said I could only have one pet, so I had to choose between the puppy and the rabbit."},{"w":"share the money between us","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"我們兩人分這筆錢","s":"We found a hundred dollars on the street and gave it to the police instead of sharing the money between us."},{"w":"a friendship between them","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"他們之間的友情","s":"A strong friendship between them began when they sat together in the first grade of the same school."},{"w":"between jobs","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"待業中","s":"My uncle is between jobs right now, so he has more time to take us to the beach this summer."},{"w":"few and far between","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"少之又少","s":"Sunny days are few and far between in winter here, so we go out to play whenever the sun comes out."},{"w":"in between","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"在中間","s":"The movie theater is at the end of the street, and a bookstore and a bakery are in between."},{"w":"read between the lines","p":"prep.","d":"between · 慣用語","c":"領會言外之意","s":"When my sister said she was fine, I could read between the lines and knew she was still sad."},{"w":"between A and B (不用 to)","p":"prep.","d":"between · 易混淆","c":"A 和 B 之間（不用 to）","s":"The library is open between nine and five on weekdays, but it closes at noon on Saturdays and Sundays."},{"w":"between Monday and Friday","p":"prep.","d":"between · 易混淆","c":"週一到週五之間","s":"My father works between Monday and Friday, but on the weekend he takes us to the mountains or the beach."},{"w":"beyond the river","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 地點","c":"河的另一邊","s":"My grandmother lives in a small village beyond the river, so we take a boat to visit her every holiday."},{"w":"beyond the mountains","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 地點","c":"山的那一邊","s":"Beyond the mountains, there is a beautiful lake where many families go camping in the summer."},{"w":"the town beyond the hill","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 地點","c":"山丘外的小鎮","s":"The town beyond the hill has a famous night market, and my cousin takes me there every Saturday."},{"w":"look beyond the sea","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 地點","c":"望向海的遠方","s":"We stood on the beach and looked beyond the sea, hoping to see the ship bringing Dad home."},{"w":"beyond the city","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 地點","c":"城外","s":"My aunt lives beyond the city, where the air is fresh and you can see stars at night."},{"w":"beyond words","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"無法用言語形容","s":"The evening sky over the sea was beautiful beyond words, so we just stood there quietly and watched it."},{"w":"beyond control","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"無法控制","s":"The fire spread so fast that it was soon beyond control, and everyone had to leave the building quickly."},{"w":"beyond repair","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"無法修理","s":"My old bike is beyond repair after the accident, so Dad says he will buy me a new one next month."},{"w":"beyond one's reach","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"拿不到","s":"Mom keeps the cookies on the top shelf, beyond my little brother's reach, so he cannot eat them all."},{"w":"beyond my power","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"超出我的能力","s":"Fixing the computer is beyond my power, so we should ask my uncle, who knows a lot about machines."},{"w":"beyond doubt","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"毫無疑問","s":"It is beyond doubt that Jenny is the best swimmer in our school, because she wins every race."},{"w":"beyond ten o'clock","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"十點以後","s":"The store does not stay open beyond ten o'clock, so we need to buy the milk before it closes."},{"w":"and beyond","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"以及更遠的未來","s":"Our teacher hopes we will keep learning English in high school, in college, and beyond."},{"w":"go beyond the limit","p":"prep.","d":"beyond · 慣用語","c":"超過限度","s":"If you go beyond the limit of two hours of screen time, your eyes will feel tired and dry."}]},{"unit":10,"theme":"by (1)","cards":[{"w":"by ten o'clock","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"十點前","s":"Please finish your homework by ten o'clock tonight, or you will be too tired to get up for school tomorrow."},{"w":"by tomorrow","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"明天以前","s":"The teacher told us to hand in our book reports by tomorrow, so I have to finish reading tonight."},{"w":"by the end of the week","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"週末前","s":"By the end of the week, we must choose a topic for our science project and tell the teacher."},{"w":"by then","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"到那時候","s":"The train leaves at six, and by then we will have packed our bags and said goodbye to Grandma."},{"w":"by now","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"到現在","s":"The bus left an hour ago, so my brother should be at the airport by now and waiting for his flight."},{"w":"by the time I got home","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"我到家時","s":"By the time I got home, my family had already finished dinner, so I ate the noodles alone in the kitchen."},{"w":"by day","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"白天","s":"Owls sleep by day and hunt for food at night, which is why we rarely see them in the park."},{"w":"by night","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"夜間","s":"The city looks completely different by night, with bright lights shining from every tall building and shop."},{"w":"day by day","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"一天天地","s":"Day by day, the little plant on my desk grew taller, and finally a small yellow flower appeared."},{"w":"little by little","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"一點一點地","s":"Little by little, my grandfather learned to use his new phone, and now he sends us pictures every day."},{"w":"one by one","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"一個一個地","s":"The students walked up to the stage one by one to receive their prizes from the school principal."},{"w":"by the hour","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"按小時","s":"My cousin works at the coffee shop and gets paid by the hour, so she tries to work longer on weekends."},{"w":"step by step","p":"prep.","d":"by · 時間","c":"一步一步","s":"The teacher showed us step by step how to make a paper boat, and soon everyone had a boat of their own."},{"w":"sit by the window","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"坐在窗邊","s":"I always like to sit by the window on the train so that I can watch the mountains and rice fields."},{"w":"a house by the sea","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"海邊的房子","s":"My dream is to live in a small house by the sea, where I can hear the waves every morning."},{"w":"stand by the door","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"站在門邊","s":"A guard stands by the door of the bank all day to keep the customers and the money safe."},{"w":"by the river","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"在河邊","s":"Every Sunday afternoon, my family has a picnic by the river and feeds bread to the ducks."},{"w":"pass by the shop","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"經過商店","s":"When I pass by the shop on my way home, I always stop to look at the toys in the window."},{"w":"walk by","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"走過","s":"An old man walked by slowly with his dog, and he smiled at us when we said good morning."},{"w":"close by","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"在附近","s":"My best friend lives close by, so we ride our bikes to school together every morning."},{"w":"by my side","p":"prep.","d":"by · 地點","c":"在我身邊","s":"When I was sick in the hospital, my mother stayed by my side all night and held my hand."},{"w":"by bus","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"搭公車","s":"It takes about thirty minutes to get to the museum by bus, but it is much faster if you take the MRT."},{"w":"by train","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"搭火車","s":"We are going to Tainan by train this weekend because the trip is cheaper and we can enjoy the view."},{"w":"by car","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"開車","s":"My father usually goes to work by car, but today he took the bus because the car needed repairs."},{"w":"by bike","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"騎腳踏車","s":"Many students in our school come to class by bike because it is good exercise and saves money."},{"w":"by plane","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"搭飛機","s":"Traveling to Japan by plane takes only three hours, so we can arrive before lunch and start our trip."},{"w":"by boat","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"搭船","s":"To visit the small island, you must go by boat because there is no bridge or airport there."},{"w":"by hand","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"用手工","s":"My grandmother makes all her sweaters by hand, and each one takes her about two weeks to finish."},{"w":"by mail","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"郵寄","s":"I sent the birthday card to my aunt by mail, and she said it arrived just in time for her party."},{"w":"by phone","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"用電話","s":"Mom ordered a pizza by phone, and a young man brought it to our door in just twenty minutes."},{"w":"by email","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"用電子郵件","s":"Our teacher sends us the homework by email every Friday, so we can check it even when we are at home."},{"w":"by check","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"用支票","s":"My father paid for the new refrigerator by check because he did not want to carry so much cash."},{"w":"by credit card","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"用信用卡","s":"Many people pay by credit card at the supermarket now, but my grandmother still likes to use cash."},{"w":"pay by cash (常誤) → pay in cash","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"用現金（正確說法）","s":"Some students say pay by cash by mistake, but the correct way is to say that we pay in cash."},{"w":"by heart","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"記住","s":"I learned the whole poem by heart last night, so I can say it in front of the class without looking."},{"w":"by mistake","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"不小心","s":"I took my sister's umbrella by mistake this morning because it looks almost the same as mine."},{"w":"by accident","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"意外地","s":"The famous cookie was invented by accident when a baker put the wrong kind of chocolate in the cake mix."},{"w":"by chance","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"碰巧","s":"I met my old teacher by chance at the night market, and we talked about my first year at school."},{"w":"by the way","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"順便一提","s":"By the way, did you remember to bring the tickets for the movie, or are they still at home?"},{"w":"by oneself","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"獨自","s":"Since my parents both work late, I often have to cook dinner and eat by myself on weekdays."}]},{"unit":11,"theme":"by (2) – down (1)","cards":[{"w":"by weight","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"按重量","s":"At the fruit stand, apples and oranges are sold by weight, so bigger fruit usually costs more money."},{"w":"by name","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"按名字","s":"Our new teacher is very kind, and she already knows every student in the class by name after only two days."},{"w":"a book by Mark Twain","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"馬克吐溫寫的書","s":"My brother is reading a book by Mark Twain for his English class, and he says the story is really funny."},{"w":"a song by the band","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"這個樂團的歌","s":"We listened to a song by the band on the radio this morning, and now I cannot stop singing it."},{"w":"be hit by a car","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"被車撞","s":"Please look both ways before you cross the road, because a boy was hit by a car near our school last week."},{"w":"be made by hand","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"手工製作","s":"These little cookies are made by hand in my grandmother's kitchen, so each one looks a little different."},{"w":"be surprised by the news","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"對消息感到驚訝","s":"Everyone in the office was surprised by the news that our quiet manager was going to get married next month."},{"w":"by far","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"遠遠地","s":"Of all the restaurants in this town, the small noodle shop near the station is by far the most popular."},{"w":"by all means","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"務必","s":"If you want to borrow my bike this weekend, by all means take it, because I will be busy at home anyway."},{"w":"by no means","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"絕不","s":"The math test was by no means easy, so most of the students in my class needed the whole hour to finish it."},{"w":"by the sea","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"在海邊","s":"My aunt lives in a small white house by the sea, and we can hear the waves from her bedroom window at night."},{"w":"by nature","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"天生","s":"My little sister is shy by nature, so she often hides behind my mother when she meets new people."},{"w":"by birth","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"出生起","s":"Although Mr. Lin is Japanese by birth, he has lived in Taiwan for twenty years and speaks Chinese very well."},{"w":"by law","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"依法","s":"By law, everyone who rides a motorcycle in Taiwan must wear a hat for safety, or they will have to pay money."},{"w":"by the rules","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"按規定","s":"Our coach always tells us to play by the rules, because winning a game is not important if we cheat."},{"w":"by myself","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"靠我自己","s":"I finished the whole science project by myself last night, so I feel very proud of my work today."},{"w":"three by three","p":"prep.","d":"by · 方式","c":"三乘三","s":"The teacher drew a big square on the board and divided it into three by three smaller boxes for our game."},{"w":"Finish it by Friday.","p":"prep.","d":"by · 易混淆","c":"週五前完成。","s":"Our teacher asked us to finish the English report by Friday, so my group will meet after school every day."},{"w":"on foot (不用 by)","p":"prep.","d":"by · 易混淆","c":"走路","s":"My father goes to work by bus, but because the bookstore is only five minutes away, I always go there on foot."},{"w":"send it by mail","p":"prep.","d":"by · 易混淆","c":"郵寄","s":"Instead of sending the photos by email, my grandfather likes to send them by mail in a big brown envelope."},{"w":"be written by him","p":"prep.","d":"by · 易混淆","c":"由他所寫","s":"This poem was written by him when he was only twelve, and now every student in our school reads it."},{"w":"by far the best","p":"prep.","d":"by · 易混淆","c":"到目前為止最好的","s":"Of all the movies we watched this summer, the one about the lost dog was by far the best, and we all cried."},{"w":"go down the stairs","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"走下樓梯","s":"Be careful when you go down the stairs at night, because the light at the bottom has not worked for a week."},{"w":"walk down the street","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"沿街走","s":"Every Sunday morning, my grandfather and I walk down the street to buy fresh bread and hot milk tea."},{"w":"fall down the hill","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"滾下山坡","s":"The little boy lost his ball and almost fell down the hill while he was running after it in the park."},{"w":"down the road","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"沿路過去","s":"There is a small night market just down the road from our school, and the fried chicken there is delicious."},{"w":"roll down the hill","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"滾下山坡","s":"We watched the big orange ball roll down the hill, and the dog chased it all the way to the river."},{"w":"down the river","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"順流而下","s":"The boat moved slowly down the river, and we saw many white birds standing in the water along the way."},{"w":"down the hall","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"沿走廊走","s":"The nurse told us to walk down the hall and turn left, because the doctor's room is at the very end."},{"w":"look down the well","p":"prep.","d":"down · 地點","c":"往井下看","s":"The children stood at the edge to look down the well, but it was so deep and dark that they could not see the water."},{"w":"sit down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"坐下","s":"When the teacher walked into the room, she asked everyone to sit down quickly and take out their English books."},{"w":"lie down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"躺下","s":"After playing basketball for two hours in the hot sun, Jack went home and lay down on the sofa for a rest."},{"w":"turn down the TV","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"把電視關小聲","s":"Could you please turn down the TV a little, because the baby is sleeping in the next room and might wake up?"},{"w":"turn down the offer","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"拒絕提議","s":"My father decided to turn down the offer of a new job in Japan because he did not want to leave our family."},{"w":"write down the number","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"寫下號碼","s":"Please write down the number of the shop on this piece of paper, so we can call them if the cake is late."},{"w":"put down the pen","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"放下筆","s":"When the bell rang, the teacher told us to put down the pen at once and pass our test papers to the front."},{"w":"calm down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"冷靜下來","s":"My sister was so angry about the broken phone that it took her an hour to calm down and talk to us again."},{"w":"slow down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"慢下來","s":"The road was wet after the heavy rain, so Dad told the taxi driver to slow down near the school."},{"w":"break down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"故障","s":"Our old washing machine finally broke down last night, so we had to wash all the clothes by hand this morning."},{"w":"cut down on sugar","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"減少吃糖","s":"The doctor told my uncle to cut down on sugar and sweet drinks, because he has gained too much weight this year."}]},{"unit":12,"theme":"down (2)","cards":[{"w":"let sb. down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"讓某人失望","s":"I promised to help Tom with his science project, so I cannot let him down just because I want to watch TV tonight."},{"w":"look down on sb.","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"看不起某人","s":"You should never look down on people who have less money than you, because everyone has something to teach us."},{"w":"come down with a cold","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"感冒了","s":"Mary came down with a cold after she played in the rain, so she stayed home from school for two days."},{"w":"settle down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"安頓下來","s":"After moving to five different cities, my uncle finally decided to settle down in a quiet town near the mountains."},{"w":"fall down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"跌倒","s":"The floor in the kitchen was wet, and my little brother fell down and started to cry very loudly."},{"w":"get down to work","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"開始認真工作","s":"Stop playing games on your phone and get down to work, because the big test is only three days away."},{"w":"burn down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"燒毀","s":"The old house at the end of our street burned down last night, but luckily nobody was hurt in the fire."},{"w":"pull down the old house","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"拆掉舊房子","s":"The city plans to pull down the old house next to the park and build a new library for the children there."},{"w":"take down the notes","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"記下筆記","s":"During the class, I always take down the notes carefully, so I can study them again before the test."},{"w":"back down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"退讓","s":"The two boys argued about the game for an hour, but neither of them would back down and say sorry first."},{"w":"close down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"關閉","s":"The little toy shop near my school had to close down last month because fewer and fewer people shopped there."},{"w":"cool down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"冷卻；冷靜","s":"Let the soup cool down for a few minutes before you drink it, or you will burn your tongue again like yesterday."},{"w":"go down (price)","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"（價格）下跌","s":"The price of vegetables will go down after the typhoon season ends, so Mom is waiting to buy more then."},{"w":"knock down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"撞倒","s":"A fast motorcycle almost knocked down an old woman on the street this morning, but luckily she jumped back in time."},{"w":"bring down the price","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"降價","s":"The shop owner agreed to bring down the price of the bike by two hundred dollars because it had a small mark on it."},{"w":"hold down a job","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"保住工作","s":"My cousin found it hard to hold down a job because he was always late for work and argued with his boss."},{"w":"shut down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"關閉","s":"The factory near the river had to shut down for a month because it was making the water dirty and smell bad."},{"w":"stand down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"退下","s":"After the two teams finished the game, the coach told the players to stand down and let the next group practice."},{"w":"keep the noise down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"保持安靜","s":"Mom asked us to keep the noise down while Grandpa was sleeping in the next room after lunch."},{"w":"upside down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 片語動詞","c":"上下顛倒","s":"My little sister held the picture book upside down and laughed because all the animals looked like they were falling."},{"w":"be down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"心情低落","s":"Jenny has been down all week because her best friend moved to another city, so let's invite her to the movies."},{"w":"feel down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"覺得沮喪","s":"Whenever I feel down after a bad test, my mother makes my favorite noodles and tells me funny stories."},{"w":"down with the flu","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"因流感而病倒","s":"Half of the players on our basketball team are down with the flu, so the game on Saturday has been cancelled."},{"w":"down to earth","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"腳踏實地","s":"Although Mr. Wang is a famous singer, he is very down to earth and still eats at the same little night market."},{"w":"down to the last one","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"直到最後一個","s":"The cookies were so delicious that my brother and I ate them down to the last one before Dad came home."},{"w":"be down to two choices","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"只剩兩個選擇","s":"After talking for an hour, we are down to two choices for our class trip, the zoo or the beach."},{"w":"Down with the king!","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"打倒國王！","s":"In the story, the angry people marched to the castle and shouted Down with the king because he took all their food."},{"w":"count down","p":"prep.","d":"down · 慣用語","c":"倒數","s":"On New Year's Eve, the whole family stood in front of the TV and began to count down from ten together."}]},{"unit":13,"theme":"during – for (1)","cards":[{"w":"during the summer","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"在夏天期間","s":"During the summer, my family usually goes to the beach in the south, and we swim in the sea every morning."},{"w":"during the class","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"上課時","s":"Please do not talk to your friends during the class, because the other students cannot hear what the teacher says."},{"w":"during the night","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"夜裡","s":"It rained heavily during the night, so the playground was full of water when we got to school this morning."},{"w":"during the meeting","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"會議期間","s":"My father turned off his phone during the meeting, so he did not see my message about the school play until later."},{"w":"during lunch","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"午餐時","s":"Our teacher let us watch a short English movie during lunch today, and everyone ate quietly for once."},{"w":"during the trip","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"旅途中","s":"We took hundreds of pictures during the trip to Japan, and my favorite one shows my sister eating a big ice cream."},{"w":"during the day","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"白天","s":"My grandmother sleeps very little during the day because she likes to work in her garden and talk with her neighbors."},{"w":"during the war","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"戰時","s":"During the war, my great-grandfather had very little food, so he never wastes even one bowl of rice today."},{"w":"during the show","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"表演期間","s":"Please turn off your phones during the show, because the bright light will bother the people sitting behind you."},{"w":"during the week","p":"prep.","d":"during · 時間","c":"平日","s":"I have to get up at six during the week, but on Saturday and Sunday I can sleep until ten."},{"w":"during the meal","p":"prep.","d":"during · 易混淆","c":"用餐時","s":"Nobody in my family is allowed to use a phone during the meal, so we talk about our day at school instead."},{"w":"during the night (時段)","p":"prep.","d":"during · 易混淆","c":"夜間","s":"The baby woke up three times during the night, so my aunt looked very tired at breakfast this morning."},{"w":"everyone except me","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"除了我每個人","s":"Everyone except me went to the night market after the game, because I had to go home and finish my homework."},{"w":"every day except Sunday","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"除了週日每天","s":"The small bakery near our house opens early every day except Sunday, when the owner goes to church with his family."},{"w":"except for the rain","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"除了下雨以外","s":"Except for the rain on the last day, our trip to the mountains was perfect, and we all want to go again next year."},{"w":"nothing except water","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"除了水什麼都沒有","s":"The doctor told my father to drink nothing except water for one day before he goes to the hospital for the test."},{"w":"do anything except study","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"什麼都做就是不讀書","s":"On weekends my lazy brother will do anything except study, so he cleans his room and even washes the dog."},{"w":"all except one","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"除了一個以外全部","s":"All except one of the students passed the English test, and the teacher promised to help that student after class."},{"w":"except that it was cold","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"只不過天氣冷","s":"The picnic by the lake was really fun, except that it was cold, so we drank hot tea to keep warm."},{"w":"except when it rains","p":"prep.","d":"except · 慣用語","c":"除了下雨的時候","s":"My grandfather walks in the park every morning except when it rains, and then he does exercises at home instead."},{"w":"Except for Tom, everyone came.","p":"prep.","d":"except · 易混淆","c":"除了湯姆，大家都來了。","s":"Except for Tom, everyone came to the party on time, because he missed the bus and had to walk all the way."},{"w":"for three hours","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"三小時","s":"We waited for three hours at the airport because the plane was late, and my little brother slept the whole time."},{"w":"for a long time","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"很長一段時間","s":"My grandfather and grandmother have lived in the same old house by the river for a long time, and they never want to move."},{"w":"for a while","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"一會兒","s":"After the long walk up the mountain, we sat down on a big rock for a while and enjoyed the cool wind."},{"w":"for ages","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"很久","s":"I have not seen my cousin for ages, so I was really excited when she called to say she was visiting this weekend."},{"w":"for the first time","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"第一次","s":"Yesterday my little sister rode a bike without help for the first time, and she laughed all the way down the street."},{"w":"for the moment","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"目前","s":"For the moment, we are staying at my aunt's house, but we will move into our new apartment at the end of May."},{"w":"for now","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"暫時","s":"For now, please put your bags under your desks, and I will tell you where to leave them after the meeting."},{"w":"for ever","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"永遠","s":"When I was a child, I thought my grandfather would live for ever, so I was very sad when he got sick."},{"w":"for good","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"永遠地","s":"After the terrible typhoon, my uncle decided to leave the small island for good and move to Kaohsiung with his family."},{"w":"for life","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"終生","s":"My grandmother says that a good book can be a friend for life, so she still keeps her favorite one from school."},{"w":"for the time being","p":"prep.","d":"for · 時間","c":"目前","s":"The computer room is closed for the time being, so students must use the library computers to finish their reports."},{"w":"a gift for you","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"給你的禮物","s":"I made a gift for you with my own hands, and I hope you will like the little blue bird on the card."},{"w":"a letter for me","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"給我的信","s":"There was a letter for me on the kitchen table this morning, and it came all the way from my friend in Japan."},{"w":"leave for Taipei","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"出發去台北","s":"We have to leave for Taipei at six tomorrow morning, so please pack your bags and go to bed early tonight."},{"w":"the train for Tainan","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"開往台南的火車","s":"The train for Tainan leaves from platform two in ten minutes, so we should hurry and buy our tickets now."},{"w":"wait for the bus","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"等公車","s":"Every morning I wait for the bus with my neighbor Lily, and we talk about our favorite TV shows until it comes."},{"w":"look for the keys","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"找鑰匙","s":"Dad spent twenty minutes looking for the keys this morning, and in the end he found them in his coat pocket."},{"w":"ask for help","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"請求幫助","s":"If you do not understand the homework, you should ask for help from the teacher instead of copying from a friend."},{"w":"pay for the meal","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"付餐費","s":"My uncle always wants to pay for the meal when we eat out, but this time my father got to the counter first."}]},{"unit":14,"theme":"for (2)","cards":[{"w":"thank you for coming","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"謝謝你來","s":"Thank you for coming to my birthday party tonight, and I hope you enjoyed the chocolate cake my mother made."},{"w":"for sale","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"出售","s":"The red house across the street has been for sale for six months, but nobody wants to buy it because it is so old."},{"w":"for rent","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"出租","s":"My aunt has a small apartment for rent near the university, so many college students come to look at it every week."},{"w":"for free","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"免費","s":"The museum is open for free on the first Sunday of every month, so my class is planning to visit it together."},{"w":"for fun","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"為了好玩","s":"On Saturday afternoons, my friends and I play basketball just for fun, and nobody cares who wins or loses."},{"w":"for example","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"例如","s":"Many foods are good for your eyes, for example carrots, eggs and fish, so you should eat them more often."},{"w":"for instance","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"例如","s":"My brother is interested in many sports, for instance swimming, baseball and tennis, so he is never bored on weekends."},{"w":"for sure","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"肯定","s":"I do not know if it will rain tomorrow, but for sure it will be very hot, so bring a hat and some water."},{"w":"for a change","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"換換口味","s":"We always eat rice for dinner, so tonight Mom is going to cook noodles with tomato and beef for a change."},{"w":"for the weekend","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"為了週末","s":"What are your plans for the weekend, because my family is going to the beach and you are welcome to join us?"},{"w":"for breakfast","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"當早餐","s":"My father usually has an egg and a cup of coffee for breakfast, but on Sundays he makes sandwiches for everyone."},{"w":"What is this for?","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"這是做什麼用的？","s":"When my grandmother saw the strange little machine in the kitchen, she asked my brother, What is this for?"},{"w":"good for your health","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"對健康有益","s":"Doctors say that walking for thirty minutes every day is good for your health, so my parents walk after dinner."},{"w":"bad for your eyes","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"對眼睛不好","s":"Reading in the dark is bad for your eyes, so please turn on the lamp before you open your comic book."},{"w":"be famous for","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"以…聞名","s":"The small town where my grandfather lives is famous for its sweet pineapple cakes, and visitors buy them every day."},{"w":"be known for","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"以…著稱","s":"Our English teacher is known for her funny jokes, so nobody ever falls asleep in her class, even after lunch."},{"w":"be late for school","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"上學遲到","s":"I was late for school again this morning because I forgot to set my alarm clock before I went to bed."},{"w":"be ready for the test","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"準備好考試","s":"I studied for three hours last night, so I feel ready for the test and I am not nervous at all today."},{"w":"be sorry for","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"為…感到抱歉","s":"Tom felt sorry for breaking his sister's favorite cup, so he bought her a new one with his pocket money."},{"w":"a table for two","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"兩人桌","s":"When we walked into the restaurant, my father asked the waiter for a table for two by the window with a view."},{"w":"for one thing","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"一方面","s":"I do not want to join the baseball team, because for one thing, practice is every day, and I need time to study."},{"w":"for another","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"另一方面","s":"For one thing, the new phone is too expensive, and for another, my old one still works fine, so I will wait."},{"w":"for short","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"簡稱","s":"My brother's full name is Alexander, but everyone at school calls him Alex for short because it is easier to say."},{"w":"for a living","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"謀生","s":"My uncle sells fruit at the market for a living, and he gets up at four every morning to pick the best apples."},{"w":"for the sake of","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"為了","s":"My mother stopped eating sweets for the sake of her health, and now she feels much better and has more energy."},{"w":"for the most part","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"大部分","s":"For the most part, the students in my class are friendly, so new students usually feel at home after a few days."},{"w":"for a reason","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"有原因","s":"My mother always says things happen for a reason, so when I missed the bus, I just read a book and waited calmly."},{"w":"for nothing","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"白白地","s":"We waited in the rain for an hour for nothing, because the store had already sold out of the game we wanted."},{"w":"for all I know","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"據我所知","s":"For all I know, the new student might be from Japan, because I heard him talking to his mother on the phone yesterday."},{"w":"for once","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"就這一次","s":"My brother is always late for dinner, but for once he came home early tonight and even helped Mom set the table."},{"w":"for real","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"真的","s":"At first I thought Peter was joking, but he is leaving for America for real next month, and his family has already packed."},{"w":"for the best","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"為了最好的結果","s":"Moving to a new school was hard, but my parents told me it was for the best, and now I have many good friends."},{"w":"for your information","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"供你參考","s":"For your information, the library will close early this Friday, so you should return your books before three o'clock."},{"w":"be in for","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"即將遭遇","s":"If you forget to study for the big test again, you are in for a hard time when your parents see your grades."},{"w":"run for president","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"競選總統","s":"In social studies class we learned that anyone over forty can run for president in our country, and we found that exciting."},{"w":"too big for me","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"對我來說太大","s":"This jacket is too big for me, so could you please bring me a smaller size in the same blue color?"},{"w":"for 100 dollars","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"以一百元","s":"My sister bought a used bike for 100 dollars at the weekend market, and it still rides as well as a new one."},{"w":"word for word","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"逐字地","s":"Our teacher told us not to copy the story word for word, but to write the ideas in our own simple English."},{"w":"once and for all","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"一次解決","s":"Let's clean up the dirty room once and for all today, so we do not have to argue about it every single weekend."},{"w":"a feel for music","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"對音樂的感覺","s":"My little cousin has a real feel for music, because she can play any song on the piano after hearing it only once."}]},{"unit":15,"theme":"for (3) – from (1)","cards":[{"w":"have an eye for","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"有鑑賞眼光","s":"My mother has an eye for pretty clothes, so my friends always ask her for advice before they go shopping."},{"w":"take sb. for a fool","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"把某人當傻瓜","s":"Do not take me for a fool, because I know you ate the last cookie even though you said the dog did it."},{"w":"for the life of me","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"怎麼也（不能）","s":"For the life of me, I cannot remember where I put my new glasses, and I have looked in every room of the house."},{"w":"for all","p":"prep.","d":"for · 方式","c":"儘管","s":"For all his money and big house, my rich uncle often says that he is less happy than my parents in their small apartment."},{"w":"for two years","p":"prep.","d":"for · 易混淆","c":"兩年了","s":"Mr. Chen has taught English at our school for two years, and all his students say his classes are never boring."},{"w":"leave Taipei for Tokyo","p":"prep.","d":"for · 易混淆","c":"離開台北前往東京","s":"My aunt will leave Taipei for Tokyo next Monday because she found a new job at a hotel there."},{"w":"It is kind of you (不用 for)","p":"prep.","d":"for · 易混淆","c":"你真好心","s":"It is very kind of you to carry my heavy bags for me, because my arm still hurts from the fall last week."},{"w":"It is easy for me","p":"prep.","d":"for · 易混淆","c":"對我來說很容易","s":"It is easy for me to wake up early, but for my brother it is almost impossible without three alarm clocks."},{"w":"come from Taiwan","p":"prep.","d":"from · 地點","c":"來自台灣","s":"The new girl in our class comes from Taiwan, but she has lived in America for five years, so her English is very good."},{"w":"far from here","p":"prep.","d":"from · 地點","c":"離這裡很遠","s":"The new shopping center is not far from here, so we can walk there in ten minutes after we finish lunch."},{"w":"from here to there","p":"prep.","d":"from · 地點","c":"從這裡到那裡","s":"The teacher asked us to measure the distance from here to there, and we found it was about twenty meters."},{"w":"a letter from Mom","p":"prep.","d":"from · 地點","c":"媽媽寄來的信","s":"When I opened my lunch box at school, I found a short letter from Mom that said she was proud of me."},{"w":"the view from the top","p":"prep.","d":"from · 地點","c":"從山頂看的景色","s":"After climbing for three hours, we finally enjoyed the view from the top, and the whole city looked like a toy."},{"w":"fall from the tree","p":"prep.","d":"from · 地點","c":"從樹上掉下來","s":"The little bird tried to fly but fell from the tree, so my brother carefully picked it up and put it back."},{"w":"across from the park","p":"prep.","d":"from · 地點","c":"在公園對面","s":"The new ice cream shop is right across from the park, so we can buy some ice cream and eat it on the grass."},{"w":"from Monday to Friday","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從週一到週五","s":"My mother works at the bank from Monday to Friday, so she only has time to go shopping with us on weekends."},{"w":"from nine to five","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從九點到五點","s":"My father works from nine to five at a small company, and he always comes home in time for dinner with us."},{"w":"from now on","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從現在起","s":"From now on, I will finish my homework before I play computer games, because my grades have dropped this semester."},{"w":"from then on","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從那時起","s":"Jenny failed her first English test last year, and from then on she studied hard every night after dinner."},{"w":"from time to time","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"偶爾","s":"My grandfather lives in Tainan, but he comes to Taipei from time to time to visit us on weekends."},{"w":"from day to day","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"日復一日","s":"The weather here changes from day to day, so I always check it before I leave home in the morning."},{"w":"from the start","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從一開始","s":"From the start of the game, our team played very well, and we finally won by ten points."},{"w":"from morning till night","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從早到晚","s":"My mother works in the restaurant from morning till night, so she is always very tired on weekends."},{"w":"from the beginning","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從頭開始","s":"I missed the first part of the movie, so could you tell me the story from the beginning?"},{"w":"from that day on","p":"prep.","d":"from · 時間","c":"從那天起","s":"Peter got a puppy on his birthday, and from that day on he walked it every afternoon after school."},{"w":"be different from","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"與…不同","s":"Life in the country is very different from life in the city because it is quiet and slow."},{"w":"be far from perfect","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"離完美很遠","s":"My English is far from perfect, but I am not afraid to talk to foreign visitors at the night market."},{"w":"keep away from","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"遠離","s":"The doctor told my father to keep away from sweet food because he has some health problems now."},{"w":"stay away from the dog","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"離那隻狗遠一點","s":"Stay away from the dog in the yard, because it does not like strangers and may bite you."},{"w":"tell A from B","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"分辨 A 與 B","s":"The two sisters look so much alike that even their teacher cannot tell Amy from Annie in class."},{"w":"know right from wrong","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"分辨對錯","s":"Children should learn to know right from wrong when they are young, so parents must teach them well."},{"w":"die from hunger","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"死於飢餓","s":"In some poor countries, many children still die from hunger because they do not have enough food to eat."},{"w":"be free from pain","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"沒有痛苦","s":"After taking the medicine for three days, my grandmother is finally free from pain and can walk again."},{"w":"be absent from school","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"缺課","s":"Kevin was absent from school for a week because he had a bad cold and a high fever."},{"w":"borrow money from him","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"向他借錢","s":"I left my wallet at home this morning, so I had to borrow money from him to buy lunch."},{"w":"learn from mistakes","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"從錯誤中學習","s":"We all make mistakes, but a smart student learns from mistakes and does not make them a second time."},{"w":"stop sb. from doing","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"阻止某人做","s":"The heavy rain stopped us from playing basketball, so we stayed in the room and played cards together."},{"w":"keep sb. from doing","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"使某人無法做","s":"The loud music next door kept me from sleeping, so I felt very tired at school this morning."},{"w":"protect from the sun","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"防曬","s":"Please wear a hat and put on some cream to protect your skin from the sun at the beach."},{"w":"hide from the rain","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"躲雨","s":"It suddenly started to rain very hard, so we ran into a small store to hide from the rain."}]},{"unit":16,"theme":"from (2) – in (1)","cards":[{"w":"hear from sb.","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"收到某人的消息","s":"I have not heard from my cousin since she moved to Japan, so I will write to her tonight."},{"w":"from my point of view","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"以我的觀點","s":"From my point of view, students should not use their phones in class because they cannot pay attention."},{"w":"from the look of it","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"從外表看來","s":"From the look of it, the cake in the window is very sweet, but we should ask the price first."},{"w":"from head to toe","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"從頭到腳","s":"After the game in the rain, the boys were dirty and wet from head to toe, so Mom was not happy."},{"w":"from house to house","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"一家一家地","s":"On Halloween night, the children went from house to house and asked for candy in their funny clothes."},{"w":"from side to side","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"左右搖晃","s":"The little boat moved from side to side on the big waves, and some people on it got sick."},{"w":"from A to Z","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"從頭到尾","s":"My grandmother knows everything about cooking from A to Z, so I always ask her for help in the kitchen."},{"w":"a week from today","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"一週後的今天","s":"The big test is a week from today, so we should start to study for it right now."},{"w":"from scratch","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"從零開始","s":"My aunt baked the birthday cake from scratch instead of buying one, and it tasted really great."},{"w":"from the heart","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"發自內心","s":"Her thank-you letter was written from the heart, and the teacher almost cried when she read it."},{"w":"from what I hear","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"就我聽到的","s":"From what I hear, the new restaurant near our school is cheap, and the noodles there are very good."},{"w":"make a living from","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"靠…謀生","s":"Mr. Lin makes a living from selling fruit at the night market, and he works six days a week."},{"w":"be away from home","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"離家在外","s":"When I was away from home at summer camp, I missed my mother's cooking very much every day."},{"w":"be tired from running","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"因跑步而疲累","s":"The students were tired from running around the track, so they sat down under a tree to rest."},{"w":"recover from a cold","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"感冒痊癒","s":"It took my little brother a whole week to recover from a cold, so he missed many classes."},{"w":"order a book from the store","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"向書店訂書","s":"I ordered a book from the store last Monday, but it still has not arrived at my house."},{"w":"choose from the list","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"從清單中選","s":"You can choose any two dishes from the list on the menu, and the soup is free today."},{"w":"from memory","p":"prep.","d":"from · 慣用語","c":"憑記憶","s":"Jason can say the names of all fifty states of America from memory, which surprises everyone in his class."},{"w":"wine is made from grapes","p":"prep.","d":"from · 易混淆","c":"酒由葡萄製成","s":"Wine is made from grapes, and my uncle grows many grapes on his farm in the mountains every year."},{"w":"from 9 to 5","p":"prep.","d":"from · 易混淆","c":"從九點到五點","s":"My father works in an office from 9 to 5, and he usually gets home at about six thirty."},{"w":"be different from (非 than)","p":"prep.","d":"from · 易混淆","c":"與…不同（不用 than）","s":"Your answer is different from mine, so let us check the book to find out who is right."},{"w":"in the morning","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在早上","s":"My father goes jogging in the park in the morning before he drives to his office in the city."},{"w":"in the afternoon","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在下午","s":"We usually play basketball in the afternoon after school, and then we buy cold drinks at the store nearby."},{"w":"in the evening","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在傍晚","s":"My family likes to take a walk by the river in the evening because the air is cool and fresh."},{"w":"in May","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在五月","s":"Mother's Day is in May, so my sister and I are planning a special dinner for Mom this year."},{"w":"in 2026","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在 2026 年","s":"My cousin is going to finish college in 2026, and then she wants to find a job in Japan."},{"w":"in spring","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在春天","s":"Many people visit the mountains in spring because the flowers are beautiful and the weather is warm."},{"w":"in the 1990s","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在一九九〇年代","s":"My parents met each other in the 1990s when they were both students at the same college in Taichung."},{"w":"in the past","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在過去","s":"In the past, people wrote letters to their friends, but now most of us just send messages on our phones."},{"w":"in the future","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在未來","s":"Amy hopes to be a doctor in the future, so she studies science very hard every day after school."},{"w":"in a minute","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"一分鐘內","s":"Please wait for me at the door, and I will be ready in a minute after I find my keys."},{"w":"in two days","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"兩天後","s":"The box from Japan will arrive in two days, so my brother checks the mail every afternoon."},{"w":"in an hour","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"一小時後","s":"The movie starts in an hour, so we have enough time to eat some noodles first."},{"w":"in time","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"及時","s":"Thanks to the kind taxi driver, we got to the airport in time and did not miss our plane."},{"w":"in the end","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"最後","s":"The two friends argued for a long time, but in the end they said sorry to each other."},{"w":"in the beginning","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"起初","s":"In the beginning, I did not like my new school, but now I have many good friends here."},{"w":"in no time","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"立刻","s":"The pizza was so delicious that the hungry boys finished the whole thing in no time."},{"w":"in a week","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"一週後","s":"The summer vacation will begin in a week, and we are going to the beach in Kenting with my cousins."},{"w":"in the middle of the night","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在半夜","s":"The baby cried in the middle of the night, so my parents did not get much sleep at all."},{"w":"in the daytime","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在白天","s":"My uncle works at night and sleeps in the daytime, so we must be quiet at home when he rests."}]},{"unit":17,"theme":"in (2)","cards":[{"w":"in those days","p":"prep.","d":"in · 時間","c":"在那些日子","s":"In those days, my grandmother did not have a phone, so she wrote letters to her friends who lived far away."},{"w":"in the room","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在房間裡","s":"There are twenty desks in the room, and a big map of Taiwan hangs on the wall near the door."},{"w":"in the box","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在盒子裡","s":"The little girl found two old photos in the box and gave them to her mother for her birthday."},{"w":"in Taipei","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在台北","s":"My aunt lives in Taipei, so we often take the train to visit her during the summer holidays."},{"w":"in the sky","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在天空中","s":"After the rain stopped, we saw a beautiful rainbow in the sky above the tall buildings downtown."},{"w":"in the picture","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在圖片中","s":"The boy in the picture is my father when he was ten years old and lived in Tainan."},{"w":"in the newspaper","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在報紙上","s":"My grandfather read in the newspaper that a new park will open near our house next month."},{"w":"in the street","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在街上","s":"Children should not play ball in the street because many cars and scooters drive by very fast."},{"w":"in the corner","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在角落","s":"My cat likes to sleep in the corner of the living room where the warm sun shines in."},{"w":"in bed","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在床上","s":"Mike stayed in bed all day on Sunday because he had a fever and a bad headache."},{"w":"in line","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"排隊","s":"We stood in line for thirty minutes to buy the famous milk tea near the night market."},{"w":"in the middle of the road","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在路中間","s":"A big dog was lying in the middle of the road, so the bus driver had to stop quickly."},{"w":"in the front row","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在前排","s":"I always sit in the front row in math class because I cannot see the board clearly from the back."},{"w":"in the back of the car","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在車後座","s":"My little sister fell asleep in the back of the car on our long trip to Kaohsiung last weekend."},{"w":"in the tree","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在樹上（外來物）","s":"Look at the two birds in the tree, because they are building a small home for their babies."},{"w":"in the rain","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在雨中","s":"The boys kept playing soccer in the rain, so their clothes were wet and dirty when they got home."},{"w":"in the sun","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在陽光下","s":"Do not leave the chocolate in the sun, or it will become like water and make your bag dirty."},{"w":"in the dark","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在黑暗中","s":"I could not find my phone, so I walked around in the dark and hit my foot on the chair."},{"w":"in the water","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在水裡","s":"The children played happily in the water at the beach while their parents sat under a big umbrella."},{"w":"in the kitchen","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"在廚房","s":"Mom is cooking dinner in the kitchen, and the smell of the chicken soup makes me very hungry."},{"w":"in hospital","p":"prep.","d":"in · 地點","c":"住院","s":"My grandfather has been in hospital for two weeks, so we visit him every day after school."},{"w":"in English","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"用英文","s":"Our teacher asks us to speak only in English during class, so we can practice it more."},{"w":"in a loud voice","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"大聲地","s":"The coach spoke in a loud voice so that every player on the field could hear him clearly."},{"w":"in pencil","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"用鉛筆","s":"Please write your answers in pencil, so you can easily change them if you make a mistake."},{"w":"in ink","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"用墨水","s":"The teacher told us to write the test in ink, because answers in pencil are hard to read."},{"w":"in cash","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"用現金","s":"The small shop does not take credit cards, so you have to pay for the food in cash."},{"w":"in red","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"穿紅色","s":"The girl in red is my best friend Lily, and she dances better than anyone else in our class."},{"w":"in a hurry","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"匆忙地","s":"Sam was in a hurry this morning, so he left his lunch box on the kitchen table at home."},{"w":"in trouble","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"有麻煩","s":"Jack is in trouble again because he forgot to do his homework for the third time this week."},{"w":"in danger","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"處於危險","s":"The police ran into the burning building to save the people who were in danger from the fire."},{"w":"in love with","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"愛上","s":"My older sister is in love with a boy from her class, and she talks about him all day long."},{"w":"in fact","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"事實上","s":"Many people think my brother is shy, but in fact he loves to sing in front of a big crowd."},{"w":"in person","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"親自","s":"I have talked to my friend in Japan on the Internet for two years, but I have never met him in person."},{"w":"in public","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"公開地","s":"It is not polite to talk loudly on the phone in public, especially on the bus or the MRT."},{"w":"in private","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"私下","s":"The teacher asked to talk with Lisa in private after class because she wanted to help her with a problem."},{"w":"in secret","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"祕密地","s":"My brother and I planned a party for Mom in secret, and she was really surprised on Sunday night."},{"w":"in other words","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"換句話說","s":"Tom said he was busy this weekend, or in other words, he did not want to go shopping with us."},{"w":"in short","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"簡言之","s":"The food was cold, the waiter was rude, and the music was too loud, so in short, the restaurant was terrible."},{"w":"in general","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"一般而言","s":"In general, students in Taiwan study very hard, but they also need some time to play and rest."},{"w":"in total","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"總計","s":"We bought three hamburgers and two drinks at the shop, and they cost two hundred dollars in total."}]},{"unit":18,"theme":"in (3)","cards":[{"w":"in half","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"成兩半","s":"Mom cut the big apple in half and gave one piece to me and the other to my sister."},{"w":"in pieces","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"成碎片","s":"The glass fell off the table and broke in pieces, so please be careful where you walk."},{"w":"in a row","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"連續","s":"Our basketball team has won five games in a row, so everyone at school is excited about the final game."},{"w":"in order","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"井然有序","s":"Please put these books in order on the shelf, from the biggest one down to the smallest one."},{"w":"in a way","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在某方面","s":"In a way, failing the test was good for me because I started to study much harder after that."},{"w":"in this way","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"用這種方法","s":"You can write new words on cards and read them every day, and in this way you will remember them."},{"w":"in the same way","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"同樣地","s":"My sister and I were taught in the same way, but we have very different ideas about life now."},{"w":"in return","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"作為回報","s":"Mrs. Wang often helps us with our homework, and in return we help her carry heavy bags from the market."},{"w":"in case","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"以防萬一","s":"Take an umbrella with you in case it rains this afternoon, because the sky looks very gray now."},{"w":"in case of fire","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"如果發生火災","s":"In case of fire, do not run or push, and leave the building by the stairs as quickly as you can."},{"w":"in charge of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"負責","s":"Linda is in charge of the class library, so you should ask her if you want to borrow a book."},{"w":"in common","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"共同的","s":"Although Jim and I come from different countries, we have a lot in common, like our love for soccer."},{"w":"in need","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"有需要","s":"Every winter, our class collects warm clothes and gives them to families in need in our small town."},{"w":"in peace","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"平靜地","s":"After a long and busy week, Dad just wants to read his newspaper in peace on Sunday morning."},{"w":"in surprise","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"驚訝地","s":"When Mary opened the door and saw all her friends, she shouted in surprise and began to laugh."},{"w":"in silence","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"沉默地","s":"The students sat in silence and listened carefully while the teacher read the sad story to them."},{"w":"in tears","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"流著淚","s":"The little boy was in tears because he lost his favorite toy on the way to school this morning."},{"w":"in shape","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"身體狀況好","s":"My uncle runs five kilometers every morning to stay in shape, and he looks much younger than his age."},{"w":"in good health","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"健康","s":"My grandmother is ninety years old, but she is still in good health and cooks for the whole family."},{"w":"in the name of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"以…之名","s":"Our teacher gave a gift to the hospital in the name of the whole class, and the nurses thanked us."},{"w":"in search of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"尋找","s":"The hungry cat walked around the night market in search of food and finally found some fish."},{"w":"in place of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"代替","s":"Ms. Chen will teach our English class today in place of Mr. Lee, who is sick at home."},{"w":"in spite of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"儘管","s":"In spite of the heavy rain, hundreds of people came to the park to watch the big night show."},{"w":"in front of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在…前面","s":"There is a tall tree in front of my house, and the birds sing in it every morning."},{"w":"in the way","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"擋路","s":"Please move your bike because it is in the way, and the old man cannot get through the door."},{"w":"in style","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"時髦","s":"My aunt always dresses in style, and people often ask her where she buys her beautiful clothes."},{"w":"in fashion","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"流行","s":"Short hair is in fashion this year, so many girls in my class got a new haircut last week."},{"w":"in the air","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在空中；懸而未決","s":"After the ball game, the excited fans threw their hats in the air and shouted for joy."},{"w":"in all","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"總共","s":"There were twelve students in all at the party, and each of them brought some food to share."},{"w":"in part","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"部分地","s":"The team lost the game in part because their best player hurt his leg in the first ten minutes."},{"w":"in doubt","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"有疑問","s":"If you are in doubt about the answer, raise your hand and ask the teacher for help right away."},{"w":"in question","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"討論中的","s":"The student in question was not at school on the day the money was lost, so he is not the one."},{"w":"in turn","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"依次","s":"The teacher asked each student in turn to read one sentence aloud from the story in the book."},{"w":"in use","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"使用中","s":"The computer room is in use right now, so we have to wait until the next class ends."},{"w":"in size","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在尺寸上","s":"These two shirts are the same in size, but the blue one is much cheaper than the red one."},{"w":"in color","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在顏色上","s":"The sky changed in color from blue to orange as the sun went down behind the mountains."},{"w":"in number","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在數量上","s":"The birds in our park are growing in number because many people feed them every day."},{"w":"in price","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在價格上","s":"Fruit and vegetables have gone up in price this month, so my mother buys less at the market."},{"w":"in one's twenties","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"二十多歲","s":"My English teacher is in her twenties, and she likes to play basketball with us after school."},{"w":"in the middle of doing","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"正在做…","s":"I was in the middle of doing my homework when my friend called and asked me to play a game."}]},{"unit":19,"theme":"in (4)","cards":[{"w":"in a word","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"總而言之","s":"The trip to Japan was fun, the food was great, and the people were kind, so in a word, it was wonderful."},{"w":"in the long run","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"長遠來看","s":"Eating vegetables every day may seem boring, but it is good for your health in the long run."},{"w":"in the wrong","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"有錯","s":"Jack was in the wrong when he hit his little brother, so he had to say sorry to him."},{"w":"in the right","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"有理","s":"Even though everyone laughed at her idea, Lucy knew she was in the right and did not give up."},{"w":"in one's shoes","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"處於某人的立場","s":"If I were in your shoes, I would tell the teacher the truth about the broken window right now."},{"w":"in a sense","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在某種意義上","s":"In a sense, my dog is my best friend because he is always happy to see me after school."},{"w":"in time for dinner","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"及時趕上晚餐","s":"Dad promised to finish his work early and get home in time for dinner on my birthday this year."},{"w":"in bad weather","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"壞天氣時","s":"Planes cannot take off in bad weather, so many people had to wait at the airport for hours."},{"w":"in the open","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在戶外；公開","s":"The farmers sell their fresh vegetables in the open near the train station every Saturday morning."},{"w":"be in","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在家；流行","s":"Mom is not in at the moment, so please call again after six o'clock this evening, Mr. Brown."},{"w":"in and out","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"進進出出","s":"The nurse was in and out of the room all night to check on the sick old man."},{"w":"in the first place","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"首先；一開始","s":"You should not have taken your brother's bike without asking in the first place, so do not be angry now."},{"w":"in no way","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"絕不","s":"The broken cup was in no way your fault, so please do not cry about it anymore, Lily."},{"w":"in the hope of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"希望","s":"Jenny studies English two hours every night in the hope of getting a good grade on the big test."},{"w":"in the eyes of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在…眼中","s":"In the eyes of my little brother, our father is the strongest and smartest man in the whole world."},{"w":"in the face of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"面對","s":"The young doctor stayed calm in the face of danger and helped everyone get out of the burning house."},{"w":"in answer to","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"回答","s":"In answer to your question, the library closes at nine on weekdays and at five on the weekend."},{"w":"in reply to","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"回覆","s":"I wrote a long email in reply to my friend's letter, and I told him about my school life."},{"w":"in favor of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"贊成","s":"Most students are in favor of a longer lunch break, but the teachers do not agree with them."},{"w":"in the habit of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"有…的習慣","s":"My grandfather is in the habit of taking a walk after dinner, so he is still strong and healthy."},{"w":"in memory of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"紀念","s":"The town built a small park in memory of the kind doctor who helped poor people for fifty years."},{"w":"in the hands of","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"由…掌控","s":"The future of the team is in the hands of the new coach, and everyone hopes he will do well."},{"w":"in the open air","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在戶外","s":"We had our lunch in the open air by the lake, and the fresh wind made the food taste better."},{"w":"in the distance","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"在遠處","s":"From the top of the mountain, we could see the lights of the city in the distance at night."},{"w":"in a group","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"成群","s":"The students worked in a group of five to make a report about how to save water at school."},{"w":"in pairs","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"成對","s":"The teacher asked us to practice the new sentences in pairs, so I read them with my best friend."},{"w":"in line with","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"與…一致","s":"The new school rules are in line with what most parents want, so few people said no to them."},{"w":"in order to","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"為了","s":"Kevin gets up at five every morning in order to practice the piano before he goes to school."},{"w":"in that case","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"那樣的話","s":"If it rains tomorrow, we cannot have a picnic, and in that case we will watch a movie at home."},{"w":"in business","p":"prep.","d":"in · 方式","c":"營業中","s":"The old bookstore near our school has been in business for over forty years, and my father shopped there as a boy."},{"w":"in (大範圍) / on (表面) / at (點)","p":"prep.","d":"in · 易混淆","c":"in 範圍內 / on 表面 / at 點","s":"My cousin lives in Taichung, his house is on Park Road, and we will meet at the bus stop."},{"w":"be interested in (非 about)","p":"prep.","d":"in · 易混淆","c":"對…有興趣","s":"My brother is interested in science, so he reads books about space and the stars every weekend."},{"w":"be good at (非 in)","p":"prep.","d":"in · 易混淆","c":"擅長","s":"Amy is good at drawing and is also interested in music, so she wants to join the art club."}]},{"unit":20,"theme":"inside – into (1)","cards":[{"w":"inside the box","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"在盒子裡面","s":"When Mary opened the gift, she found a cute little bear inside the box and smiled happily."},{"w":"inside the house","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"在屋內","s":"It was so hot outside that everyone stayed inside the house and watched a movie all afternoon."},{"w":"stay inside","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"待在室內","s":"The weather report says a typhoon is coming tonight, so please stay inside and keep the windows closed."},{"w":"look inside","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"看裡面","s":"Before you buy the used bag, look inside carefully to make sure there are no holes or broken parts."},{"w":"inside the car","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"在車內","s":"Do not leave your dog inside the car on a sunny day, because it gets very hot very quickly."},{"w":"go inside","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"進去裡面","s":"It started to rain hard during the picnic, so we picked up our food and went inside the house."},{"w":"inside out","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"裡外翻轉","s":"Jenny was in such a hurry this morning that she wore her sweater inside out to school."},{"w":"from the inside","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 地點","c":"從內部","s":"The door of the old house can only be opened from the inside, so someone has to let you in."},{"w":"inside of an hour","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"一小時之內","s":"If we take the MRT instead of the bus, we can get to the night market inside of an hour."},{"w":"inside information","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"內部消息","s":"My brother says he has inside information about the test, but I think he is just joking with me."},{"w":"know sth. inside out","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"對…瞭若指掌","s":"Our basketball coach knows every player inside out, so he always knows who should play in the last minute."},{"w":"on the inside","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"在裡面","s":"The cake looks plain on the outside, but on the inside it is very sweet and full of fresh fruit."},{"w":"inside a week","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"一週之內","s":"The doctor told my grandmother that her leg would feel much better inside a week if she rested."},{"w":"turn the shirt inside out","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"把襯衫翻面","s":"Mom asked me to turn the shirt inside out before washing it, so the colors would stay bright."},{"w":"inside and outside","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"內外","s":"The workers painted the school inside and outside during the summer, so it looks very new and clean this year."},{"w":"deep inside","p":"prep.","d":"inside · 慣用語","c":"內心深處","s":"Tom said he did not care about the game, but deep inside he really wanted to win it."},{"w":"walk into the room","p":"prep.","d":"into · 地點","c":"走進房間","s":"When the teacher walked into the room, all the students stopped talking and quickly sat down in their seats."},{"w":"jump into the pool","p":"prep.","d":"into · 地點","c":"跳進游泳池","s":"It was a very hot afternoon, so the children jumped into the pool one by one with happy shouts."},{"w":"put the book into the bag","p":"prep.","d":"into · 地點","c":"把書放進包包","s":"Please put the book into the bag before you leave, or you will forget it again like last week."},{"w":"get into the car","p":"prep.","d":"into · 地點","c":"上車","s":"Dad told us to get into the car quickly because we were already late for Grandma's birthday party."},{"w":"fall into the river","p":"prep.","d":"into · 地點","c":"掉進河裡","s":"The little boy was running too fast on the bridge, and his new hat fell into the river."},{"w":"look into the box","p":"prep.","d":"into · 地點","c":"看盒子裡面","s":"Jack looked into the box and found some old photos of his parents when they were young."},{"w":"run into the house","p":"prep.","d":"into · 地點","c":"跑進屋裡","s":"When it began to thunder, the frightened puppy ran into the house and hid under the kitchen table."},{"w":"turn into a frog","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"變成青蛙","s":"In the story, the prince turns into a frog after a bad old woman uses her magic on him."},{"w":"change water into ice","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"把水變成冰","s":"If you put the bottle in the freezer for a few hours, the cold will change water into ice."},{"w":"cut the cake into pieces","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"把蛋糕切成小塊","s":"Mom cut the cake into pieces so that everyone at the party could have a sweet little bite."},{"w":"divide into groups","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"分成小組","s":"Our teacher divided the class into groups of four, and each group had to give a short talk about Taiwan."},{"w":"grow into a man","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"長成大人","s":"The baby in this photo has grown into a tall man, and now he is a doctor in Taipei."},{"w":"break into pieces","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"碎成片","s":"The glass fell off the table and broke into pieces, so be careful not to walk there without shoes."},{"w":"make flour into bread","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"把麵粉做成麵包","s":"My grandmother showed me how to make flour into bread, and the whole kitchen smelled wonderful."},{"w":"get into trouble","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"惹上麻煩","s":"If you keep forgetting your homework, you will get into trouble with the teacher sooner or later."},{"w":"get into the habit of","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"養成…的習慣","s":"Last year I got into the habit of reading English for ten minutes every night before going to bed."},{"w":"burst into tears","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"突然大哭","s":"When the little girl could not find her mother at the market, she burst into tears right away."},{"w":"run into an old friend","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"偶然遇到老友","s":"Yesterday I ran into an old friend at the bookstore, and we talked for almost an hour about school days."},{"w":"look into the problem","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"調查問題","s":"The principal promised to look into the problem of the broken lights in the gym as soon as possible."},{"w":"be into music","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"很喜歡音樂","s":"My sister is really into music, so she spends most of her free time playing the piano and singing."},{"w":"talk sb. into doing","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"說服某人做","s":"Kevin did not want to join the club, but his friends finally talked him into joining the soccer team."},{"w":"late into the night","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"直到深夜","s":"The night before the big test, Lisa studied late into the night and felt very tired the next morning."},{"w":"far into the future","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"直到遙遠的未來","s":"Nobody knows what life will be like far into the future, but we hope the earth will stay clean."},{"w":"come into use","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"開始被使用","s":"Cell phones came into use many years ago, and now almost everyone in Taiwan has one in their pocket."}]},{"unit":21,"theme":"into (2) – like","cards":[{"w":"come into fashion","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"開始流行","s":"Short hair came into fashion last year, so many girls at my school cut their long hair off."},{"w":"fall into bad habits","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"養成壞習慣","s":"During the long summer vacation, some students fall into bad habits like sleeping late and playing games all day."},{"w":"get into college","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"進入大學","s":"Maggie studied very hard for three years, and finally she got into a good college in Taipei."},{"w":"break into a house","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"闖入住家","s":"Last night a thief tried to break into a house on our street, but the loud dog scared him away."},{"w":"two goes into eight four times","p":"prep.","d":"into · 方式","c":"八除以二等於四","s":"The math teacher explained that two goes into eight four times, and then she gave us a harder question."},{"w":"look like your mother","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"長得像你媽媽","s":"Everyone says you look like your mother because you both have the same big eyes and sweet smile."},{"w":"sound like fun","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"聽起來很有趣","s":"A trip to the beach with hot dogs and swimming sounds like fun, so let's go this Saturday."},{"w":"taste like chicken","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"吃起來像雞肉","s":"My brother tried frog legs for the first time in France and said they taste like chicken."},{"w":"smell like fish","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"聞起來像魚","s":"The kitchen smelled like fish all afternoon because Grandpa cooked a big dinner for the whole family."},{"w":"like this","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"像這樣","s":"Hold the baseball bat like this, with both hands close together, and then swing it slowly at the ball."},{"w":"like that","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"像那樣","s":"Please do not talk to your grandmother like that; she only wants to help you with your homework."},{"w":"something like that","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"類似那樣","s":"I think the movie is about a boy who finds a lost dog, or something like that, but I am not sure."},{"w":"a face like an angel","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"天使般的臉","s":"The baby in the picture has a face like an angel, and everyone who sees her wants to smile."},{"w":"run like the wind","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"跑得飛快","s":"When the bell rang for lunch, Jason ran like the wind to be the first one at the shop."},{"w":"work like a dog","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"像狗一樣辛苦工作","s":"My father works like a dog from Monday to Saturday, so on Sunday he just wants to rest at home."},{"w":"sleep like a baby","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"睡得像寶寶","s":"After the long hike up the mountain, I was so tired that I slept like a baby all night."},{"w":"eat like a horse","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"吃得很多","s":"My little brother eats like a horse after soccer practice, so Mom always cooks extra rice for him."},{"w":"like father, like son","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"有其父必有其子","s":"Mr. Lin loves fishing, and his son spends every weekend by the river too; like father, like son."},{"w":"What is he like?","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"他是怎樣的人？","s":"You said the new student sits next to you in class, so tell me, what is he like?"},{"w":"What does it look like?","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"它看起來如何？","s":"I have never seen a dragon fruit before, so can you tell me what does it look like inside?"},{"w":"What is the weather like?","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"天氣怎麼樣？","s":"Before we plan the picnic for Sunday, let's check the news and see what the weather is like."},{"w":"just like old times","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"就像以前一樣","s":"The old friends sat in the same corner of the coffee shop, talking and laughing just like old times."},{"w":"nothing like","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"一點也不像","s":"Riding a real horse is nothing like riding the little horse at the park, and I was quite scared."},{"w":"and the like","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"等等","s":"The night market sells fried chicken, noodles, sweet drinks, and the like, so you will never go hungry there."},{"w":"like crazy","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"瘋狂地","s":"When our team scored the last goal, the whole class jumped up and shouted like crazy in the gym."},{"w":"It looks like rain.","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"看起來要下雨了。","s":"The sky is getting dark and the wind is strong, so it looks like rain; bring your umbrella with you."},{"w":"feel like a cup of tea","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"想喝杯茶","s":"After walking around the market for two hours, I feel like a cup of tea and a short rest."},{"w":"feel like crying","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"想哭","s":"When Amy saw her low score on the math test, she felt like crying, but her friend made her laugh."},{"w":"like a dream","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"像夢一樣","s":"Our trip to Japan was like a dream, with beautiful snow, delicious food, and very kind people everywhere."},{"w":"more like","p":"prep.","d":"like · 方式","c":"更像是","s":"Dad said the walk would take ten minutes, but it was more like half an hour under the hot sun."},{"w":"He looks like his dad.","p":"prep.","d":"like · 易混淆","c":"他長得像爸爸。","s":"Everyone at the party said that little Ben looks like his dad, from his short nose to his big smile."}]},{"unit":22,"theme":"near – of (1)","cards":[{"w":"near the station","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"在車站附近","s":"There is a small bookstore near the station, and I often stop there to read before I take the train."},{"w":"live near the school","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"住在學校附近","s":"Since we live near the school, my brother and I can walk there in five minutes every morning."},{"w":"sit near the window","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"坐在窗邊附近","s":"On the train to Taichung, I like to sit near the window so I can watch the green fields go by."},{"w":"a park near here","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"附近的公園","s":"Is there a park near here where we can play basketball after school and ride our bikes?"},{"w":"come near","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"靠近","s":"Please do not come near the stove while I am cooking, because the hot oil can burn your hand."},{"w":"near the top","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"靠近頂端","s":"When we were near the top of the mountain, it got cold and windy, so we put on our jackets."},{"w":"nowhere near","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"遠遠不及","s":"My drawing is nowhere near as good as my sister's, but I still enjoy painting pictures on weekends."},{"w":"near the end of the book","p":"prep.","d":"near · 地點","c":"接近書的結尾","s":"Near the end of the book, the lost dog finally finds his way home, and the family cries with joy."},{"w":"near the end of the year","p":"prep.","d":"near · 時間","c":"接近年底","s":"Near the end of the year, many stores have big sales, so my mother buys new clothes for us then."},{"w":"near Christmas","p":"prep.","d":"near · 時間","c":"接近聖誕節","s":"Near Christmas, the streets in our town are full of lights, and the shops play happy music all day."},{"w":"the near future","p":"prep.","d":"near · 時間","c":"不久的將來","s":"The city plans to build a new MRT line in the near future, so going to school will be much easier."},{"w":"near midnight","p":"prep.","d":"near · 時間","c":"接近午夜","s":"Jenny was still talking with her friends on the phone near midnight, so she was very sleepy in class today."},{"w":"draw near","p":"prep.","d":"near · 時間","c":"臨近","s":"As the final exams draw near, the library gets more crowded and the students become more and more nervous."},{"w":"near the time","p":"prep.","d":"near · 時間","c":"時間接近","s":"It was near the time for the school bus to leave, so Mark picked up his bag and ran to the gate."},{"w":"near the school","p":"prep.","d":"near · 易混淆","c":"close to the school=靠近學校","s":"We moved to an apartment near the school last month, so now I can sleep a little later every morning."},{"w":"a nearby park","p":"prep.","d":"near · 易混淆","c":"附近的公園","s":"Every Sunday morning, Grandpa takes his little dog to a nearby park, and they walk slowly around the lake."},{"w":"near here","p":"prep.","d":"near · 易混淆","c":"這附近","s":"Excuse me, is there a bus stop near here, because I need to get to the hospital before noon?"},{"w":"a cup of tea","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一杯茶","s":"After dinner, my grandmother always makes herself a cup of tea and sits by the window to watch the moon."},{"w":"a piece of paper","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一張紙","s":"The teacher gave each of us a piece of paper and asked us to write down three wishes for the new year."},{"w":"a lot of friends","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"很多朋友","s":"Since Peter is friendly and loves to help others, he has made a lot of friends at his new school."},{"w":"a kind of fruit","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一種水果","s":"A dragon fruit is a kind of fruit with pink skin, and it is very popular in Taiwan during the summer."},{"w":"a friend of mine","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"我的一個朋友","s":"A friend of mine is coming to visit from Japan next week, so I will show her around the night market."},{"w":"the top of the hill","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"山頂","s":"We walked for two hours to reach the top of the hill, and the view of the sea was wonderful."},{"w":"the color of the sky","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"天空的顏色","s":"Just before the typhoon came, the color of the sky changed from blue to a strange dark gray."},{"w":"the city of Taipei","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"台北市","s":"The city of Taipei has many night markets, tall buildings, and a convenient MRT system for visitors to enjoy."},{"w":"a man of few words","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"話不多的人","s":"My grandfather is a man of few words, but when he speaks, everyone in the family listens carefully."},{"w":"die of cancer","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"死於癌症","s":"Mr. Chen stopped smoking after his good friend died of cancer at the age of fifty last year."},{"w":"be afraid of dogs","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"怕狗","s":"My little sister is afraid of dogs, so she always holds my hand when we walk past the pet shop."},{"w":"be proud of you","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"為你驕傲","s":"You practiced the piano every day for months, and now I am so proud of you for winning first place."},{"w":"be tired of waiting","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"厭倦等待","s":"We were tired of waiting for the late bus, so we decided to walk to the movie theater together."},{"w":"be sure of it","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"對此有把握","s":"Sandy says she can finish the whole report tonight, and she seems quite sure of it."},{"w":"be full of water","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"裝滿水","s":"After the heavy rain last night, the small river behind our school was full of brown water this morning."},{"w":"think of a plan","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"想到一個計畫","s":"We need to think of a plan for the class party, because it is only two weeks away now."},{"w":"dream of flying","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"夢想飛翔","s":"When I was a child, I often dreamed of flying over the city like a bird in the sky."},{"w":"hear of the news","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"聽說這消息","s":"Have you heard of the news about our school; the old library will become a new computer room next year."},{"w":"take care of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"照顧","s":"When my parents went to Japan for a week, my grandmother came to take care of my brother and me."},{"w":"get rid of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"擺脫","s":"It took me months to get rid of my bad habit of staying up late and playing phone games."},{"w":"run out of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"用完","s":"We ran out of milk this morning, so Dad went to the store on the corner to buy some before breakfast."},{"w":"because of the rain","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"因為雨","s":"Because of the rain, the baseball game was put off, and the players went back home feeling very sad."},{"w":"instead of me","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"代替我","s":"My brother is sick today, so could you please go to the store instead of me and buy some bread?"}]},{"unit":23,"theme":"of (2)","cards":[{"w":"out of order","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"故障","s":"The washing machine at home is out of order again, so Mom has to wash all our clothes by hand."},{"w":"out of date","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"過時","s":"This map is out of date, because many of the roads here have changed in the past ten years."},{"w":"out of work","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"失業","s":"Uncle Tom has been out of work since the factory closed, so he is looking for a new job now."},{"w":"first of all","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"首先","s":"First of all, wash your hands before you touch any food, and then we can start making the cookies."},{"w":"most of all","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"最重要的是","s":"I love the food and the beaches in Tainan, but most of all, I love the kind people there."},{"w":"of course","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"當然","s":"Of course you can borrow my umbrella; just remember to bring it back to school tomorrow morning."},{"w":"all of a sudden","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"突然","s":"We were having a picnic in the park when, all of a sudden, it began to rain very hard."},{"w":"a waste of time","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"浪費時間","s":"Watching TV for five hours every day is a waste of time, so why not read a good book instead?"},{"w":"a matter of time","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"時間問題","s":"Anna practices swimming every day after school, so it is only a matter of time before she wins a big race."},{"w":"the key to (非 of)","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"…的關鍵","s":"Our coach often says the key to winning is working together, not the skill of one great player."},{"w":"a photo of my family","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"我家人的照片","s":"I keep a photo of my family in my wallet, so I can look at it whenever I miss them."},{"w":"the number of students","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"學生的數量","s":"The number of students in our school has gone down this year, so two classes were put together."},{"w":"a number of students","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"許多學生","s":"A number of students stayed after class to ask the teacher questions about the science homework for tomorrow."},{"w":"a bit of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一點","s":"This soup needs a bit of salt, so could you pass me the salt from the other side of the table?"},{"w":"a couple of days","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"幾天","s":"My aunt will stay with us for a couple of days, and then she will fly back to America on Friday."},{"w":"a pair of shoes","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一雙鞋","s":"I bought a new pair of shoes for the sports day, but they hurt my feet during the first race."},{"w":"a glass of milk","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一杯牛奶","s":"Every morning before school, my mother gives me a glass of milk and an egg to keep me strong."},{"w":"a bowl of rice","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一碗飯","s":"Grandma always puts a bowl of rice in front of me and tells me to eat more, even when I am full."},{"w":"a bottle of water","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一瓶水","s":"Remember to bring a bottle of water on the hike, because it will be very hot on the mountain."},{"w":"a loaf of bread","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一條麵包","s":"Dad came home from the bakery with a loaf of bread, and we had warm toast with butter for breakfast."},{"w":"a slice of pizza","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一片披薩","s":"After the game, each player got a slice of pizza and a cold drink from the coach as a little gift."},{"w":"a sheet of paper","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一張紙","s":"Please take out a sheet of paper and write your name at the top before you start the test."},{"w":"a bar of chocolate","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一條巧克力","s":"Linda shared a bar of chocolate with her friends at lunch, and everyone got two small sweet pieces."},{"w":"a box of apples","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"一箱蘋果","s":"My uncle sent us a box of apples from his farm, so Mom made a big apple pie this weekend."},{"w":"It is kind of you.","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"你真好心。","s":"It is kind of you to carry the heavy bags for the old lady while she walks up the stairs."},{"w":"It is nice of you.","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"你真好。","s":"It is nice of you to stay after class and help me clean the room before the big meeting."},{"w":"rob sb. of sth.","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"搶走某人的某物","s":"Two men robbed the old woman of her bag near the market, but the police caught them an hour later."},{"w":"remind me of my father","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"讓我想起我父親","s":"The tall man with the kind smile in the old photo reminds me of my father when he was young."},{"w":"a book of mine","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"我的一本書","s":"I lent a book of mine to Jack last month, but he still has not given it back to me."},{"w":"one of the best","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"最好的其中之一","s":"This small noodle shop near the temple is one of the best places to eat in our town."},{"w":"some of them","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"他們當中一些","s":"Many students joined the school trip to the museum, but some of them had to stay home because they were sick."},{"w":"none of us","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"我們沒有人","s":"None of us knew the answer to the last question, so the teacher explained it again on the board."},{"w":"both of them","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"他們兩個","s":"Both of them want to be the class leader, so the students will vote for one of them next Monday."},{"w":"each of us","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"我們每一個","s":"Before the trip, each of us had to bring a lunch box, a bottle of water, and a raincoat."},{"w":"all of you","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"你們全部","s":"I want all of you to finish the reading by Friday, because we will have a short quiz on it."},{"w":"half of the class","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"半個班級","s":"Half of the class went to the computer room, and the other half stayed to practice for the English speech."},{"w":"most of the time","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"大部分時間","s":"My grandfather spends most of the time in his garden, planting flowers and talking to his old neighbors."},{"w":"the rest of the day","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"這天剩下的時間","s":"After we finished the housework, we spent the rest of the day at the beach swimming and eating ice cream."},{"w":"the end of the story","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"故事的結尾","s":"At the end of the story, the poor boy becomes a king, and everyone in the village is happy for him."},{"w":"the beginning of May","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"五月初","s":"At the beginning of May, the weather in Taiwan gets hot and wet, and the rainy season usually starts."}]},{"unit":24,"theme":"of (3)","cards":[{"w":"a change of plan","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"計畫變更","s":"There has been a change of plan; we will go to the zoo on Sunday instead of Saturday because of the rain."},{"w":"speak well of sb.","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"稱讚某人","s":"Everyone in the office speaks well of Miss Lee because she is helpful, honest, and always finishes her work on time."},{"w":"make fun of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"取笑","s":"Some boys made fun of Tim because of his glasses, but the teacher told them to stop at once."},{"w":"make use of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"利用","s":"We should make use of the old boxes in the garage and turn them into a little house for the cat."},{"w":"make the most of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"充分利用","s":"The sun is finally out after a week of rain, so let's make the most of it and ride our bikes."},{"w":"make a fool of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"愚弄","s":"Nobody likes it when someone makes a fool of them in front of the class, so please be kind to others."},{"w":"keep track of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"記錄；掌握","s":"My mother keeps track of everything she spends by writing it down in a small notebook every evening."},{"w":"lose track of time","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"忘了時間","s":"We were playing video games at Ben's house and lost track of time, so we missed dinner at home."},{"w":"catch sight of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"看見","s":"As the bus turned the corner, I caught sight of my old teacher waiting at the stop with a big bag."},{"w":"lose sight of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"看不見","s":"We lost sight of our little brother in the crowded night market, but we found him at the ice cream stand."},{"w":"take hold of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"抓住","s":"When the boat moved suddenly, the little girl took hold of her father's arm and did not let go."},{"w":"take notice of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"注意","s":"Nobody took notice of the small sign on the door, so several people walked into the wrong room."},{"w":"take the place of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"取代","s":"Many people think that email has taken the place of letters, but my grandmother still writes to me by hand."},{"w":"think highly of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"高度評價","s":"All the teachers think highly of Amy because she studies hard and always helps other students with their problems."},{"w":"be short of money","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"缺錢","s":"I am a bit short of money this month, so I will not see any movies until I get my pocket money."},{"w":"be free of charge","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"免費","s":"The museum is free of charge for students on Sundays, so let's bring our student cards and go together."},{"w":"be in need of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"需要","s":"The old man living alone next door is in need of help, so my family brings him dinner every evening."},{"w":"in case of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"如果發生","s":"In case of fire, do not run or push; walk down the stairs quickly and wait outside the building."},{"w":"in terms of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"就…而言","s":"In terms of price, this phone is a good choice, but the camera is not as good as the other one."},{"w":"on top of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"在…上面","s":"The cat likes to sleep on top of the warm washing machine while it is running in the afternoon."},{"w":"at the cost of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"以…為代價","s":"Jason got high grades at the cost of his health, because he slept only four hours a night for months."},{"w":"at the end of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"在…結尾","s":"At the end of the school year, our class will have a big party and say goodbye to our teacher."},{"w":"by means of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"藉由","s":"My grandmother cannot walk very far, so she gets to the market by means of a small blue bus every morning."},{"w":"by way of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"經由","s":"We flew to Japan by way of Hong Kong, and the long trip took us almost ten hours in total."},{"w":"for fear of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"因為怕","s":"Jenny did not tell her mother about the broken window for fear of being punished before dinner."},{"w":"a man of 50","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"五十歲的男人","s":"Our new math teacher is a man of 50, but he runs faster than most students on the playground."},{"w":"a boy of ten","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"十歲的男孩","s":"A boy of ten won the city chess game last weekend, and his proud parents cried with joy."},{"w":"the 5th of May","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"五月五日","s":"The school sports day will be held on the fifth of May, so please wear your sports shoes that morning."},{"w":"of late","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"最近","s":"Of late, my little brother has been going to bed early because he wants to grow taller for basketball."},{"w":"of one's own","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"自己的","s":"After sharing a bedroom with two sisters for years, Lisa finally has a small room of her own."},{"w":"be of help","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"有幫助","s":"If you want to pass the English test, this little blue book will be of help to you every night."},{"w":"be of use","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"有用","s":"An old map of the city may still be of use when your phone has no power on the trip."},{"w":"be of great value","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"很有價值","s":"This old watch from my grandfather is of great value to me, so I never wear it to school."},{"w":"be of no use","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"沒用","s":"Crying about the lost game is of no use now, so let us practice harder for the next one."},{"w":"how kind of him","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"他真好心","s":"How kind of him to carry the heavy bags for the old lady all the way up the stairs!"},{"w":"smell of smoke","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"有煙味","s":"When Dad came home from the party, his coat smelled of smoke, and Mom asked him to wash it."},{"w":"taste of lemon","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"有檸檬味","s":"This cold tea tastes of lemon, and it is the perfect drink on such a hot summer afternoon."},{"w":"dream of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"dream about=夢想","s":"Since she was a little girl, Amy has dreamed of becoming a doctor and helping sick children in the mountains."},{"w":"know of","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"hear of=知道有","s":"I know of a cheap restaurant near the station, but I have never eaten there with my family."},{"w":"the love of money","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"對錢的愛","s":"The love of money made the rich man in the story forget his old friends and his family."}]},{"unit":25,"theme":"of (4) – off (1)","cards":[{"w":"fear of the dark","p":"prep.","d":"of · 慣用語","c":"怕黑","s":"My little sister has a fear of the dark, so she always sleeps with a small light on."},{"w":"a friend of mine (不說 a my friend)","p":"prep.","d":"of · 易混淆","c":"我的一個朋友（正確說法）","s":"A friend of mine is moving to Tainan next month, so we are having a goodbye party on Friday."},{"w":"the key to (非 of) the door","p":"prep.","d":"of · 易混淆","c":"門的鑰匙","s":"I could not find the key to the door of our house this morning, so I was late for school again."},{"w":"the answer to (非 of) the question","p":"prep.","d":"of · 易混淆","c":"問題的答案","s":"Nobody in our class knew the answer to the last question of the test, so the teacher explained it again."},{"w":"the way to (非 of) the station","p":"prep.","d":"of · 易混淆","c":"去車站的路","s":"An old man kindly showed us the way to the station in the middle of the heavy rain."},{"w":"the reason for (非 of)","p":"prep.","d":"of · 易混淆","c":"…的原因","s":"The reason for his sad face yesterday was a fight with one of his best friends at lunch time."},{"w":"be good at (非 of)","p":"prep.","d":"of · 易混淆","c":"擅長","s":"My sister is good at drawing, so she always helps me with the pictures of the school newspaper."},{"w":"be interested in (非 of)","p":"prep.","d":"of · 易混淆","c":"對…有興趣","s":"Ben is interested in old trains, and he spends most of his Sunday afternoons reading books about them."},{"w":"take off one's coat","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"脫下外套","s":"It was very warm inside the restaurant, so Grandpa took off his coat and hung it on the chair."},{"w":"take off (plane)","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"（飛機）起飛","s":"Our plane took off late because of the heavy rain, so we missed the first show in Japan."},{"w":"put off the meeting","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"延後會議","s":"The teachers put off the meeting until Friday because many of them were sick with the flu this week."},{"w":"turn off the light","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"關燈","s":"Please turn off the light when you leave the room, because we need to save energy at school."},{"w":"get off the bus","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"下公車","s":"You should get off the bus at the third stop, and then walk two blocks to the library."},{"w":"fall off the bike","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"從腳踏車上掉下來","s":"Little Mike fell off the bike on the wet road, but luckily he only hurt his left knee."},{"w":"call off the game","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"取消比賽","s":"The coach called off the game this afternoon because the field was full of water after the storm."},{"w":"set off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"出發","s":"We set off for the mountains at five in the morning, so everyone slept on the bus."},{"w":"see sb. off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"送別某人","s":"The whole family went to the airport to see Uncle Jack off before his long trip to America."},{"w":"show off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"炫耀","s":"Peter likes to show off his new phone in class, but the teacher told him to put it away."},{"w":"cut off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"切斷","s":"The strong wind cut off the power last night, so we ate dinner by candle light and told stories."},{"w":"give off a smell","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"散發氣味","s":"The old shoes under his bed give off a terrible smell, so his mother threw them away today."},{"w":"go off (alarm)","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"（鬧鐘）響","s":"My alarm went off at six this morning, but I was so sleepy that I stayed in bed until seven."},{"w":"keep off the grass","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"勿踐踏草地","s":"The sign in the park says keep off the grass, but some children still run and play there every afternoon."},{"w":"kick off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"開始","s":"The school festival will kick off with a short dance show at nine, so please arrive before that."},{"w":"lay off workers","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"裁員","s":"The factory had to lay off thirty workers last month because people stopped buying its old-style radios."},{"w":"run off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"跑掉","s":"The little dog ran off with my shoe, and I chased it around the garden for ten minutes."},{"w":"tell sb. off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"責罵某人","s":"Mom told Jack off for playing games all night, and now he has to study in the living room."},{"w":"wear off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"逐漸消失","s":"The medicine helped at first, but the good feeling began to wear off after only two or three hours."},{"w":"write off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"一筆勾銷","s":"My uncle decided to write off the money his old friend had borrowed, because he cared more about the friendship."},{"w":"cool off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"涼快一下","s":"After running around the field in the hot sun, the players jumped into the pool to cool off."},{"w":"drop off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"睡著；放下（人）","s":"Grandpa dropped off in his chair while watching the news, and the cat slept on his knees."},{"w":"back off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"退開","s":"The police officer asked the crowd to back off so that the doctor could help the hurt man."},{"w":"break off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"中斷","s":"Our phone call broke off in the middle of the story because the train went into a long tunnel."},{"w":"hold off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"推遲","s":"The farmers decided to hold off planting the rice until the heavy rain stops at the end of the week."},{"w":"let off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"放過","s":"The teacher let Amy off this time because it was her first time to forget her homework all year."},{"w":"sell off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"賣掉","s":"Before moving to a smaller house, my parents sold off most of the old furniture at a low price."},{"w":"shut off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"關掉","s":"Please shut off the water after you wash your hands, because the school is trying to save water."},{"w":"take a day off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"請一天假","s":"Dad will take a day off next Friday so that he can watch my basketball game at school."},{"w":"be off to school","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"去上學","s":"It is already seven thirty, so finish your milk quickly, because you are off to school in five minutes."},{"w":"be off work","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"不上班","s":"My mother is off work this week, so she is cooking a special dinner for us every evening."},{"w":"be well off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"富有","s":"The family next door is well off, but their children still ride old bikes to school like us."}]},{"unit":26,"theme":"off (2) – on (1)","cards":[{"w":"be badly off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"貧窮","s":"Many families in the story were badly off, so the children had to work instead of going to school."},{"w":"take 10% off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"打九折","s":"The shop near our school will take 10% off all notebooks this week, so let us buy some tomorrow."},{"w":"get off work","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"下班","s":"My father usually gets off work at six, and then he picks me up from the library on his way home."},{"w":"get off to a good start","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"有好的開始","s":"Our team got off to a good start this season, winning the first three games by a lot."},{"w":"go off to sleep","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"睡著","s":"The baby finally went off to sleep after Mom sang the same quiet song to her five times."},{"w":"run off with","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"帶著…跑掉","s":"In the movie, a clever monkey runs off with a visitor's camera and takes funny pictures of itself."},{"w":"come off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"脫落","s":"One of the buttons came off my school jacket this morning, so my grandmother fixed it for me after dinner."},{"w":"have a day off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"休假一天","s":"My mother has a day off tomorrow, so we are going to the night market together after dinner."},{"w":"be off","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"離開；關掉；壞掉（食物）","s":"I must be off now because the last bus leaves in ten minutes, and my mother is waiting at home."},{"w":"The milk is off.","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"牛奶壞了。","s":"The milk is off, so do not drink it, and please put the new bottle in the refrigerator right away."},{"w":"The light is off.","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"燈是關的。","s":"The light in the kitchen is off, so I think everyone has already gone to bed for the night."},{"w":"I'm off.","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"我走了。","s":"Well, I'm off, so thank you for the lovely dinner, and I will call you when I get home."},{"w":"off and on","p":"prep.","d":"off · 片語動詞","c":"斷斷續續","s":"It rained off and on all day, so we could not finish our baseball game in the park."},{"w":"off the coast","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"離岸不遠處","s":"A small green island lies off the coast, and you can take a boat there from the beach in twenty minutes."},{"w":"a street off the main road","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"主幹道旁的小街","s":"The best noodle shop in town is on a quiet street off the main road, right behind the post office."},{"w":"fall off the wall","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"從牆上掉下來","s":"The old picture fell off the wall during the earthquake last night, but the glass did not break."},{"w":"keep off the road","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"別走在路上","s":"Children, please keep off the road and walk on the sidewalk, because the cars drive very fast here."},{"w":"jump off the bridge","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"從橋上跳下","s":"In summer, some brave boys jump off the bridge into the river, but it is really dangerous."},{"w":"get off the plane","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"下飛機","s":"After we got off the plane in Japan, the cold air made us put on our coats right away."},{"w":"take the book off the shelf","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"把書從架上拿下","s":"Mom asked me to take the book off the shelf and read a story to my little brother before bed."},{"w":"off the point","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"離題","s":"The teacher said my answer was off the point because I talked about my pet instead of the weather."},{"w":"off the record","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"不公開的","s":"The player told the reporter something off the record, so it did not appear in the newspaper the next day."},{"w":"off duty","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"下班","s":"The nurse is off duty now, so you can find her having lunch at the little shop across the street."},{"w":"off season","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"淡季","s":"Hotels near the beach are much cheaper in the off season, so my family likes to travel in winter."},{"w":"off the top of my head","p":"prep.","d":"off · 地點","c":"一時想到","s":"Off the top of my head, I can name five countries in Asia, but I need a map for the rest."},{"w":"take it off the table (非 from)","p":"prep.","d":"off · 易混淆","c":"從桌上拿走","s":"Please take the dirty plates off the table and bring the fruit from the kitchen for everyone."},{"w":"on Monday","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在星期一","s":"On Monday our class has a big English test, so most of us studied at the library this weekend."},{"w":"on May 5","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在五月五日","s":"My grandmother will visit us on May 5, and my mother is planning a big dinner for the whole family."},{"w":"on the weekend","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在週末","s":"On the weekend, my family often rides bikes along the river and then eats noodles at a small shop."},{"w":"on Monday morning","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在週一早上","s":"The students were very sleepy on Monday morning because they all stayed up late watching the ball game."},{"w":"on Christmas Day","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在聖誕節當天","s":"On Christmas Day, we open our presents first and then eat a big breakfast with Grandpa and Grandma."},{"w":"on my birthday","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在我生日那天","s":"On my birthday, my friends surprised me with a chocolate cake and a card signed by the whole class."},{"w":"on New Year's Eve","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在除夕","s":"On New Year's Eve, we stayed up until midnight to watch the lights over the tall building in Taipei."},{"w":"on time","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"準時","s":"Our school bus always arrives on time, so I never have to run to class in the morning."},{"w":"on the first day","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在第一天","s":"On the first day of high school, Tina was nervous, but she made two new friends at lunch time."},{"w":"on a cold night","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在一個寒冷的夜晚","s":"On a cold night last winter, a small white cat came to our door, and we gave it some warm milk."},{"w":"on arriving home","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"一到家就","s":"On arriving home, Mary took off her shoes, washed her hands, and ran to the kitchen for a snack."},{"w":"on Sundays","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"每逢星期日","s":"On Sundays, my father and I go to the park early and play basketball before the sun gets too hot."},{"w":"on the morning of May 1","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"在五月一日早上","s":"On the morning of May 1, the whole school went to the mountains to plant young trees together."},{"w":"on holiday","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"度假中","s":"Our English teacher is on holiday in Japan this week, so a new teacher is reading stories with us."}]},{"unit":27,"theme":"on (2)","cards":[{"w":"on the hour","p":"prep.","d":"on · 時間","c":"整點","s":"The trains to Tainan leave on the hour, so we should get to the station a little before ten."},{"w":"on the table","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在桌上","s":"Your lunch box is on the table, and please do not forget your water bottle this time."},{"w":"on the wall","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在牆上","s":"There is a large map of the world on the wall, and we often look for new countries on it."},{"w":"on the floor","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在地板上","s":"The baby dropped her toy on the floor, and the dog picked it up and ran away with it."},{"w":"on the bus","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在公車上","s":"I usually read a book on the bus to school, but today it was too crowded to open my bag."},{"w":"on the train","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在火車上","s":"We ate rice balls and drank tea on the train while watching the green fields go by outside."},{"w":"on the plane","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在飛機上","s":"On the plane to Japan, my little brother watched three movies and did not sleep at all."},{"w":"on the second floor","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在二樓","s":"The music room is on the second floor, right next to the library, so you can hear the piano from there."},{"w":"on the left","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在左邊","s":"Walk straight for two blocks, and you will see the post office on the left, next to the bank."},{"w":"on the right","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在右邊","s":"The bookstore is on the right when you come out of the station, so you cannot miss it."},{"w":"on the corner","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在街角","s":"There is a small store on the corner, and we often buy cold drinks there after school on hot days."},{"w":"on the beach","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在海灘上","s":"On the beach, the children built a big sand castle while their parents rested under a tree."},{"w":"on the farm","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在農場","s":"My cousins live on the farm with many cows and chickens, so they get up at five every day."},{"w":"on the island","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在島上","s":""},{"w":"on the page","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在頁面上","s":"The answers to the questions are on the page after the story, so do not look before you finish."},{"w":"on the road","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在路上","s":"There were many cars on the road this morning because of the rain, so Dad was late for work."},{"w":"on the river","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在河上（船）","s":"Several small boats were on the river, and the people in them were catching fish for dinner."},{"w":"on the way to school","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在上學途中","s":"On the way to school, I saw an old woman drop her bag, so I helped her pick everything up."},{"w":"on the top of the mountain","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在山頂上","s":"On the top of the mountain, the wind was very strong, but the view of the sea was beautiful."},{"w":"on the ceiling","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在天花板上","s":"There is a small brown spider on the ceiling of my room, and I am too afraid to sleep."},{"w":"on the back of the card","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在卡片背面","s":"Write your name and class on the back of the card, and then give it to your teacher tomorrow."},{"w":"on the other side","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在另一邊","s":"My best friend lives on the other side of the river, so we meet at the bridge every Saturday."},{"w":"on the ground","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在地上","s":"After the storm, there were many leaves and small branches on the ground all around the school."},{"w":"on the moon","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在月球上","s":"Many years ago, people first walked on the moon, and my grandfather watched it on a small TV."},{"w":"on the phone","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在講電話","s":"My sister has been on the phone with her friend for an hour, so I cannot call Grandma."},{"w":"on the Internet","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在網路上","s":"You can find many free English lessons on the Internet, but be careful about what you believe there."},{"w":"on TV","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在電視上","s":"We watched the baseball game on TV last night, and my father jumped up when our team won."},{"w":"on the radio","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在廣播中","s":"Grandpa likes to listen to old songs on the radio while he waters the plants in the morning."},{"w":"on the screen","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在螢幕上","s":"The words on the screen were too small to read, so the teacher made them bigger for us."},{"w":"on the map","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在地圖上","s":"Can you find our school on the map, and then show me the shortest way to the train station?"},{"w":"on the list","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在名單上","s":"My name is on the list for the school trip, but my best friend has to wait for another chance."},{"w":"on the menu","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在菜單上","s":""},{"w":"on the news","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在新聞上","s":"The big fire at the old factory was on the news this morning, and nobody was hurt luckily."},{"w":"on the computer","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在電腦上","s":"My brother spends too much time playing games on the computer, so Mom only lets him use it on weekends."},{"w":"on a farm","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在農場","s":"Last summer we stayed on a farm for a week and learned how to feed the pigs and pick fruit."},{"w":"on the tree","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在樹上（長出的）","s":"The oranges on the tree in our yard are turning yellow, so we can pick them next week."},{"w":"on the first page","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在第一頁","s":"Please write your name on the first page of the notebook so that nobody will take it by mistake."},{"w":"on the wall of the room","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在房間牆上","s":"My little sister drew a big yellow sun on the wall of the room, and Mom was not happy at all."},{"w":"on the edge","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在邊緣","s":"Do not put your glass on the edge of the table, or it will fall and break into pieces."},{"w":"on the back seat","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在後座","s":"My grandmother always sits on the back seat of the car because she feels safer there on long trips."}]},{"unit":28,"theme":"on (3)","cards":[{"w":"on the back","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"在背上","s":"The little girl rode on the back of her father all the way home from the night market."},{"w":"on one's knees","p":"prep.","d":"on · 地點","c":"跪著","s":"The farmer was on his knees in the field, planting small green vegetables one by one in the warm sun."},{"w":"on foot","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"走路","s":""},{"w":"on sale","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"特價中","s":"These sports shoes are on sale this week, so Dad bought a pair for me and one for my brother."},{"w":"for sale (非 on)","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"出售","s":"The old house on our street has been for sale for months, but nobody wants to buy it yet."},{"w":"on fire","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"著火","s":"The kitchen was on fire when we came home, so we called for help and waited outside the house."},{"w":"on purpose","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"故意地","s":"I did not break your pencil on purpose, so please do not be angry with me anymore."},{"w":"on duty","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"值班","s":"My mother is a nurse, and she is on duty tonight, so Dad is cooking dinner for us."},{"w":"on business","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"出差","s":"My father is away on business in Japan this week, but he promised to bring us some candy."},{"w":"on vacation","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"度假","s":"Our neighbors are on vacation in Tainan, so we are feeding their cat and watering their plants."},{"w":"on a trip","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"旅行中","s":"Grandpa is on a trip to the mountains with his old friends, and he sends us pictures every day."},{"w":"on a diet","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"節食中","s":"My aunt is on a diet, so she only had a small salad while we all enjoyed the pizza."},{"w":"on one's own","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"獨自","s":"For the first time, Kevin cooked dinner for his family on his own, and everyone said it was delicious."},{"w":"on the whole","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"整體而言","s":"The trip had some problems, but on the whole we had a great time and made many good friends."},{"w":"on the other hand","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"另一方面","s":"Living in the city is convenient, but on the other hand, it is noisy and the air is not clean."},{"w":"on one hand","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"一方面","s":"On one hand, I want to join the basketball team, but I also need more time for my studies."},{"w":"on the spot","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"當場","s":"When the boy fell off his bike, a kind doctor who was passing by helped him on the spot."},{"w":"on the go","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"忙碌不停","s":"My mother is always on the go, working at the office in the day and taking care of us at night."},{"w":"on the run","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"逃跑中","s":"The thief has been on the run for three days, and the police are looking for him everywhere in the city."},{"w":"on the move","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"在移動中","s":"The soldiers were on the move all night, so they were very tired when they reached the river."},{"w":"on strike","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"罷工中","s":"The bus drivers are on strike this week, so many students have to ride their bikes to school."},{"w":"on a team","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"在隊上","s":"Amy is on a team with five other girls, and they practice volleyball together every Tuesday afternoon."},{"w":"on the team","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"隊上一員","s":"Jack has been on the team for two years, and he hopes to become the captain next spring."},{"w":"on hand","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"在手邊","s":"Always keep some water and a flashlight on hand in case the power goes out during a typhoon."},{"w":"on and on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"不停地","s":"The baby cried on and on for an hour, and nothing we did could make her stop."},{"w":"on and off","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"斷斷續續","s":"It rained on and off during the picnic, so we kept running under the big tree for cover."},{"w":"on show","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"展出中","s":"The students' pictures are on show in the school hall this week, and parents are welcome to visit."},{"w":"on offer","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"特價供應","s":"Fresh strawberries are on offer at the market today, so Mom bought three boxes to make jam."},{"w":"on the market","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"上市","s":"This new phone has been on the market for only a month, but many people have already bought it."},{"w":"on the air","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"播出中","s":"The school radio show is on the air every Friday at noon, and students can send in their favorite songs."},{"w":"on the increase","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"增加中","s":"The number of people riding bikes to work is on the increase because the roads are so crowded."},{"w":"on the rise","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"上升中","s":"Food prices are on the rise this year, so my mother is cooking more vegetables from our own garden."},{"w":"on the way","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"在路上","s":"Do not worry, Dad is already on the way, and he will pick us up at the gate in ten minutes."},{"w":"on the point of","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"即將","s":"We were on the point of leaving the house when the phone rang and Grandma invited us to lunch."},{"w":"on the basis of","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"基於","s":"The teacher chose the team captain on the basis of hard work, not on how tall or fast the players were."},{"w":"on the edge of","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"在…邊緣","s":"Our small house stands on the edge of the forest, so we hear birds singing every morning."},{"w":"on a daily basis","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"每天","s":"My grandfather walks for thirty minutes on a daily basis, and that is why he is still so healthy."},{"w":"on earth","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"究竟","s":"What on earth are you doing with my new bike in the rain at nine o'clock at night?"},{"w":"on the side","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"另外；兼職","s":"Besides teaching at school, Mr. Wang sells bread on the side to help pay for his son's college."},{"w":"on the house","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"店家招待","s":"The owner of the noodle shop said the drinks were on the house because it was his birthday today."}]},{"unit":29,"theme":"on (4)","cards":[{"w":"on me","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"我請客","s":"Lunch is on me today because you helped me carry all those heavy boxes up the stairs."},{"w":"on second thought","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"再想一想","s":"I wanted to buy the red shoes, but on second thought, the blue ones go better with my clothes."},{"w":"on the tip of my tongue","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"快想起來了","s":"The name of that actor is on the tip of my tongue, but I just cannot say it right now."},{"w":"on the same page","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"看法一致","s":"Before we start the group report, let us talk first so that everyone is on the same page about the plan."},{"w":"on good terms with","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"與…關係好","s":"Although they fought a lot when they were little, Amy is now on good terms with her older brother."},{"w":"be on the ball","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"機靈","s":"Our new class leader is really on the ball, so she always knows what we need to do next."},{"w":"get on well with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"與某人相處得好","s":"Jack gets on well with his new friends at school because he is kind and likes to share his snacks."},{"w":"keep on doing","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"繼續做","s":"Even though the rain was getting heavier, the boys kept on playing basketball on the school playground."},{"w":"go on doing","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"繼續做","s":"The teacher went on talking about the test, but most of the students were already thinking about lunch."},{"w":"carry on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"繼續","s":"After a short break for some water, the students carried on and finished the long race together."},{"w":"hold on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"稍等","s":"Hold on a second, Mom, I just need to find my school bag before we leave the house."},{"w":"come on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"快點；加油","s":"Come on, Peter, the bus leaves in five minutes and we cannot be late for school again."},{"w":"put on weight","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"變胖","s":"My uncle put on a lot of weight last winter because he ate too much and never exercised."},{"w":"put on a show","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"演出","s":"The students in Class 302 will put on a show for their parents at the end of this school year."},{"w":"put on your shoes","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"穿上鞋","s":"It is cold outside this morning, so please put on your shoes and a warm jacket before you leave."},{"w":"try on the dress","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"試穿洋裝","s":"Lisa tried on the blue dress in the store, but it was too big for her, so she chose another one."},{"w":"turn on the TV","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"開電視","s":"As soon as Grandpa got home from his walk, he turned on the TV to watch the baseball game."},{"w":"get on the bus","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"上公車","s":"We got on the bus at the train station and found two empty seats near the back door."},{"w":"move on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"繼續前進","s":"Losing the game made us sad, but our coach told us to move on and get ready for the next one."},{"w":"hang on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"稍等","s":"Hang on a minute, I cannot find my keys, and I think I left them in the kitchen."},{"w":"count on sb.","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"依賴某人","s":"You can always count on Mary when you need help with math because she is patient and smart."},{"w":"depend on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"依賴","s":"Whether we go to the beach tomorrow depends on the weather, so let us check the news tonight."},{"w":"live on rice","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"以米飯為主食","s":"Many families in Asia live on rice, and they eat it with vegetables and meat almost every day."},{"w":"live on 100 dollars a day","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"一天靠一百元過活","s":"During his trip to Japan, my cousin had to live on 100 dollars a day, so he cooked his own meals."},{"w":"spend money on books","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"把錢花在書上","s":"Instead of buying video games, Kevin spends most of his money on books about space and animals."},{"w":"spend time on homework","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"把時間花在作業上","s":"Every evening after dinner, Jenny spends about two hours on her homework before she watches any TV."},{"w":"work on a project","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"進行專案","s":"Our group is working on a science project about plants, so we water them and write notes every day."},{"w":"focus on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"專注於","s":"It is hard to focus on my studies when my little brother plays loud music in the next room."},{"w":"insist on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"堅持","s":"My grandmother always insists on cooking dinner for the whole family, even when she is very tired."},{"w":"agree on a plan","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"就計畫達成一致","s":"After talking for an hour, the five of us finally agreed on a plan for the class trip next month."},{"w":"decide on a date","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"決定日期","s":"The club members have not decided on a date for the party yet, but it will probably be next Friday."},{"w":"be based on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"根據","s":"This movie is based on a true story about a dog that waited for its owner for ten years."},{"w":"be hard on sb.","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"對某人嚴厲","s":"Do not be too hard on yourself for failing the test; you can study harder and do better next time."},{"w":"be on good terms","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"關係良好","s":"Our family is on good terms with the neighbors, so we often share food and help each other out."},{"w":"take pity on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"同情","s":"The old woman took pity on the hungry cat outside her door and gave it some fish every morning."},{"w":"play a joke on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"開…的玩笑","s":"On April Fools' Day, Tom played a joke on his sister by putting salt in her cup of tea."},{"w":"play a trick on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"捉弄","s":"The naughty boys played a trick on their teacher by hiding her chalk before the English class began."},{"w":"have an influence on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"對…有影響","s":"My music teacher has had a big influence on me, and now I want to play the piano every day."},{"w":"cheat on a test","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"考試作弊","s":"The teacher caught a student cheating on the test, so he got a zero and had to see the principal."},{"w":"wait on tables","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"餐廳服務","s":"During the summer vacation, my older sister waited on tables at a restaurant to make some extra money."}]},{"unit":30,"theme":"on (5) – out (1)","cards":[{"w":"look on the bright side","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"看光明面","s":"We missed the last train, but let us look on the bright side; now we can enjoy the night market."},{"w":"be on one's side","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"支持某人","s":""},{"w":"on one's mind","p":"prep.","d":"on · 方式","c":"掛念","s":"Something has been on my mind all week, so I could not sleep well or pay attention in class."},{"w":"get on with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"與某人相處","s":"My little sister does not get on with our new neighbor's son because he is always rude to her."},{"w":"put on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"穿上；上演","s":"The weather suddenly turned cold, so Ben put on his coat and a hat before he rode his bike to school."},{"w":"take on a job","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"接下工作","s":"My father took on a second job at night so that he could pay for my sister's college."},{"w":"turn on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"打開","s":"Please turn on the light in the kitchen because it is too dark for me to find the cups."},{"w":"try on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"試穿","s":"You should try on the shoes before you buy them because different stores can have different sizes."},{"w":"go on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"繼續；發生","s":"Nobody knows what is going on outside, but we can hear people shouting and running down the street."},{"w":"keep on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"繼續","s":"If you keep on practicing the guitar for thirty minutes every day, you will play very well by summer."},{"w":"pass on the message","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"傳話","s":"Mr. Lin is not here right now, but I will pass on the message to him as soon as he comes back."},{"w":"catch on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"流行；理解","s":"The new dance from the music video caught on quickly, and soon everyone at school was trying it."},{"w":"cheer on the team","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"為球隊加油","s":"Hundreds of students stood in the rain to cheer on the team during the final baseball game."},{"w":"count on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"指望","s":"We are counting on you to bring the cake to the party, so please do not forget it tomorrow."},{"w":"call on sb.","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"拜訪某人","s":"Every Sunday afternoon, my mother and I call on Grandma and Grandpa and bring them fresh fruit from the market."},{"w":"bring on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"引起","s":"Eating too much ice cream on a hot day can bring on a stomachache, so be careful at the night market."},{"w":"look on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"旁觀","s":"When two boys started fighting near the school gate, most students just looked on and nobody stopped them."},{"w":"sign on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"簽約","s":"My brother signed on with the city basketball team last week, and he will start practicing with them on Monday."},{"w":"lead sb. on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"誤導某人","s":"The man in the store led Grandpa on with sweet words, so he bought a watch that did not even work."},{"w":"live on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"繼續活著","s":"Although the famous singer died many years ago, her beautiful songs still live on in the hearts of many people."},{"w":"run on time","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"準時運行","s":"The trains in Japan almost always run on time, so people there can plan their trips to the minute."},{"w":"push on","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"繼續前進","s":"We were tired and hungry after five hours of walking, but we pushed on until we reached the top of the mountain."},{"w":"set on fire","p":"prep.","d":"on · 片語動詞","c":"放火燒","s":"Someone set the old house on fire last night, and it took three hours to put out the big fire."},{"w":"on the Internet (非 in)","p":"prep.","d":"on · 易混淆","c":"在網路上","s":"Many students look for information on the Internet when they write reports, but not everything there is correct."},{"w":"depend on (非 of)","p":"prep.","d":"on · 易混淆","c":"依賴","s":"Children depend on their parents for food and love, and good parents never let them down."},{"w":"go out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出去；約會","s":"My parents go out for dinner every Friday night, so my sister and I order pizza and watch movies at home."},{"w":"come out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出來；出版","s":"The new comic book comes out next Saturday, and Kevin plans to wait outside the bookstore early that morning."},{"w":"get out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出去","s":"Get out of the pool now, kids, because the sky is dark and it may start to thunder soon."},{"w":"find out the truth","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"查明真相","s":"The teacher talked to each student alone until she found out the truth about the broken window."},{"w":"figure out the answer","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"想出答案","s":"After trying for twenty minutes, Mark could finally figure out the answer to the hard math problem by himself."},{"w":"work out the problem","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"解決問題","s":"Our teacher gave us some time to work out the problem in groups before she explained it on the board."},{"w":"work out at the gym","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"健身","s":"My older brother works out at the gym three times a week because he wants to be stronger for basketball."},{"w":"put out the fire","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"撲滅火","s":"The fire trucks arrived in ten minutes, and the men put out the fire before it spread to the next house."},{"w":"turn out well","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"結果很好","s":"We were worried about the rain, but the school picnic turned out well and everyone had a great time."},{"w":"give out the papers","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"發考卷","s":"The teacher asked Linda to give out the test papers while she wrote the rules on the board."},{"w":"hand out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"分發","s":"Some students stood at the school gate and handed out free water to the players on that hot afternoon."},{"w":"run out of money","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"錢用完","s":"Jack ran out of money on the third day of his trip, so he had to call his parents for help."},{"w":"look out!","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"小心！","s":"Look out, there is a big hole in the road right in front of you, and you might fall in."},{"w":"watch out for cars","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"小心車輛","s":"Always watch out for cars when you cross the street, even if the light is green for you."},{"w":"point out the mistake","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"指出錯誤","s":"The teacher kindly pointed out the mistake in my English report, so I fixed it before I handed it in."}]},{"unit":31,"theme":"out (2)","cards":[{"w":"pick out a gift","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"挑選禮物","s":"It took Amy an hour at the mall to pick out a gift for her mother's birthday this Sunday."},{"w":"try out the new bike","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"試用新腳踏車","s":"Dad let me try out the new bike in the park on Saturday, and it rode much faster than my old one."},{"w":"take out the trash","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"倒垃圾","s":"It is my job to take out the trash every evening before the truck comes at seven o'clock."},{"w":"eat out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"外食","s":"My family eats out only once a month because my mother thinks home-cooked food is healthier and cheaper."},{"w":"hang out with friends","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"和朋友出去玩","s":"After the exam, I want to hang out with friends at the night market and eat lots of delicious snacks."},{"w":"help out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"幫忙","s":"When my mother was sick last week, my aunt came over every day to help out with the cooking and the housework."},{"w":"check out of the hotel","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"退房","s":"We have to check out of the hotel before eleven, so let us pack our bags right after breakfast."},{"w":"check out the book","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"借出書","s":"You can check out the book from the school library for two weeks, but you must return it on time."},{"w":"carry out the plan","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"執行計畫","s":"The class decided to carry out the plan for the clean-up day, so everyone brought gloves and big bags."},{"w":"break out (fire, war)","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"（火災、戰爭）爆發","s":"A fire broke out in the kitchen of the restaurant last night, but luckily nobody was hurt at all."},{"w":"cut out sugar","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"戒糖","s":"The doctor told my father to cut out sugar, so now he drinks black coffee and eats no cake."},{"w":"fill out the form","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"填表","s":"Please fill out the form with your name, phone number, and address before you join the swimming class."},{"w":"leave out a word","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"漏掉一個字","s":"When I copied the sentence from the board, I left out a word, so it did not make any sense."},{"w":"set out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出發","s":"Our family set out for Taichung early in the morning so that we could get there before the traffic got heavy."},{"w":"stand out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"突出","s":"Lily's red dress really stood out at the party because everyone else was wearing black or white."},{"w":"speak out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"大聲說出","s":"If you think the new rule is not fair, you should speak out at the class meeting instead of saying nothing."},{"w":"sell out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"賣完","s":"The tickets for the singer's show sold out in ten minutes, so many of her fans were very sad."},{"w":"sold out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"售完","s":"We got to the bakery at noon, but the chocolate cake was already sold out, so we bought cookies instead."},{"w":"wear out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"穿壞","s":"Peter plays basketball every day, so he wears out a pair of shoes in only three or four months."},{"w":"burn out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"燒盡；累垮","s":"My cousin studied until two every night for a year, and in the end he burned out and got sick."},{"w":"die out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"絕種","s":"Many kinds of animals may die out if people keep cutting down the forests they live in."},{"w":"drop out of school","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"輟學","s":"Grandpa had to drop out of school at fifteen to help his family, but he never stopped reading."},{"w":"keep out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"禁止進入","s":"The sign on the door says Keep Out, so we should not go into that room without a teacher."},{"w":"lock out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"鎖在外面","s":"I forgot my keys this morning and locked myself out, so I waited outside until Mom came home."},{"w":"let out the dog","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"放狗出去","s":"Every morning before school, I let out the dog so that it can run around in the yard for a while."},{"w":"let out a cry","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"大叫一聲","s":"The little girl let out a cry when she saw a big spider on her bed in the dark room."},{"w":"make out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"看清；理解","s":"It was so dark in the forest that we could hardly make out the path in front of us."},{"w":"pass out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"昏倒","s":"It was so hot at the sports meet that one student passed out and had to be carried to the nurse."},{"w":"rule out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"排除","s":"The doctor ruled out a cold after checking my throat, and said I just needed more sleep."},{"w":"shut out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"隔絕","s":"Jenny closed the window and shut out the noise from the street so that she could study for the test."},{"w":"sort out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"整理；解決","s":"My desk was full of old papers, so on Sunday afternoon I had to sort out everything and throw some away."},{"w":"spread out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"散開","s":"The teacher told us to spread out across the playground so that we would have enough space to dance."},{"w":"stay out late","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"晚歸","s":"My parents do not let me stay out late on school nights, so I must be home by nine."},{"w":"stick out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"突出","s":"A piece of paper sticks out of your book, so be careful or it might fall out on the bus."},{"w":"take sb. out to dinner","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"帶某人出去吃晚餐","s":"On Mother's Day, my brother and I took Mom out to dinner at her favorite Japanese restaurant."},{"w":"think out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"想清楚","s":"Before you answer the question, think it out carefully, because you only have one chance to get it right."},{"w":"throw out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"丟掉","s":"Mom asked me to throw out the old shoes in the closet because nobody has worn them for years."},{"w":"clean out the room","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"清空房間","s":"Before the new student moves in, we need to clean out the room and take away all the old boxes."},{"w":"read out loud","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"大聲讀出","s":"The teacher asked each of us to read out loud one part of the story in front of the class."},{"w":"cry out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"大叫","s":"The boy cried out in pain when the heavy ball hit him on the nose during the game."}]},{"unit":32,"theme":"out (3)","cards":[{"w":"back out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"退出","s":"Tom said he would join our team for the race, but he backed out at the last minute because he was scared."},{"w":"branch out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"擴展","s":"The small bakery on our street used to sell only bread, but now it has branched out into cakes and coffee."},{"w":"bring out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"推出；帶出","s":"The phone company will bring out a new phone next month, and my brother already wants to buy it."},{"w":"call out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"大喊","s":"The teacher called out my name three times before I finally heard her and stood up."},{"w":"count out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"排除","s":"Do not count me out of the game just because I am short; I can run faster than anyone here."},{"w":"dry out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"乾掉","s":"Leave your wet shoes near the window so that they can dry out before school tomorrow morning."},{"w":"fall out with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"與某人吵翻","s":"Kevin fell out with his best friend over a video game, and they did not talk for two whole weeks."},{"w":"get out of the car","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"下車","s":"When we got out of the car at the top of the mountain, we could see the whole city below us."},{"w":"get out of doing","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"逃避做","s":"My little brother always tries to get out of doing the dishes by saying he has too much homework."},{"w":"grow out of one's clothes","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"長大穿不下衣服","s":"My little brother grows so fast that he grew out of his clothes again, and Mom had to buy new ones."},{"w":"hold out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"堅持","s":"The small team held out until the last minute of the game, even though the other team was much stronger."},{"w":"knock out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"擊倒","s":"In the movie, the hero knocked out the bad man with one hit and then saved the little girl."},{"w":"lay out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"擺放","s":"Before the party, Mom laid out all the plates, cups, and snacks on the long table in the living room."},{"w":"look out for","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"照顧；留意","s":"My older sister always looks out for me at school, and she tells me which students are not friendly."},{"w":"miss out on","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"錯過","s":"If you stay home playing video games all weekend, you will miss out on the fun at the beach with us."},{"w":"move out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"搬出","s":"My cousin moved out of his parents' house last month and now lives in a small apartment near his office."},{"w":"play out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"進行","s":"Nobody knew how the final game would play out, because both teams were strong and had never lost this year."},{"w":"print out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"印出","s":"I need to print out my report before class because our teacher wants a paper copy, not an email."},{"w":"reach out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"伸出手；聯繫","s":"When Lisa felt lonely at her new school, she reached out to the girl next to her and asked to be friends."},{"w":"ring out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"響起","s":"The school bell rang out at four, and hundreds of happy students ran out through the front gate."},{"w":"run out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"跑出去；用完","s":"When we heard the fire bell, everyone ran out of the building and waited quietly on the playground."},{"w":"see sb. out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"送某人到門口","s":"After the party ended, Grandma saw each guest out and gave everyone a small box of cookies."},{"w":"show sb. out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"送客","s":"The meeting was over, so the manager thanked us and asked a worker to show us out of the office."},{"w":"single out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"挑出","s":"The teacher singled out Mary for her hard work and asked the class to give her a big hand."},{"w":"sit out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"坐著不參加","s":"Because of his hurt leg, Jack had to sit out the soccer game and watch his team from the side."},{"w":"sleep out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"在外過夜","s":"Last summer my friends and I slept out under the stars in Grandpa's yard and talked until midnight."},{"w":"start out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"開始","s":"Our teacher started out as a nurse, but she later found that she loved teaching children much more."},{"w":"talk sb. out of doing","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"說服某人不做","s":"Jenny wanted to cut her long hair short, but her best friend talked her out of doing it."},{"w":"turn out the light","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"關燈","s":"Please turn out the light when you leave the bathroom because we need to save energy this month."},{"w":"walk out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"走出；罷工","s":"The workers at the factory walked out this morning because they have not been paid for two months."},{"w":"wash out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"沖掉","s":"Some orange juice got on my white shirt, but luckily it washed out after I used some cold water."},{"w":"win out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"勝出","s":"In the end, hard work won out over good luck, and the small school team took home the big prize."},{"w":"out of breath","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"喘不過氣","s":"After running up the stairs to the top floor, I was so out of breath that I could not speak."},{"w":"out of sight","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"看不見","s":"The little boy waved to his mother until her bus turned the corner and was out of sight."},{"w":"out of mind","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"忘記","s":"Out of sight, out of mind, as people say, so I put the candy on a shelf I cannot see."},{"w":"out of control","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"失控","s":"The kids got out of control at the birthday party, running around and shouting while the parents talked."},{"w":"out of danger","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"脫離危險","s":"The doctor told us that Grandpa was out of danger after a long night, and we all cried with joy."},{"w":"out of fashion","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"退流行","s":"Those jeans were very popular five years ago, but now they are out of fashion, so nobody wears them."},{"w":"out of money","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"沒錢","s":"I am out of money this week because I spent it all on a new pair of basketball shoes."},{"w":"out of time","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"時間不夠","s":"We are out of time for today, so please finish the last two questions at home and bring them tomorrow."}]},{"unit":33,"theme":"out (4)","cards":[{"w":"out of place","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"不合適","s":"In his heavy winter coat, Tom looked out of place at the beach, where everyone else was in T-shirts."},{"w":"out of reach","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"拿不到","s":"Mom keeps the medicine on a high shelf so that it is out of reach of my little brother."},{"w":"out of the question","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"不可能","s":"Going to the late movie on a school night is out of the question, so do not even ask Dad again."},{"w":"out of town","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出城","s":"My father will be out of town on business this week, so Mom and I will eat dinner alone."},{"w":"out of the way","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"不礙事；偏遠","s":"Please move your bike out of the way because the old lady cannot get past it with her bags."},{"w":"out of the blue","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"突然","s":"Out of the blue, my old friend from Taipei called me last night, and we talked for two hours."},{"w":"out of shape","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"身體走樣","s":"After a winter of sitting on the sofa, Dad is really out of shape and gets tired after a short walk."},{"w":"out of luck","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"運氣不好","s":"You are out of luck today because the last two tickets for the movie were sold a minute ago."},{"w":"out of practice","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"久未練習","s":"I used to play the piano well, but I am out of practice now, so my fingers feel slow."},{"w":"out of print","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"絕版","s":"The book I wanted is out of print now, so I have to look for a used copy in old bookstores."},{"w":"out of trouble","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"脫離麻煩","s":"Grandma always tells me to stay out of trouble at school and to be kind to my teachers."},{"w":"out of kindness","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出於善意","s":"The old man fixed our bike out of kindness and would not take any money from us for his help."},{"w":"out of respect","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出於尊敬","s":"Out of respect for their teacher, all the students stood up and bowed when she walked into the room."},{"w":"out of fear","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出於恐懼","s":"The little dog hid under the bed out of fear when it heard the loud thunder outside."},{"w":"out of habit","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出於習慣","s":"Even on Sunday, Dad gets up at six out of habit and makes coffee for everyone in the family."},{"w":"out of pity","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出於同情","s":"Out of pity, the girl bought a sandwich for the hungry man sitting outside the train station."},{"w":"three out of ten","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"十分之三","s":"Three out of ten students in our class wear glasses, and most of them read too much on their phones."},{"w":"one out of five","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"五分之一","s":"Only one out of five students in our school eats breakfast every day, which worries the school nurse."},{"w":"out loud","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"大聲地","s":"When I read the funny story out loud, my whole family laughed so hard that Grandma had tears in her eyes."},{"w":"out there","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"在外面；在那裡","s":"It is raining hard out there, so please take an umbrella with you before you leave for school."},{"w":"be out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"外出；熄滅；出版","s":"My mother is out right now because she went to the supermarket, but she will be back before dinner."},{"w":"The sun is out.","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"太陽出來了。","s":"After three days of heavy rain, the sun is out at last, and the children are running happily in the park."},{"w":"The fire is out.","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"火熄了。","s":"The fire is out now, so we can leave the camp safely and walk back to the hotel together."},{"w":"School is out.","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"放學了。","s":"When school is out at four o'clock, Jenny usually buys a cup of milk tea before she goes home."},{"w":"Time is out.","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"時間到了。","s":"Time is out, so please put down your pens and hand in your test papers to the teacher now."},{"w":"be out of school","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"放學；畢業","s":"When we are out of school this afternoon, let's go to the night market and try some new food."},{"w":"be out of bed","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"起床","s":"On Sunday mornings, Peter is never out of bed before ten, because he likes to sleep late on weekends."},{"w":"be out of hospital","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出院","s":"My grandfather has been out of hospital for a week, and he already feels strong enough to take short walks."},{"w":"be out of town","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"不在城裡","s":"Mr. Lin will be out of town for three days next week, so another teacher will teach our English class."},{"w":"out and about","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"外出活動","s":"After a long week of tests, it feels great to be out and about in the warm sun with my friends."},{"w":"out of my way","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"別擋路","s":"Get out of my way, please, because I am carrying a heavy box and I cannot see the stairs clearly."},{"w":"get out of here","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"離開這裡","s":"The movie was so boring that my brother said we should get out of here and buy some ice cream instead."},{"w":"way out","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"出口；出路","s":"When the lights went off in the shopping mall, everyone looked for the way out and walked slowly to the door."},{"w":"look out of the window","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"看窗外","s":"During the long math class, Amy often looks out of the window and watches the birds in the trees."},{"w":"out of the window","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"窗外","s":"I could see the whole city out of the window of the train, and the lights at night were beautiful."},{"w":"out of nowhere","p":"prep.","d":"out · 片語動詞","c":"突然冒出","s":"A big dog came out of nowhere and ran across the street, so the driver had to stop the car quickly."},{"w":"go out (非 go out of the door 省略)","p":"prep.","d":"out · 易混淆","c":"出去","s":"It is a beautiful evening, so let's go out and take a walk by the river after we finish dinner."},{"w":"out of the window (非 out the window)","p":"prep.","d":"out · 易混淆","c":"從窗外（正式）","s":"From my seat on the plane, I looked out of the window and saw the mountains covered with white snow."}]},{"unit":34,"theme":"outside – over (1)","cards":[{"w":"outside the school","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"在學校外面","s":"Every morning, a kind old man sells hot breakfast outside the school, and many students buy sandwiches from him."},{"w":"wait outside the door","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"在門外等","s":"Please wait outside the door for a few minutes, because the doctor is still talking with another patient inside."},{"w":"play outside","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"在外面玩","s":"When the weather is warm and sunny, my little cousins love to play outside until it gets dark."},{"w":"outside the city","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"城外","s":"My grandfather and grandmother live on a quiet farm outside the city, and we visit them every Chinese New Year."},{"w":"outside the box","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"盒子外面","s":"Mom wrote my name outside the box so that nobody would take my lunch by mistake at school."},{"w":"from outside","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"從外面","s":"We heard a loud noise from outside, so Dad opened the door to see what was happening on the street."},{"w":"go outside","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"出去外面","s":"The room was too hot, so the teacher let us go outside and read our books under the trees."},{"w":"the outside of the house","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 地點","c":"房子外側","s":"The outside of the house looks old and gray, but inside it is clean, bright, and very comfortable."},{"w":"outside school hours","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"非上課時間","s":"Students may use the computer room outside school hours, but they must sign their names on the list first."},{"w":"outside of work","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"工作以外","s":"Outside of work, my father likes to go fishing with his friends and cook what he catches for us."},{"w":"think outside the box","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"跳脫框架思考","s":"Our teacher told us to think outside the box, so our group made a short movie instead of writing a report."},{"w":"an outside chance","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"微小的機會","s":"Our team has only an outside chance of winning the final game, but we will still try our best on Saturday."},{"w":"outside help","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"外部援助","s":"The small school could not fix the broken roof by itself, so it asked for outside help from the city."},{"w":"on the outside","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"在外面","s":"The cake looks a little dark on the outside, but when you cut it open, it is light and sweet inside."},{"w":"outside the law","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"不受法律管束","s":"In the story, the thief thinks he can live outside the law, but the police finally catch him in the end."},{"w":"outside my experience","p":"prep.","d":"outside · 慣用語","c":"超出我的經驗","s":"Cooking a big dinner for twenty people is outside my experience, so I asked my aunt to help me."},{"w":"fly over the city","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"飛越城市","s":"When the airplane began to fly over the city, we could see the tall buildings and the long river below."},{"w":"jump over the fence","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"跳過圍籬","s":"The ball went into the neighbor's yard, so my brother had to jump over the fence to get it back."},{"w":"a bridge over the river","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"河上的橋","s":"There is a long bridge over the river near my school, and I ride my bicycle across it every day."},{"w":"climb over the wall","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"爬過牆","s":"The boys tried to climb over the wall to get their kite, but the teacher told them it was dangerous."},{"w":"over the hill","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"翻過山丘","s":"My grandmother's village is just over the hill, so we can walk there in about twenty minutes."},{"w":"all over the world","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"全世界","s":"People all over the world love to eat noodles, and each country cooks them in a different way."},{"w":"all over the floor","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"滿地","s":"When my baby sister dropped the bag of rice, there was rice all over the floor of the kitchen."},{"w":"over there","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"在那邊","s":"The bus stop is over there, next to the post office, so you only need to cross the street."},{"w":"over here","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"在這邊","s":"Come over here and sit next to me, because there is enough space on this bench for two people."},{"w":"look over the wall","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"從牆上往那邊看","s":"The little boy stood on a chair to look over the wall and watch the children playing next door."},{"w":"a roof over my head","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"有地方住","s":"After the typhoon, many families lost their houses, and they were happy just to have a roof over their heads."},{"w":"put a blanket over him","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"給他蓋上毯子","s":"My little brother fell asleep on the sofa, so Mom put a blanket over him and turned off the light."},{"w":"a lamp over the table","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"桌子上方的燈","s":"There is a bright lamp over the table in the kitchen, so we can see our food clearly at dinner."},{"w":"hang over the city","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"籠罩城市","s":"Dark clouds began to hang over the city in the afternoon, and soon heavy rain fell on the streets."},{"w":"the sky over the sea","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"海上的天空","s":"The sky over the sea turned orange and pink in the evening, and everyone on the beach took pictures of it."},{"w":"over the road","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"馬路對面","s":"The new bakery is just over the road from our school, so we often buy fresh bread there after class."},{"w":"live over the shop","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"住在店面樓上","s":"My aunt and uncle live over the shop where they sell fruit, so they never need to drive to work."},{"w":"fall over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"跌倒","s":"The floor was wet after the rain, and the old man almost fell over when he walked into the store."},{"w":"knock over the glass","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"打翻杯子","s":"Be careful with your arm, or you will knock over the glass of juice next to your plate again."},{"w":"turn over the page","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"翻頁","s":"When you finish reading this page, turn over the page and answer the ten questions on the other side."},{"w":"roll over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"翻身","s":"The puppy likes to roll over on the grass when we come home, because it wants us to rub its stomach."},{"w":"cross over the street","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"穿越街道","s":"Always look both ways before you cross over the street, even when the light is green for you."},{"w":"spread over the land","p":"prep.","d":"over · 地點","c":"散布於土地","s":"After many years, the farmer's small apple trees spread over the land and covered the whole hill with flowers."},{"w":"over the weekend","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"在週末期間","s":"Over the weekend, my family drove to Taichung to visit my grandmother and eat her famous dumplings."}]},{"unit":35,"theme":"over (2)","cards":[{"w":"over the years","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"這些年來","s":"Over the years, the small fishing village has changed into a busy town with hotels and tall buildings."},{"w":"over lunch","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"午餐時","s":"We talked about our summer plans over lunch, and everyone agreed to go camping by the lake in July."},{"w":"over the holidays","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"假期期間","s":"Over the holidays, Lisa read five books and learned to make three kinds of cookies with her mother."},{"w":"over night","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"一夜之間","s":"The weather changed over night, and when we woke up, the mountains were covered with white snow."},{"w":"over a cup of coffee","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"邊喝咖啡邊","s":"My parents like to talk about their day over a cup of coffee after my sister and I go to bed."},{"w":"over the past week","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"過去一週","s":"Over the past week, I have practiced the piano every evening, so I feel ready for the piano show tomorrow."},{"w":"over time","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"隨著時間","s":"Learning a language is hard at first, but over time you will understand more and speak with less fear."},{"w":"over the next few days","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"接下來幾天","s":"The weather report says it will rain over the next few days, so we may need to change our picnic plans."},{"w":"over the summer","p":"prep.","d":"over · 時間","c":"暑假期間","s":"Over the summer, my cousin worked at a tea shop and saved enough money to buy a new bicycle."},{"w":"over 100 people","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"超過一百人","s":"Over 100 people came to the school music show last night, and there were not enough chairs for everyone."},{"w":"over ten years old","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"十歲以上","s":"Children over ten years old must buy a full ticket, but younger kids can enter the zoo for free."},{"w":"over 60 kilometers an hour","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"時速超過六十公里","s":"Dad never drives over 60 kilometers an hour on this road, because there is a school and many children nearby."},{"w":"talk over the phone","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"透過電話談","s":"My grandmother lives far away in Tainan, so we usually talk over the phone every Sunday evening."},{"w":"hear it over the radio","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"從廣播聽到","s":"We heard about the big typhoon over the radio while we were driving home from the beach."},{"w":"over the Internet","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"透過網路","s":"During the summer, our teacher taught the class over the Internet, and we asked questions by typing them."},{"w":"over and over again","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"一再地","s":"The little girl watched the same cartoon over and over again, and she could sing every song in it."},{"w":"be over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"結束","s":"The test will be over at eleven, and after that we can finally enjoy our long winter vacation."},{"w":"The game is over.","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"比賽結束了。","s":"The game is over, and our school team won by two points, so all the students are cheering loudly."},{"w":"It's all over.","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"全都結束了。","s":"When the last song finished and the lights came on, the singer smiled and said that it's all over."},{"w":"get over a cold","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"感冒痊癒","s":"Drink a lot of warm water and sleep early, and you will get over your cold in a few days."},{"w":"get over the shock","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"從驚嚇中恢復","s":"It took my mother several days to get over the shock of seeing our car hit by a truck."},{"w":"think it over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"仔細考慮","s":"You do not have to answer today, so think it over carefully and tell me your decision next week."},{"w":"talk it over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"好好談談","s":"Instead of being angry with each other, you and your brother should sit down and talk it over calmly."},{"w":"look over the report","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"瀏覽報告","s":"Could you look over the report for me before I give it to the teacher this afternoon?"},{"w":"go over the notes","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"複習筆記","s":"Before the big test, Kevin spent two hours going over the notes he took in science class."},{"w":"take over the business","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"接管生意","s":"When my grandfather got too old to work, my father decided to take over the business and run the restaurant."},{"w":"hand over the money","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"交出錢","s":"In the movie, the robber told the bank clerk to hand over the money, but the police arrived just in time."},{"w":"come over to my house","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"來我家","s":"Why don't you come over to my house after school, and we can play video games and eat pizza together?"},{"w":"run over the dog","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"撞到狗","s":"The driver almost ran over the dog that suddenly ran into the road, but he stopped the car just in time."},{"w":"turn over a new leaf","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"改過自新","s":"After he failed the test, Jack decided to turn over a new leaf and study for one hour every night."},{"w":"over my dead body","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"除非我死","s":"Dad said that my brother would ride a motorcycle to school over his dead body, so my brother takes the bus."},{"w":"over the moon","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"非常高興","s":"Mary was over the moon when she heard that she had won first prize in the English speech game at school."},{"w":"over the top","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"太過頭","s":"The birthday party with three cakes and a hundred balloons was a little over the top for a two-year-old."},{"w":"over the limit","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"超過限度","s":"The driver was over the limit and drove too fast, so the police stopped him and gave him a ticket."},{"w":"fight over money","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"為錢爭吵","s":"It is sad when brothers fight over money, because family is much more important than a few dollars."},{"w":"argue over a small thing","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"為小事爭論","s":"My sisters often argue over a small thing like who gets the bigger piece of cake after dinner."},{"w":"worry over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"擔心","s":"Please do not worry over the test too much, because you have studied hard and you are ready for it."},{"w":"be over the hill","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"已過壯年","s":"Grandpa says he is over the hill now, but he still rides his bicycle to the park every morning."},{"w":"do it over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"重做","s":"My writing on the card was so bad that Mom asked me to do it over on a new piece of paper."},{"w":"start over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"重新開始","s":"The computer stopped working and I lost my report, so I had to start over from the first sentence."}]},{"unit":36,"theme":"over (3) – past","cards":[{"w":"stay over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"過夜","s":"It was raining too hard to go home, so my aunt let me stay over at her apartment for the night."},{"w":"sleep over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"在別人家過夜","s":"On Friday night, my best friend will sleep over at my house, and we plan to watch three movies together."},{"w":"pull over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"停到路邊","s":"When the baby started crying in the back seat, Dad decided to pull over and check what was wrong."},{"w":"win sb. over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"贏得某人支持","s":"At first my parents said no to a pet, but my little sister finally won them over with her sweet smile."},{"w":"hand it over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"交出來","s":"The teacher saw Tom playing with his phone in class and told him to hand it over until the bell rang."},{"w":"take it over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"接手","s":"My father was too tired to finish cooking dinner, so my mother decided to take it over and make soup."},{"w":"all over again","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"再重來一遍","s":"I pushed the wrong button and lost the whole game, so now I have to play all over again from level one."},{"w":"left over","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"剩下的","s":"There was a lot of rice and chicken left over after the party, so we ate it for lunch the next day."},{"w":"head over heels","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"神魂顛倒","s":"My cousin is head over heels in love with a girl in his class, and he talks about her all day long."},{"w":"over the long run","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"長遠來看","s":"Riding a bicycle to school may seem slow, but over the long run it will save you money and keep you healthy."},{"w":"over the edge","p":"prep.","d":"over · 方式","c":"失控","s":"Losing his job and then his car almost pushed the poor man over the edge, but his friends helped him."},{"w":"jump over the wall (越過)","p":"prep.","d":"over · 易混淆","c":"跳過牆","s":"The thief tried to jump over the wall behind the house, but a big dog in the yard started to bark."},{"w":"over the bridge","p":"prep.","d":"over · 易混淆","c":"across the bridge=過橋（皆可）","s":"Every morning, hundreds of people walk over the bridge to get to the train station on the other side."},{"w":"over 100","p":"prep.","d":"over · 易混淆","c":"more than 100=超過一百","s":"Over 100 kinds of fish live in this lake, and the fishermen there catch more than fifty of them for food."},{"w":"half past six","p":"prep.","d":"past · 時間","c":"六點半","s":"My alarm clock rings at half past six every morning, and I usually leave for school half an hour later."},{"w":"ten past nine","p":"prep.","d":"past · 時間","c":"九點十分","s":"The movie starts at ten past nine, so we have twenty minutes to buy popcorn and find our seats."},{"w":"a quarter past three","p":"prep.","d":"past · 時間","c":"三點十五分","s":"School finishes at a quarter past three on Wednesdays, and then I have piano lessons until five o'clock."},{"w":"past midnight","p":"prep.","d":"past · 時間","c":"午夜過後","s":"My brother stayed up past midnight to finish his science project, so he was very sleepy in class today."},{"w":"It is past ten.","p":"prep.","d":"past · 時間","c":"已經十點多了。","s":"It is past ten already, so please turn off the TV and brush your teeth before you go to bed."},{"w":"for the past two weeks","p":"prep.","d":"past · 時間","c":"過去兩週","s":"For the past two weeks, it has rained every single day, and the soccer field is now full of water."},{"w":"past one's best","p":"prep.","d":"past · 時間","c":"巔峰已過","s":"The old basketball player is past his best now, but young fans still love to watch him play."},{"w":"walk past the bank","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"走過銀行","s":"Every day I walk past the bank on my way to school, and I say good morning to the guard there."},{"w":"drive past the school","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"開車經過學校","s":"Please slow down when you drive past the school, because many children cross the street at this time."},{"w":"run past me","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"從我身邊跑過","s":"Two boys ran past me so fast that I almost dropped my ice cream on the ground in the park."},{"w":"go past the post office","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"經過郵局","s":"To get to the library, go past the post office and turn left at the first traffic light."},{"w":"just past the corner","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"剛過轉角","s":"The night market is just past the corner, so you will see the bright lights after you turn there."},{"w":"the house past the church","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"教堂過去那間房子","s":"My piano teacher lives in the house past the church, the white one with a red door and a big garden."},{"w":"march past","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"列隊經過","s":"On Sports Day, every class will march past the teachers and parents before the first race begins."},{"w":"the bus went past","p":"prep.","d":"past · 地點","c":"公車開過去了","s":"I was still putting on my shoes when the bus went past, so I had to wait another twenty minutes."},{"w":"walk past the shop","p":"prep.","d":"past · 易混淆","c":"走過商店","s":"Grandma likes to walk past the shop every afternoon and look at the new dresses in the window."},{"w":"It's past ten.","p":"prep.","d":"past · 易混淆","c":"It's after ten.=十點多了","s":"It's past ten and my sister is still not home, so Mom keeps looking at the clock and calling her phone."}]},{"unit":37,"theme":"since – through (1)","cards":[{"w":"since last week","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"自上週起","s":"Mr. Wang has been sick since last week, so a new teacher is teaching our English class this week."},{"w":"since then","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"自那時起","s":"I met Lily at summer camp three years ago, and we have been best friends since then."},{"w":"since childhood","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"從小","s":"My uncle has loved baseball since childhood, and he still plays with his friends every Sunday morning."},{"w":"since morning","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"從早上起","s":"The students have been painting the school walls since morning, so they are tired but very proud."},{"w":"since I was ten","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"從我十歲起","s":"I have played the violin since I was ten, and now I play with the school band at every big show."},{"w":"ever since","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"從那以後一直","s":"Kevin fell off his bicycle last year, and ever since he has been very careful on the road."},{"w":"long since","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"很久以前","s":"The old factory by the river has long since closed, and now the building is a popular art center."},{"w":"since when?","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"從什麼時候開始？","s":"Since when have you liked eating vegetables, because last month you would not even touch a carrot?"},{"w":"since the beginning","p":"prep.","d":"since · 時間","c":"從一開始","s":"Since the beginning of the school year, Amy has sat in the front row and asked the most questions."},{"w":"have lived here since 2010","p":"prep.","d":"since · 易混淆","c":"從 2010 年起住在這裡","s":"My family has lived here since 2010, and my little brother was born in this house two years later."},{"w":"Since you are here, help me.","p":"prep.","d":"since · 易混淆","c":"既然你在這，幫我一下。","s":"Since you are here, help me carry these heavy boxes up the stairs, and then we can have some cake."},{"w":"It has been ten years since…","p":"prep.","d":"since · 易混淆","c":"自從…已經十年了","s":"It has been ten years since my family moved to Taipei, but my mother still misses her old town."},{"w":"walk through the forest","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"穿過森林","s":"We walked through the forest for two hours, and the tall trees kept us cool under the hot summer sun."},{"w":"go through the door","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"穿過門","s":"When you go through the door on the left, you will see the teachers' office at the end of the hall."},{"w":"look through the window","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"透過窗戶看","s":"On rainy days, I like to look through the window and watch people hurrying along the street with umbrellas."},{"w":"drive through the tunnel","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"開車穿過隧道","s":"It was dark when we drove through the tunnel, but the bright lights inside helped Dad see the road."},{"w":"through the hole","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"穿過洞","s":"A small mouse came through the hole in the kitchen wall and ran under the table to look for food."},{"w":"run through the park","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"穿過公園","s":"Every morning before school, my father and I run through the park and say hello to the old people exercising."},{"w":"the river runs through the city","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"河流貫穿城市","s":"A long river runs through the city, and on weekends many families ride bicycles along its green banks."},{"w":"swim through the water","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"在水中游過","s":"The brave boy swam through the cold water to reach the small boat and bring his little sister back to shore."},{"w":"see through the glass","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"透過玻璃看","s":"You can see through the glass of the big fish tank and watch the colorful fish swimming around the rocks."},{"w":"through the crowd","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"穿過人群","s":"At the night market, we had to push through the crowd to get to the famous stand that sells fried chicken."},{"w":"pass through Taichung","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"經過台中","s":"The train from Taipei to Kaohsiung will pass through Taichung at noon, so we can see my aunt waving from the station."},{"w":"a path through the woods","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"穿過森林的小路","s":"There is a narrow path through the woods behind our school, and it leads to a quiet little pond."},{"w":"cut through the paper","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"切穿紙","s":"The knife was so sharp that it cut through the paper easily, and I made a pretty paper flower."},{"w":"the wind blew through the trees","p":"prep.","d":"through · 地點","c":"風穿過樹林","s":"The wind blew through the trees all night, and in the morning the garden was covered with yellow leaves."},{"w":"through the night","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"整夜","s":"The baby cried through the night, so my parents looked very tired at breakfast the next morning."},{"w":"all through the year","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"整年","s":"In Taiwan, you can buy fresh fruit all through the year, because the weather is warm in most months."},{"w":"through the winter","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"整個冬天","s":"The old man kept a small fire burning through the winter to keep his little house warm and dry."},{"w":"from Monday through Friday","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"從週一到週五（含週五）","s":"The school library is open from Monday through Friday, but it is closed on weekends and national holidays."},{"w":"sleep through the class","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"整堂課都在睡","s":"Jack was so tired after the basketball game that he slept through the class and missed the whole lesson."},{"w":"through the ages","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"歷代以來","s":"Through the ages, people have looked up at the stars and told stories about the pictures they saw in them."},{"w":"work through lunch","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"午餐時間也在工作","s":"Mr. Lin was so busy with the reports that he had to work through lunch and only ate an apple."},{"w":"right through the day","p":"prep.","d":"through · 時間","c":"一整天","s":"It rained right through the day, so we stayed home and played cards instead of going to the beach."},{"w":"get through the exam","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"通過考試","s":"Amy studied hard every night, and she finally got through the exam with a very good grade."},{"w":"go through hard times","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"經歷困難時期","s":"My family went through hard times when Dad lost his job, but we helped each other and never gave up."},{"w":"go through the papers","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"仔細翻閱文件","s":"The teacher went through the papers on her desk carefully because one student's homework was missing."},{"w":"get through to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"打通某人的電話；讓某人理解","s":"I called my brother five times last night, but I could not get through to him because his phone was off."},{"w":"look through the book","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"翻閱書本","s":"Before buying it, Kevin looked through the book for a few minutes to see if the stories were interesting."},{"w":"read through the letter","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"讀完這封信","s":"Grandma read through the letter from her old friend twice, and then she smiled and put it in a box."}]},{"unit":38,"theme":"through (2) – throughout","cards":[{"w":"think through the plan","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"想透計畫","s":"We should think through the plan for the school trip before we tell the whole class about it."},{"w":"see through his lies","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"看穿他的謊言","s":"Tom said he was sick, but his mother saw through his lies at once because he was still laughing."},{"w":"live through the war","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"經歷戰爭","s":"My great-grandfather lived through the war when he was a boy, and he often tells us how hard life was."},{"w":"break through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"突破","s":"The sun finally broke through the dark clouds in the afternoon, and the children ran outside to play."},{"w":"come through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"度過難關；送達","s":"Jenny was very ill last winter, but she came through and is now back on the school swimming team."},{"w":"pull through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"康復","s":"The doctor said my grandfather was very weak, but he pulled through after two weeks in the hospital."},{"w":"put sb. through to","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"為某人接通電話","s":"When I called the hotel, the woman at the front desk put me through to the manager right away."},{"w":"run through the list","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"快速瀏覽清單","s":"Before we leave for the camping trip, let's run through the list and make sure we have packed everything."},{"w":"sit through the movie","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"坐著看完電影","s":"The movie was so boring that Peter could hardly sit through the movie without falling asleep in his seat."},{"w":"talk through the problem","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"把問題談透","s":"Instead of shouting at each other, the two friends sat down and talked through the problem calmly."},{"w":"be through with","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"結束；斷絕關係","s":"After he lied to me three times, I told Jack that I was through with him and walked away."},{"w":"I'm through.","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"我做完了。","s":"Mom, I'm through with my homework, so can I go to the park and ride my bike with Linda now?"},{"w":"We are through.","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"我們分手了。","s":"After the big fight on Saturday night, Lisa cried and told Mike that they were through for good."},{"w":"through and through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"徹頭徹尾","s":"My grandfather has lived in Tainan all his life, and he is a Tainan person through and through."},{"w":"through the roof","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"暴漲","s":"After the typhoon, the price of vegetables went through the roof, so my mother bought more eggs instead."},{"w":"through thick and thin","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"同甘共苦","s":"Mary and Jane have been best friends since they were five, and they stay together through thick and thin."},{"w":"learn through practice","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"透過練習學習","s":"You cannot learn to swim just by reading a book; you learn through practice in the water every week."},{"w":"through hard work","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"透過努力","s":"Through hard work and many early mornings, Jason finally made the school basketball team this year."},{"w":"through a friend","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"透過朋友","s":"My sister found her first job through a friend who worked at the same restaurant near the station."},{"w":"go through with the plan","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"把計畫執行到底","s":"Even though it started to rain, the class decided to go through with the plan and held the picnic."},{"w":"carry through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"完成","s":"It is easy to make a New Year plan, but it is hard to carry it through for a whole year."},{"w":"follow through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"貫徹到底","s":"Ben always says he will exercise every morning, but he never follows through, and his mother is tired of hearing it."},{"w":"fall through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"落空","s":"Our plan to visit the zoo on Sunday fell through because Dad suddenly had to go to work."},{"w":"through no fault of mine","p":"prep.","d":"through · 方式","c":"不是我的錯","s":"The bus was late and I missed the first class through no fault of mine, but the teacher was still angry."},{"w":"through","p":"prep.","d":"through · 易混淆","c":"by way of (經由)=經由","s":"We traveled to Kaohsiung through Taichung, and we stopped there for a bowl of beef noodles."},{"w":"throughout the country","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 地點","c":"全國各地","s":"Night markets are popular throughout the country, and every city has its own famous snacks to try."},{"w":"throughout the world","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 地點","c":"全世界","s":"Soccer is loved by people throughout the world, so the World Cup is watched by millions of fans."},{"w":"throughout the house","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 地點","c":"整間屋子","s":"The smell of Grandma's chicken soup filled the air throughout the house, and everyone felt hungry at once."},{"w":"throughout the city","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 地點","c":"全市","s":"During the festival, there were lanterns throughout the city, and visitors took pictures on every street."},{"w":"throughout the school","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 地點","c":"全校","s":"The news about the new swimming pool spread throughout the school in one morning, and everyone was excited."},{"w":"throughout the year","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"一年到頭","s":"The weather in Taitung is warm throughout the year, so many people like to go there in winter."},{"w":"throughout the day","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"一整天","s":"It was so hot that the students drank water throughout the day and kept the fans on in class."},{"w":"throughout the night","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"整夜","s":"The loud music from the party next door went on throughout the night, so nobody in my family slept well."},{"w":"throughout history","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"整個歷史上","s":"Throughout history, people have built bridges over rivers so that they could trade with their neighbors."},{"w":"throughout one's life","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"一生中","s":"My grandmother was a teacher, and she kept reading and learning new things throughout her life."},{"w":"throughout the summer","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"整個夏天","s":"Jack worked at his uncle's ice cream shop throughout the summer to save money for a new bike."},{"w":"throughout the game","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"整場比賽","s":"The fans cheered loudly throughout the game, even when our team was losing by ten points."},{"w":"throughout the lesson","p":"prep.","d":"throughout · 時間","c":"整堂課","s":"Peter kept looking out of the window throughout the lesson, so the teacher asked him a difficult question."}]},{"unit":39,"theme":"till – to (1)","cards":[{"w":"till now","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"直到現在","s":"I have lived in this small town till now, and I have never seen snow in my life."},{"w":"till then","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"直到那時","s":"The school play is next Friday, so we have to practice every day till then after class."},{"w":"wait till Friday","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"等到週五","s":"Mom said I have to wait till Friday to open the present, but I really want to see what is inside."},{"w":"not till tomorrow","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"要到明天才","s":"The new shoes will not arrive till tomorrow, so I have to wear my old ones to the game today."},{"w":"till the end","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"直到最後","s":"Even though our team was losing, we did not give up and played hard till the end of the game."},{"w":"till late","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"直到很晚","s":"Dad often works till late at the office, so he usually eats dinner alone after we go to bed."},{"w":"till death","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"至死","s":"In the old story, the prince promised to love the princess till death, and he never broke his word."},{"w":"from nine till five","p":"prep.","d":"till · 時間","c":"九點到五點","s":"My mother works at the bank from nine till five, so my grandmother picks me up after school."},{"w":"until now","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"直到現在","s":"Until now, I did not know that my quiet friend Helen could sing so beautifully on stage."},{"w":"until then","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"直到那時","s":"The movie starts at seven, and until then we can have some noodles at the shop around the corner."},{"w":"until midnight","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"直到午夜","s":"Jenny stayed up until midnight to finish her science report, so she was very tired at school today."},{"w":"until the end of the month","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"直到月底","s":"My brother has no money left, so he cannot buy any new games until the end of the month."},{"w":"not until ten","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"直到十點才","s":"The shopping mall does not open until ten, so we had breakfast first and walked around the park."},{"w":"wait until the rain stops","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"等到雨停","s":"Let's wait until the rain stops before we ride our bikes home, or our books will get wet."},{"w":"up until last year","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"直到去年","s":"Up until last year, my little sister was afraid of dogs, but now she wants one for her birthday."},{"w":"until late at night","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"直到深夜","s":"On Chinese New Year's Eve, my whole family stays up until late at night to play cards and eat snacks."},{"w":"until next time","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"下次見","s":"The teacher said goodbye and until next time, and told us to practice the new words at home."},{"w":"stay until Sunday","p":"prep.","d":"until · 時間","c":"待到週日","s":"Our cousins from Japan will stay until Sunday, so we are taking them to the night market tonight."},{"w":"wait until six","p":"prep.","d":"until · 易混淆","c":"等到六點","s":"Dad is still at work, so we will wait until six to eat dinner together as a family."},{"w":"I didn't sleep until midnight.","p":"prep.","d":"until · 易混淆","c":"我直到半夜才睡。","s":"Because of the loud thunder, my little brother didn't sleep until midnight and was very sleepy at breakfast."},{"w":"I slept until noon.","p":"prep.","d":"until · 易混淆","c":"我睡到中午。","s":"It was a holiday, so I turned off my alarm and slept until noon for the first time in months."},{"w":"until","p":"prep.","d":"until · 易混淆","c":"till (較口語)=直到（兩者相同）","s":"The two words mean the same, so you can wait until Friday or wait till Friday for the big sale."},{"w":"Not until then did I know.","p":"prep.","d":"until · 易混淆","c":"直到那時我才知道。（倒裝）","s":"Not until then did I know that my best friend was moving to Taichung at the end of the summer."},{"w":"go to school","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"去上學","s":"Every morning, Emma goes to school by bike with her best friend, and they talk about their favorite songs."},{"w":"the way to the station","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"去車站的路","s":"A foreign woman stopped me on the street and asked me the way to the station in slow English."},{"w":"turn to the left","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"向左轉","s":"Walk two blocks and turn to the left at the post office, and you will see the library."},{"w":"to the north","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"往北","s":"The birds fly to the north every spring, and my grandfather likes to watch them from the roof."},{"w":"the door to the kitchen","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"通往廚房的門","s":"Please close the door to the kitchen, because the smell of fish is getting into the living room."},{"w":"next to the bank","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"在銀行旁邊","s":"The new milk tea shop is next to the bank, so we can stop there after we finish shopping."},{"w":"close to the park","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"靠近公園","s":"My grandfather and grandmother live close to the park, so they take a walk there every morning before breakfast."},{"w":"face to face","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"面對面","s":"We have written to each other for a year, but tomorrow I will finally meet my pen friend face to face."},{"w":"back to back","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"背對背","s":"The two boys stood back to back so that their mother could see which one of them was taller."},{"w":"from door to door","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"挨家挨戶","s":"Before the vote, the man went from door to door to talk to people about his ideas for the town."},{"w":"to the end of the road","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"到路的盡頭","s":"Walk to the end of the road and you will see a small temple with a big tree in front."},{"w":"to the east of Taipei","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"在台北東邊","s":"Keelung is to the east of Taipei, and it is famous for its night market and rainy weather."},{"w":"point to the sky","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"指向天空","s":"The little girl pointed to the sky and shouted happily when she saw a rainbow after the rain."},{"w":"a visit to Japan","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"去日本的旅行","s":"During our visit to Japan last winter, we saw snow for the first time and ate a lot of good food."},{"w":"a trip to Tainan","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"去台南的旅行","s":"Our class is planning a trip to Tainan next month, and we want to try the famous beef soup there."},{"w":"the road to success","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"通往成功的路","s":"My coach always says that the road to success is long and hard, so we must practice every day."},{"w":"on the way to work","p":"prep.","d":"to · 地點","c":"上班途中","s":"Dad buys a cup of coffee and a newspaper at the same shop on the way to work every morning."}]},{"unit":40,"theme":"to (2)","cards":[{"w":"ten to six","p":"prep.","d":"to · 時間","c":"五點五十","s":"It is ten to six now, so hurry up, or we will miss the bus to the night market."},{"w":"a quarter to three","p":"prep.","d":"to · 時間","c":"兩點四十五分","s":"The math test starts at a quarter to three, so let's go back to the class after we drink some water."},{"w":"to this day","p":"prep.","d":"to · 時間","c":"直到今天","s":"My grandmother gave me a small blue cup when I was five, and I still use it to this day."},{"w":"to date","p":"prep.","d":"to · 時間","c":"至今","s":"This is the best score our basketball team has had to date, so the coach bought us all ice cream."},{"w":"count to ten","p":"prep.","d":"to · 時間","c":"數到十","s":"When you are angry, close your eyes and count to ten slowly before you say anything to anyone."},{"w":"give it to me","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"把它給我","s":"That is my notebook on your desk, so please give it to me before the class begins."},{"w":"say hello to him","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"向他問好","s":"If you see my brother at the bus stop this afternoon, please say hello to him for me."},{"w":"talk to the teacher","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"和老師說話","s":"Lucy was worried about her grades, so she stayed after class to talk to the teacher about it."},{"w":"listen to music","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"聽音樂","s":"My sister likes to listen to music while she does her homework, but I need a quiet room."},{"w":"write to a friend","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"寫信給朋友","s":"Instead of sending a short message on his phone, Grandpa still writes to a friend in America by hand every month."},{"w":"belong to me","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"屬於我","s":"The red umbrella by the door does not belong to me; I think someone left it here yesterday."},{"w":"happen to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"發生在某人身上","s":"Something strange happened to Mark on his way home, and he could not stop talking about it at dinner."},{"w":"lead to success","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"導致成功","s":"Hard work and a good plan usually lead to success, so do not give up when things get difficult."},{"w":"get to the point","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"講重點","s":"We only have five minutes before the bell rings, so please get to the point and tell us your idea."},{"w":"come to an end","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"結束","s":"When the summer vacation came to an end, the students were sad but also happy to see their friends again."},{"w":"the answer to the question","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"問題的答案","s":"Nobody in the class knew the answer to the question, so the teacher gave us a little help with it."},{"w":"the key to the door","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"門的鑰匙","s":"I lost the key to the door, so I had to wait outside until my mother came home from work."},{"w":"an invitation to the party","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"派對邀請","s":"Kelly got an invitation to the party on Saturday, and now she is looking for a nice dress to wear."},{"w":"a ticket to the show","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"表演的票","s":"My uncle gave me a ticket to the show, so I can finally see my favorite singer this weekend."},{"w":"a reply to the letter","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"回信","s":"Amy waited for two weeks, but she never got a reply to the letter she sent to the writer."},{"w":"the way to do it","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"做這件事的方法","s":"My dad showed me the way to do it, and now I can cook rice without burning it."},{"w":"be kind to animals","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對動物友善","s":"My teacher always tells us to be kind to animals, so we feed the street cats near the school."},{"w":"be nice to me","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對我好","s":"My older brother is usually nice to me, but he gets angry when I touch his computer games."},{"w":"be good to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對某人好","s":"My grandmother was always good to the children on our street, and they still visit her today."},{"w":"be rude to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對某人沒禮貌","s":"The boy was rude to the old lady on the bus, and everyone around him looked very unhappy."},{"w":"be polite to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對…有禮貌","s":"Please be polite to the guests from Japan tomorrow and help them when they cannot understand something."},{"w":"be friendly to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對…友善","s":"The students in my new class were friendly to me on the first day, so I was not nervous anymore."},{"w":"be close to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"靠近；親近","s":"Jenny is very close to her grandmother, and she visits her every weekend to cook dinner together."},{"w":"be next to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"在…旁邊","s":"The bakery is next to my school, so I can smell fresh bread every morning when I arrive."},{"w":"be used to doing","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"習慣做","s":"My father is used to getting up at five every morning, so he never needs an alarm clock."},{"w":"be similar to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"與…相似","s":"Your new phone is similar to mine, but yours has a bigger screen and a better camera."},{"w":"be married to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"與…結婚","s":"My English teacher is married to a doctor, and they have two cute children and a small dog."},{"w":"be new to the job","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對工作還很生","s":"Sam is still new to the job at the coffee shop, so he sometimes gets the orders wrong."},{"w":"be true to one's word","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"守信","s":"Dad was true to his word and took us to the beach on Sunday, even though he was tired."},{"w":"be late to class","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"上課遲到","s":"I missed the bus this morning and was late to class, so the teacher asked me to stay after school."},{"w":"be important to me","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對我很重要","s":"This old watch is very important to me because my grandfather gave it to me before he died."},{"w":"be helpful to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對…有幫助","s":"The map on your phone is very helpful to visitors who do not know the streets of Taipei."},{"w":"be known to everyone","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"眾所皆知","s":"It is known to everyone in school that Mr. Wang gives a quiz every Friday afternoon."},{"w":"be open to all","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"對所有人開放","s":"The new city library is open to all, so you do not need a card just to read there."},{"w":"be ready to go","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"準備出發","s":"The bags are in the car and the kids are ready to go, so let's leave for the mountains now."}]},{"unit":41,"theme":"to (3)","cards":[{"w":"to one's surprise","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"令某人驚訝的是","s":"To her surprise, Linda found a birthday cake and a card from her friends in class on her desk."},{"w":"to my joy","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"令我高興的是","s":"To my joy, the teacher said our class could have a party on the last day of school."},{"w":"to be honest","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"老實說","s":"To be honest, I did not like the movie very much because the story was too slow and long."},{"w":"to tell the truth","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"說實話","s":"To tell the truth, I forgot to do my homework last night because I was playing games with my cousin."},{"w":"to begin with","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"首先","s":"To begin with, let's write down the things we need for the picnic, and then we can go shopping."},{"w":"to the point","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"切中要點","s":"The teacher likes Mary's answers because they are always short and to the point, with no extra words."},{"w":"to one's taste","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"合某人口味","s":"The new restaurant was not to my taste, because the food was too sweet and the music was too loud."},{"w":"to the best of my knowledge","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"就我所知","s":"To the best of my knowledge, the school bus leaves at seven thirty, but you should check with the office."},{"w":"to this end","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"為此","s":"Our class wants to win the singing game at school, and to this end we practice every day after school."},{"w":"to no end","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"白白地","s":"I waited for the bus in the rain for an hour to no end, because the bus never came that day."},{"w":"one to one","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"一對一","s":"After class, the teacher helped me one to one with the math problems I did not understand."},{"w":"ten to one","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"十比一；很可能","s":"Ten to one, Tom will forget his umbrella again today, because he never checks the weather report."},{"w":"a mother to three children","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"三個孩子的母親","s":"Mrs. Chen is a mother to three children, and she still finds time to run every morning."},{"w":"dance to the music","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"隨音樂起舞","s":"At the party, everyone danced to the music, and even my shy brother moved his feet a little."},{"w":"sing to the guitar","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"伴著吉他唱","s":"My uncle played and we all sang to the guitar around the fire at the beach last night."},{"w":"add sugar to the tea","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"在茶裡加糖","s":"Grandpa likes to add sugar to the tea, but the doctor told him to drink it without sugar."},{"w":"compare A to B","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"把 A 比作 B","s":"My father often compares life to a long trip, because you never know what you will see next."},{"w":"look forward to seeing you","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"期待見到你","s":"I am looking forward to seeing you at the school fair next week, so please do not forget."},{"w":"pay attention to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"注意","s":"Please pay attention to the traffic lights when you ride your bike, because the road is very busy here."},{"w":"get used to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"習慣於","s":"It took me two months to get used to the cold weather after we moved to the mountains."},{"w":"make up to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"補償某人","s":"Jack broke his sister's toy, so he wants to make up to her by buying her a new one."},{"w":"up to you","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"由你決定","s":"We can eat pizza or noodles tonight; it is up to you, because you cooked dinner yesterday."},{"w":"up to 100","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"最多一百","s":"The hall can hold up to one hundred people, so every student in our grade can watch the show."},{"w":"down to the last cent","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"直到最後一分錢","s":"Lisa spent all her birthday money on books, down to the last cent, and still wanted more."},{"w":"to a certain degree","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"某種程度上","s":"I agree with you to a certain degree, but I still think we need more time to finish the project."},{"w":"to the last","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"直到最後","s":"The old soldier stayed brave to the last and never told the enemy where his friends were hiding."},{"w":"to death","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"…死","s":"The little boy was scared to death when the lights went out during the storm last night."},{"w":"be bored to death","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"無聊得要死","s":"We were bored to death during the long speech, and some students even fell asleep in their seats."},{"w":"to pieces","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"成碎片","s":"The glass fell off the table and broke to pieces, so Mom told us to stay away from the kitchen."},{"w":"tear it to pieces","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"把它撕碎","s":"My little brother got angry at his drawing and tore it to pieces before I could stop him."},{"w":"to one's face","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"當面","s":"If you have a problem with Kevin, tell him to his face instead of talking behind his back."},{"w":"to the letter","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"一絲不苟","s":"Follow the steps in the cookie book to the letter the first time you bake, and they will come out just right."},{"w":"to the full","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"充分地","s":"Grandpa says we should enjoy every holiday to the full, because time with family passes very quickly."},{"w":"to the minute","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"一分不差","s":"The train in Japan arrived at the station at nine fifteen, right to the minute, which surprised us all."},{"w":"from place to place","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"到處","s":"My father's job takes him from place to place, so we have lived in four cities in six years."},{"w":"from bad to worse","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"越來越糟","s":"Our team's season went from bad to worse after our best player hurt his knee in the second game."},{"w":"from start to finish","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"從頭到尾","s":"The movie was exciting from start to finish, so nobody in the theater looked at their phone."},{"w":"room to room","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"一間接一間","s":"The little puppy ran from room to room looking for its ball, and we all laughed at it."},{"w":"cheek to cheek","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"臉貼臉","s":"In the old photo, Grandpa and Grandma are dancing cheek to cheek at their wedding fifty years ago."},{"w":"hand to hand","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"肉搏","s":"In the movie, the hero fought the robber hand to hand on the roof of a tall building."}]},{"unit":42,"theme":"to (4)","cards":[{"w":"heart to heart","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"坦誠地","s":"After the fight, the two sisters had a heart to heart talk and promised to be honest with each other."},{"w":"side by side (非 to)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"並肩","s":"The two friends walked side by side to the station, talking and laughing all the way there."},{"w":"turn to sb. for help","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"向某人求助","s":"When I could not understand the science homework, I turned to my older sister for help."},{"w":"turn to page 10","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"翻到第十頁","s":"The teacher asked us to turn to page ten and read the first story quietly for five minutes."},{"w":"take to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"喜歡上某人","s":"My dog took to our new neighbor right away, and now he runs to her whenever she comes home."},{"w":"get to know","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"逐漸認識","s":"It took a few weeks to get to know the new students in my class, but now we eat lunch together."},{"w":"come to think of it","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"想起來","s":"Come to think of it, I left my umbrella on the bus this morning, so I need to call the bus company."},{"w":"come to one's senses","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"恢復理智","s":"After losing all his pocket money on games, Peter finally came to his senses and started saving."},{"w":"see to it that","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"確保","s":"Please see to it that all the windows are closed before you leave, because a typhoon is coming tonight."},{"w":"drink to your health","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"為你的健康乾杯","s":"At Grandma's birthday dinner, we all raised our glasses and drank to her health and a long happy life."},{"w":"Here's to you!","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"敬你一杯！","s":"At the party, my uncle stood up, raised his glass to Grandma, and said Here's to you with a big smile."},{"w":"be about to do","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"即將做","s":"We were about to leave for the beach when it suddenly began to rain hard, so we stayed home."},{"w":"be yet to come","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"尚未來到","s":"The coach told us the hardest part of the training is yet to come, so we should rest well tonight."},{"w":"to go","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"外帶","s":"I would like two chicken sandwiches and a large milk tea to go, because I am eating on the train."},{"w":"two to go","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"還剩兩個","s":"I have finished eight math problems, and there are only two to go before I can watch TV."},{"w":"the week to come","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"即將來的一週","s":"The weather report says the week to come will be cold and rainy, so bring a jacket to school."},{"w":"to and from school","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"往返學校","s":"Many students ride their bikes to and from school, so the road is very busy at eight and four."},{"w":"to the last drop","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"直到最後一滴","s":"The soup was so delicious that my brother finished it to the last drop and asked for more."},{"w":"to the touch","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"摸起來","s":"The stone wall felt cold to the touch, even though the sun had been shining on it all afternoon."},{"w":"soft to the touch","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"摸起來很軟","s":"The baby's new blanket is soft to the touch, and she falls asleep as soon as she holds it."},{"w":"to the eye","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"看起來","s":"The cake looked beautiful to the eye, but when we ate it, the taste was too sweet for everyone."},{"w":"to the ear","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"聽起來","s":"Her English sounds pleasing to the ear because she practices speaking with a foreign friend every weekend."},{"w":"music to my ears","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"悅耳的消息","s":"When my mother said we would go to Japan this summer, the news was music to my ears."},{"w":"to my knowledge","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"據我所知","s":"To my knowledge, the school library closes at five on Fridays, so we should hurry up and finish our homework."},{"w":"to my mind","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"依我看","s":"To my mind, playing basketball after school is a better way to rest than watching TV for hours."},{"w":"to my cost","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"付出代價後才知","s":"Tom learned to his cost that eating too much ice cream before a race makes your stomach hurt badly."},{"w":"lend money to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"借錢給","s":"My brother did not want to lend money to his friend because the boy never paid him back last time."},{"w":"sell it to him","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"賣給他","s":"Mary has an old bike that she does not ride anymore, so she decided to sell it to him for a low price."},{"w":"show it to me","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"拿給我看","s":"If you drew a picture of our class trip, please show it to me before you hand it to the teacher."},{"w":"teach English to kids","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"教小孩英文","s":"On Saturday mornings, my aunt teaches English to kids at a small school near the train station."},{"w":"send a card to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"寄卡片給","s":"Every year on her birthday, I send a card to my grandmother because she lives far away in Tainan."},{"w":"bring it to the party","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"帶來派對","s":"Grandma made a big chocolate cake, and she asked me to bring it to the party at Lisa's house."},{"w":"explain it to me","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"向我解釋","s":"I did not understand the math question, so I asked my sister to explain it to me slowly after dinner."},{"w":"introduce A to B","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"把 A 介紹給 B","s":"At the party, Peter was happy to introduce his new friend to his parents, who liked her at once."},{"w":"describe it to me","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"向我描述","s":"The police officer asked the woman to describe the thief to him, and she said he was tall and thin."},{"w":"suggest it to him","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"向他建議","s":"I have a good idea for the school festival, and I will suggest it to him at the class meeting tomorrow."},{"w":"report to the teacher","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"向老師報告","s":"When the students saw a broken window in the hall, they went to report it to the teacher right away."},{"w":"apologize to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"向某人道歉","s":"After he broke his friend's glasses by accident, Ben went to apologize to her and offered to buy new ones."},{"w":"reply to the email","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"回信","s":"My teacher sent me a question about my report last night, so I need to reply to the email this morning."},{"w":"object to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"反對","s":"Many parents object to the plan for a longer school day because their children already have too much homework."}]},{"unit":43,"theme":"to (5)","cards":[{"w":"agree to a plan","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"同意計畫","s":"After talking for an hour, everyone in the club agreed to the plan to hold a bake sale next month."},{"w":"stick to the plan","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"堅持計畫","s":"Even though it started raining, we decided to stick to the plan and go hiking in the mountains anyway."},{"w":"belong to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"屬於","s":"This blue umbrella does not belong to me; I think it belongs to the girl who sat beside me on the bus."},{"w":"go to bed","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"去睡覺","s":"My little brother always goes to bed at nine o'clock because he has to get up early for school."},{"w":"go to work","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"去上班","s":"My father goes to work by bus every day, but on rainy days my mother drives him to the office."},{"w":"go to sleep","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"入睡","s":"The baby could not go to sleep last night because the dogs outside kept barking loudly until midnight."},{"w":"go to the movies","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"去看電影","s":"On Friday night, my cousins and I like to go to the movies and share a big box of popcorn."},{"w":"go to church","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"去教堂","s":"Every Sunday morning, Mrs. Lin goes to church with her family, and then they have lunch at a noodle shop."},{"w":"get to school","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"到學校","s":"It takes me about twenty minutes to get to school by bike, so I always leave home before seven."},{"w":"get to work","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"開始工作","s":"We have only one hour to finish this picture, so let's stop talking and get to work right now."},{"w":"back to school","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"返校","s":"Summer vacation is almost over, and the stores are full of parents buying bags and pens for back to school."},{"w":"back to normal","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"恢復正常","s":"After the big storm passed, it took three days for the trains in the city to get back to normal."},{"w":"back to the point","p":"prep.","d":"to · 方式","c":"回到正題","s":"We were talking about the weekend, but then the teacher said we should get back to the point and finish the lesson."},{"w":"go to school (非 go to the school)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"去上學 vs. 去學校建築","s":"My sister goes to school by bus every morning, but today she went to the school to meet her old teacher."},{"w":"go to bed (非 the bed)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"去睡覺","s":"I usually go to bed at ten, and I never read under the bed covers because it hurts my eyes."},{"w":"go home (無 to)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"回家","s":"After the game ended, the tired players went home quickly instead of going to the restaurant with their coach."},{"w":"go there (無 to)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"去那裡","s":"My aunt and uncle live near the beach, and we go there every summer to swim and play in the sand."},{"w":"arrive at/in (非 to)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"到達","s":"We arrived at the station late, so we did not get to Taipei until nine instead of eight o'clock."},{"w":"reach the station (無 to)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"到達車站","s":"We walked fast and reached the station just in time, but the bus to the beach had already left."},{"w":"get to the station","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"到達車站","s":"If you take the number ten bus, you can get to the station in fifteen minutes without changing buses."},{"w":"listen to (非 listen)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"聽","s":"On the way to school, I like to listen to music on my phone, but I always turn it off in class."},{"w":"say to sb. (非 say sb.)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"對某人說","s":"Before the game, the coach said to the players that they should enjoy playing and not worry about winning."},{"w":"explain to me (非 explain me)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"向我解釋","s":"The new game rules are hard, so could you explain them to me again before we start playing?"},{"w":"be married to (非 with)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"與…結婚","s":"My English teacher is married to a doctor, and they have two cute children who go to our school."},{"w":"be similar to (非 with)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"與…相似","s":"Your new jacket is similar to mine, so people might think we bought them at the same store."},{"w":"the answer to (非 of)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"…的答案","s":"Nobody in our class knew the answer to the last question, so the teacher explained it on the board."},{"w":"pay attention to (非 on)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"注意","s":"The teacher told us to pay attention to the signs on the road when we ride our bikes to school."},{"w":"look forward to + V-ing","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"期待","s":"My whole family is looking forward to visiting Japan next winter because we all want to see the snow."},{"w":"two / too / to","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"二／也／到","s":"The two boys were too tired to walk to the station, so their mother drove them there in the car."},{"w":"up to you (由你決定)","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"由你決定","s":"We can have pizza or noodles for dinner tonight; it is up to you, so just tell me what you want."},{"w":"It's up to you.","p":"prep.","d":"to · 易混淆","c":"由你決定。","s":"You can join the basketball team or the music club, and it's up to you, so think about it carefully this week."}]},{"unit":44,"theme":"toward – under (1)","cards":[{"w":"walk toward the door","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"朝門走去","s":"When the bell rang, the students put their books in their bags and walked toward the door quickly."},{"w":"run toward me","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"朝我跑來","s":"I was waiting at the park, and my dog saw me and started to run toward me with a ball in its mouth."},{"w":"turn toward the window","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"轉向窗戶","s":"When she heard the loud thunder, Amy turned toward the window and saw the rain falling hard outside."},{"w":"look toward the sea","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"望向海面","s":"We sat on the beach, looked toward the sea, and watched the sun go down slowly behind the boats."},{"w":"point toward the hill","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"指向山丘","s":"The old farmer pointed toward the hill and told us that his house was just behind the tall trees."},{"w":"a step toward peace","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"邁向和平的一步","s":"When the two angry boys finally shook hands after the fight, it was the first step toward peace in our class."},{"w":"move toward the exit","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"朝出口移動","s":"After the movie ended, hundreds of people stood up and moved toward the exit at the same time."},{"w":"head toward home","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 地點","c":"朝家前進","s":"The sky was getting dark, so we picked up our bags and started to head toward home before the rain came."},{"w":"toward the end of the year","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"接近年底","s":"Toward the end of the year, the stores in the city are full of people buying gifts for their families."},{"w":"toward evening","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"傍晚時分","s":"Toward evening, the wind became cooler, and the children stopped playing in the park and went home for dinner."},{"w":"toward midnight","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"接近午夜","s":"Toward midnight, the streets were quiet, and only one small store near the station was still open."},{"w":"be kind toward animals","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"對動物友善","s":"My grandmother is always kind toward animals, and she feeds the hungry cats near her house every morning."},{"w":"feelings toward him","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"對他的感覺","s":"Her feelings toward him changed after he helped her carry the heavy boxes up the stairs in the rain."},{"w":"save money toward a car","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"為買車存錢","s":"My older brother works at a restaurant on weekends because he is saving money toward a car for next year."},{"w":"work toward a goal","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"朝目標努力","s":"Our team practices every day after school because we are working toward the goal of winning the city game."},{"w":"a change toward the better","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 慣用語","c":"往好的方向變","s":"After the new teacher came, there was a change toward the better in our class, and everyone studied harder."},{"w":"walk toward the station (朝車站走)","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 易混淆","c":"朝車站走","s":"Tom walked toward the station to meet his friend, but he stopped at a store to buy some drinks first."},{"w":"toward","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 易混淆","c":"towards (英式)=朝向（兩者皆可）","s":"The little girl ran toward her father with a big smile, and he picked her up and gave her a big hug."},{"w":"be kind toward / to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"toward · 易混淆","c":"對某人好（皆可）","s":"Our teacher is always kind toward us, and she is also kind to the new student who speaks little Chinese."},{"w":"under the table","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在桌子下","s":"The cat likes to sleep under the table during dinner because it hopes we will drop some food for it."},{"w":"under the bed","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在床下","s":"I could not find my shoes this morning, and at last I found them under the bed with my socks."},{"w":"under the tree","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在樹下","s":"It was very hot at noon, so the children sat under the tree and ate their ice cream in the cool air."},{"w":"under the bridge","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在橋下","s":"When the rain started, we ran under the bridge and waited there until the sky became clear again."},{"w":"under the water","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在水下","s":"My brother can hold his breath under the water for one minute, but I can only do it for twenty seconds."},{"w":"under the sea","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在海底","s":"Many strange and beautiful fish live under the sea, and some of them can even make their own light."},{"w":"under the sun","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在太陽下；世上","s":"We stood under the sun for an hour at the sports meet, so everyone was thirsty and wanted cold water."},{"w":"under one's arm","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"夾在腋下","s":"The boy ran out of the house with a basketball under his arm and went to meet his friends at the park."},{"w":"under the ground","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在地底下","s":"The train goes under the ground for most of the trip, so you cannot see anything outside the window."},{"w":"under the sky","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在天空下","s":"On the first night of our camping trip, we slept under the sky and counted the stars until we fell asleep."},{"w":"under a blanket","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"在毯子下","s":"It was so cold last night that my little sister hid under a blanket and would not come out to brush her teeth."},{"w":"under the door","p":"prep.","d":"under · 地點","c":"從門縫下","s":"When nobody answered the door, the mailman pushed the letter under the door and walked away."},{"w":"under 18","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"未滿十八歲","s":"You cannot buy beer in this store if you are under 18, so the clerk asked the young man to show his ID."},{"w":"under 100 dollars","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"一百元以下","s":"I want to buy a birthday gift for my mom under 100 dollars because I only have a little money this month."},{"w":"children under five","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"五歲以下的孩子","s":"Children under five can enter the zoo for free, so my parents did not have to pay for my little brother."},{"w":"under an hour","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"不到一小時","s":"If there is no traffic, we can get to the beach in under an hour, so let's leave early in the morning."},{"w":"under the weather","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"身體不舒服","s":"Jack felt a little under the weather this morning, so his mother told him to stay home and rest in bed."},{"w":"under control","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"在控制中","s":"The fire in the kitchen was small, and my father soon had it under control with a wet towel."},{"w":"under pressure","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"在壓力下","s":"Many students feel under pressure before the big exam, so our teacher tells us to sleep well and eat breakfast."},{"w":"under way","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"進行中","s":"The new school building is already under way, and the workers say it will be finished before next summer."},{"w":"under repair","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"維修中","s":"The bridge near our school is under repair this week, so we have to take a longer road to get there."}]},{"unit":45,"theme":"under (2) – up (1)","cards":[{"w":"under discussion","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"討論中","s":"The plan for a new school garden is still under discussion, and the teachers will decide on it next Monday."},{"w":"under attack","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"受到攻擊","s":"In the movie, the small town was under attack from a giant monster, and everyone ran to the hills."},{"w":"under fire","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"受到批評","s":"The restaurant came under fire after many people got sick, and the owner said sorry on TV last night."},{"w":"under one's breath","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"低聲地","s":"Jack was angry about the homework, so he said something under his breath that the teacher could not hear."},{"w":"under the name of","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"以…的名字","s":"The famous writer sold her first book under the name of a man because few people read books by women then."},{"w":"under the law","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"依法","s":"Under the law, every child in Taiwan must go to school, and parents cannot keep their children at home to work."},{"w":"under the rules","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"根據規定","s":"Under the rules of the game, each team has five players, and nobody can touch the ball with their feet."},{"w":"under the influence of","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"在…影響下","s":"Under the influence of his older brother, Tom started playing the guitar and now practices every evening."},{"w":"under the care of","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"由…照顧","s":"The sick puppy is under the care of a kind doctor, and he says it will be able to run again soon."},{"w":"under the leadership of","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"在…領導下","s":"Under the leadership of our new captain, the basketball team won five games in a row this season."},{"w":"under a teacher","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"師從某老師","s":"My sister has studied the piano under a famous teacher for three years, and now she plays beautifully."},{"w":"under one's nose","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"就在眼前","s":"I looked everywhere for my glasses, and they were right under my nose on the kitchen table the whole time."},{"w":"under lock and key","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"鎖得好好的","s":"My grandfather keeps his old letters and photos under lock and key in a brown box in his bedroom."},{"w":"under cover of darkness","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"在夜色掩護下","s":"In the story, the prince left the castle under cover of darkness so that the guards would not see him."},{"w":"under orders","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"奉命","s":"The soldiers were under orders to stay at the bridge all night, so they could not go home for dinner."},{"w":"under the title of","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"以…為標題","s":"She wrote a short story about her dog under the title of My Best Friend, and the class loved it."},{"w":"under the same roof","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"同住一屋","s":"My grandmother, my parents and I all live under the same roof, so dinner at our house is always loud and fun."},{"w":"under water","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"被水淹","s":"After the heavy rain last night, the whole street was under water, and cars could not drive through it."},{"w":"under the knife","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"動手術","s":"My uncle went under the knife last week to fix his knee, and now he has to rest at home for a month."},{"w":"under one's thumb","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"受某人控制","s":"In the movie, the king is under his wife's thumb, and he does everything she tells him to do."},{"w":"go under","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"倒閉；沉沒","s":"The small bookstore near our school went under last year because most students began buying books on the Internet."},{"w":"under study","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"研究中","s":"The new medicine for the flu is still under study, so doctors cannot give it to patients yet."},{"w":"under age","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"未成年","s":"The man at the door would not let the boys into the club because they were still under age."},{"w":"under the age of 12","p":"prep.","d":"under · 方式","c":"未滿十二歲","s":"Children under the age of 12 must sit in the back seat of the car, because the front seat is not safe for them."},{"w":"get up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"起床","s":"On school days I get up at six thirty, but on Sundays I stay in bed until almost ten o'clock."},{"w":"stand up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"站起來","s":"When the principal walked into the room, all the students stopped talking and stood up to say good morning."},{"w":"wake up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"醒來","s":"I always wake up at six when I hear the birds singing outside my window, even without an alarm clock."},{"w":"grow up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"長大","s":"My little cousin wants to be a doctor when he grows up because he likes to help people who are sick."},{"w":"give up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"放棄","s":"Learning to swim was hard for Lisa, but she did not give up, and now she swims faster than her brother."},{"w":"pick up the phone","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"接電話","s":"The phone rang five times during dinner, but my father told us not to pick up the phone while eating."},{"w":"pick up the kids","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"接小孩","s":"My mother leaves work early every day so that she can pick up the kids from school at four o'clock."},{"w":"pick up a language","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"學會一種語言","s":"Children can pick up a language quickly, so my little sister learned a lot of Japanese from watching cartoons."},{"w":"look up a word","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"查單字","s":"When I read an English story and see a new word, I look up the word in my dictionary right away."},{"w":"look up to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"尊敬某人","s":"Many students look up to Ms. Wang because she is a great teacher who always listens to their problems."},{"w":"turn up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"出現","s":"We waited for Kevin at the restaurant for an hour, but he did not turn up until everyone had finished dinner."},{"w":"show up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"出現","s":"Only ten people showed up at the school party last night because it was raining hard all evening."},{"w":"make up a story","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"編故事","s":"My little brother likes to make up a story about a brave cat every night before he goes to sleep."},{"w":"make up one's mind","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"下定決心","s":"After thinking about it for a week, Mary finally made up her mind to join the school swimming team."},{"w":"make up with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"和某人和好","s":"Tom and Jack had a big fight on Monday, but they made up with each other before the weekend."},{"w":"make up for","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"彌補","s":"Jenny missed her best friend's birthday party, so she baked cookies the next day to make up for it."}]},{"unit":46,"theme":"up (2)","cards":[{"w":"put up a tent","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"搭帳篷","s":"It took my father and me almost an hour to put up a tent on the beach because the wind was so strong."},{"w":"put up with","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"忍受","s":"I cannot put up with the loud music from the apartment next door anymore, so I will talk to the neighbor tonight."},{"w":"put up one's hand","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"舉手","s":"If you know the answer to the question, please put up your hand instead of shouting it out in class."},{"w":"set up a company","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"成立公司","s":"My uncle set up a company that sells tea on the Internet, and now he has five people working for him."},{"w":"clean up the room","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"打掃房間","s":"My mother says I can play video games only after I clean up the room and put away all my clothes."},{"w":"cheer up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"振作","s":"Amy was sad about losing the race, so her friends took her out for ice cream to cheer her up."},{"w":"hurry up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"快一點","s":"Hurry up and put on your shoes, or we will miss the school bus and have to walk in the rain."},{"w":"speed up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"加速","s":"The driver had to speed up on the highway because we were late for my sister's piano show in Taipei."},{"w":"dress up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"打扮","s":"For the school party, all the students dressed up as their favorite movie characters and took funny pictures."},{"w":"eat up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"吃完","s":"Mom told my little brother to eat up his vegetables before he could have any chocolate cake for dessert."},{"w":"drink up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"喝完","s":"The coach told us to drink up our water before the game because it was very hot outside today."},{"w":"use up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"用完","s":"We used up all the eggs making the cake this morning, so I have to go to the store before dinner."},{"w":"fill up the tank","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"加滿油","s":"Before the long drive to the mountains, my father stopped at a gas station to fill up the tank."},{"w":"fill up the form","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"填表","s":"To join the swimming club, you need to fill up the form and give it to the teacher by Friday."},{"w":"bring up a child","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"養育小孩","s":"It is not easy to bring up a child alone, but my aunt did it well, and her son is a doctor now."},{"w":"bring up a topic","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"提起話題","s":"At dinner, my brother brought up the topic of getting a dog, but my parents quickly changed the subject."},{"w":"break up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"分手；解散","s":"The famous band decided to break up after ten years together, and many fans cried when they heard the news."},{"w":"catch up with","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"趕上","s":"Peter was sick for two weeks, so now he has to study hard every night to catch up with the other students."},{"w":"keep up with","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"跟上","s":"The teacher speaks very fast in English class, and sometimes it is hard for me to keep up with her."},{"w":"come up with an idea","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"想出點子","s":"We needed a name for our team, and Lisa came up with an idea that everyone in the group liked at once."},{"w":"end up doing","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"最後變成做…","s":"We planned to study at the library, but we ended up playing basketball in the park all afternoon."},{"w":"stay up late","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"熬夜","s":"Jack stayed up late last night to finish his science report, so he fell asleep in math class this morning."},{"w":"sit up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"坐直；熬夜","s":"The teacher told us to sit up straight in our chairs because sitting badly is not good for our backs."},{"w":"take up a hobby","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"開始一項嗜好","s":"After he moved to a small town, my grandfather took up a hobby and now paints pictures of birds every day."},{"w":"take up space","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"占空間","s":"The old piano takes up too much space in our small living room, so my parents want to sell it."},{"w":"take up time","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"占時間","s":"Playing games on my phone takes up too much time, so I decided to use it for only one hour a day."},{"w":"call up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"打電話給","s":"If you forget what time the game starts, just call up Mike, because he always remembers these things."},{"w":"hang up the phone","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"掛電話","s":"My mother was angry because I hung up the phone before she finished telling me what to buy at the store."},{"w":"hang up the coat","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"掛起外套","s":"When you come into the house, please hang up your coat by the door and put your shoes on the shelf."},{"w":"hold up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"舉起；延誤","s":"The heavy rain held up the trains for two hours, so many people were late for work in the city."},{"w":"back up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"備份；支持","s":"You should back up the photos on your phone every month, or you might lose them all if the phone breaks."},{"w":"blow up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"爆炸；充氣","s":"We spent an hour blowing up balloons for the birthday party, and then two of them blew up with a loud noise."},{"w":"burn up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"燒毀","s":"The old house on the hill burned up in the fire last night, but luckily nobody was living in it."},{"w":"check up on","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"查看","s":"My mother often calls my grandmother in the evening to check up on her and make sure she is eating well."},{"w":"cut up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"切碎","s":"Before you make the soup, cut up the carrots and onions into small pieces and put them in the pot."},{"w":"do up one's buttons","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"扣好扣子","s":"It was cold outside, so my mother told my little brother to do up his buttons before he left for school."},{"w":"draw up a plan","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"擬定計畫","s":"Before the class trip, the teacher asked us to draw up a plan for what we would do each day in Tainan."},{"w":"dry up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"乾涸","s":"It did not rain for three months last summer, so the small river near our village dried up completely."},{"w":"face up to","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"面對","s":"Tom did not want to face up to the fact that he failed the test, but his mother made him talk about it."},{"w":"fix up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"修理","s":"My father spent the whole weekend fixing up my old bike, and now it looks almost like a new one."}]},{"unit":47,"theme":"up (3)","cards":[{"w":"get up to","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"做（壞事）","s":"The two boys were very quiet in their room, so their mother went to see what they were getting up to."},{"w":"go up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"上升","s":"The price of eggs went up again this month, so my mother bought fewer eggs and more vegetables."},{"w":"grow up to be","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"長大成為","s":"Mary loves animals so much that everyone thinks she will grow up to be an animal doctor one day."},{"w":"heat up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"加熱","s":"Dinner is already in the kitchen, so just heat up the soup for two minutes before you eat it."},{"w":"keep it up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"繼續保持","s":"Your English is getting better every week, so keep it up and you will do well on the exam."},{"w":"light up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"點亮","s":"On New Year's Eve, the whole city lights up with colorful lights, and people cheer and sing in the streets."},{"w":"line up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"排隊","s":"Hundreds of people lined up outside the store before it opened because the new phone was on sale."},{"w":"lock up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"鎖好","s":"Please lock up the music room when you leave, and give the key to the teacher in the office."},{"w":"look up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"抬頭看；好轉","s":"When the teacher called his name, Jack looked up from his book and saw that everyone was laughing at him."},{"w":"mix up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"混淆","s":"I always mix up the two brothers because they wear the same clothes and have the same short hair every day."},{"w":"open up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"打開；敞開心胸","s":"After we talked for a long time, my shy new friend finally began to open up and share her feelings with me."},{"w":"own up to","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"承認","s":"Nobody wanted to own up to breaking the window, so the teacher kept the whole class in the room after school."},{"w":"pack up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"收拾","s":"When the bell rang, we quickly packed up our books and ran to the bus stop before the rain came."},{"w":"pay up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"付清","s":"My brother borrowed fifty dollars from me last month, and I told him to pay up before his birthday party."},{"w":"pull up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"停車","s":"The taxi driver pulled up in front of the train station, and we got out with our heavy bags."},{"w":"push up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"推高","s":"The hot weather this summer pushed up the price of fruit, so my mother bought fewer apples than before."},{"w":"save up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"存錢","s":"Jenny is saving up for a new bike, so she does not buy snacks or drinks after school anymore."},{"w":"shut up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"閉嘴","s":"It is not polite to tell your little sister to shut up when she is trying to tell you something."},{"w":"sign up for","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"報名","s":"Many students signed up for the school basketball club because the new coach is young and very friendly."},{"w":"speak up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"大聲說","s":"The people at the back of the room could not hear Tom, so the teacher asked him to speak up."},{"w":"stand up for","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"捍衛","s":"My best friend always stands up for me when other kids laugh at my old shoes or my glasses."},{"w":"stand up to","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"勇敢面對","s":"Mary was afraid at first, but she finally stood up to the big boy who took her lunch money."},{"w":"start up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"啟動","s":"My father started up the car early in the morning so that it would be warm when we left."},{"w":"take up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"拿起；開始","s":"After he watched the games on TV, my cousin decided to take up swimming at the city pool this summer."},{"w":"tidy up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"整理","s":"Before Grandma and Grandpa arrive for dinner, Mom asked us to tidy up the living room and wash the dishes."},{"w":"tie up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"綁好","s":"Please tie up the dog outside the store, because animals are not allowed inside the supermarket."},{"w":"warm up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"熱身","s":"The players always warm up for ten minutes before the game so that they do not hurt their legs."},{"w":"wash up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"洗碗；洗手","s":"After the big family dinner, my sister and I washed up in the kitchen while Dad made some tea."},{"w":"write up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"寫成報告","s":"Our science teacher asked us to write up the results of our science project and hand them in on Friday."},{"w":"add up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"加總；合理","s":"The waiter added up the bill, but the numbers did not add up, so my father asked him to check again."},{"w":"It doesn't add up.","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"這說不通。","s":"He says he was at home all night, but his friend saw him at the park, so it doesn't add up."},{"w":"be up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"起床了；時間到","s":"My grandmother is always up before six because she likes to walk in the park when the air is cool."},{"w":"Time is up.","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"時間到。","s":"Time is up, so please put down your pencils and pass your test papers to the front of the room."},{"w":"What's up?","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"怎麼了？","s":"Lisa saw her brother crying on the sofa and asked him what's up, but he did not want to talk."},{"w":"be up to sth.","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"忙著做（壞事）","s":"The two boys were talking quietly behind the tree, and the teacher knew they were up to something again."},{"w":"be up to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"由某人決定","s":"It is up to you whether we go to the movies or stay home and play cards tonight."},{"w":"be up for","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"願意嘗試","s":"Are you up for a game of basketball after school, or are you too tired from the long test?"},{"w":"be up against","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"面臨","s":"Our small school team is up against the best players in the city, so we must practice harder this week."},{"w":"be fed up with","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"受夠了","s":"I am fed up with my noisy neighbors, because they play loud music every night until twelve o'clock."},{"w":"be up and about","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"（病後）起床活動","s":"Grandpa was very sick last week, but he is up and about now and even walks to the market."}]},{"unit":48,"theme":"up (4)","cards":[{"w":"be well up on","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"很了解","s":"My uncle is well up on computers, so we always ask him for help when ours stops working."},{"w":"up to now","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"到目前為止","s":"Up to now, I have read five books this summer, and I want to finish two more before school starts."},{"w":"up to date","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"最新的","s":"Our school library keeps its computers up to date, so students can find new information for their reports quickly."},{"w":"up to 50 people","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"最多五十人","s":"The new meeting room is quite big, and it can hold up to fifty people for a meeting or a party."},{"w":"up and down","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"上上下下","s":"The little boy was so excited about the trip that he jumped up and down on the bed all morning."},{"w":"up in the air","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"懸而未決","s":"Our plans for the weekend trip are still up in the air because we do not know if it will rain."},{"w":"up the stairs","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"上樓梯","s":"The lift was broken, so we had to carry the heavy boxes up the stairs to the top floor."},{"w":"up the hill","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"上山丘","s":"Every Sunday morning, my father and I ride our bikes up the hill to watch the sun come up."},{"w":"up the street","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"沿街往上","s":"Walk up the street for about five minutes, and you will see the post office on your left."},{"w":"up north","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"在北方","s":"My grandfather and grandmother live up north in Taipei, so we take the train to visit them during the winter holiday."},{"w":"up the river","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"往上游","s":"The boat moved slowly up the river, and we saw many birds and tall green trees along the way."},{"w":"look up at the sky","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"仰望天空","s":"We lay on the grass after the picnic and looked up at the sky to count the white clouds."},{"w":"up close","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"近看","s":"I had only seen elephants on TV before, so it was exciting to see one up close at the zoo."},{"w":"up front","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"預先；坦率","s":"The hotel asked my parents to pay up front for the room, so Dad paid the man before we went upstairs."},{"w":"up to one's ears in work","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"工作忙得不可開交","s":"My mother is up to her ears in work this month, so she often comes home after nine at night."},{"w":"up in arms","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"憤怒抗議","s":"The parents were up in arms when the school said it would close the swimming pool to save money."},{"w":"up to no good","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"沒幹好事","s":"The two boys were hiding behind the school wall after class, and I was sure they were up to no good."},{"w":"not up to much","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"不怎麼樣","s":"The movie we watched last night was not up to much, so we left before it ended and got ice cream."},{"w":"up for sale","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"待售","s":"The old house at the end of our street is up for sale, and my aunt wants to buy it."},{"w":"up and running","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"運作中","s":"The new school computer system is up and running now, so students can check their homework on the computer every evening."},{"w":"on the up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"好轉","s":"My grades were poor last year, but they are on the up now because I study with a friend every night."},{"w":"up the wall","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"發瘋","s":"The loud noise from the new building next door is driving my father up the wall this week."},{"w":"one up on","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"勝過一籌","s":"Jack is always trying to be one up on his older brother, so he studied all night for the English test."},{"w":"up to the mark","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"達標","s":"The coach said my running was not up to the mark, so I have to practice every morning before school."},{"w":"dressed up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"穿著正式","s":"Everyone was dressed up for my cousin's wedding, and my little brother looked funny in his new black suit."},{"w":"up to scratch","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"達到標準","s":"My English report was not up to scratch, so the teacher asked me to write it again over the weekend."},{"w":"up to here","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"到這裡","s":"Please read the story up to here tonight, and tomorrow we will talk about what happens to the brave girl."},{"w":"up to standard","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"達標","s":"The food in the new restaurant was not up to standard, so my parents decided not to go there again."},{"w":"time's up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"時間到","s":"When the teacher said time's up, half of the students were still writing the last question on the test."},{"w":"the game is up","p":"prep.","d":"up · 片語動詞","c":"計謀被揭穿","s":"When his mother found the broken plate under the bed, Tim knew the game was up and said sorry."},{"w":"make up (編／和好／彌補)","p":"prep.","d":"up · 易混淆","c":"多義","s":"My sister made up a funny story about a talking cat to make up with me after our fight."}]},{"unit":49,"theme":"upon – with (1)","cards":[{"w":"once upon a time","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"從前從前","s":"Once upon a time, a poor young farmer lived with his old mother in a small house near the forest."},{"w":"upon arriving","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"一到就","s":"Upon arriving at the hotel, we put down our bags and ran to the beach to swim in the warm sea."},{"w":"upon hearing the news","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"一聽到消息就","s":"Upon hearing the news that she won first prize, Amy jumped up from her seat and hugged her mother."},{"w":"depend upon","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"依賴","s":"Whether we have the picnic on Saturday will depend upon the weather, so please watch the news tonight."},{"w":"look upon A as B","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"把 A 視為 B","s":"My grandfather and grandmother look upon our old dog as a member of the family, so he eats dinner with us."},{"w":"upon my word","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"我保證","s":"Upon my word, I did not touch your cake, because I was playing basketball outside the whole afternoon."},{"w":"come upon","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"偶然發現","s":"While we were walking in the mountains, we came upon a small old temple hidden behind some tall trees."},{"w":"fall upon","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"落在；襲擊","s":"A heavy storm fell upon the small fishing town at night, and many boats were broken by the big waves."},{"w":"Christmas is upon us.","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"聖誕節快到了。","s":"Christmas is upon us again, so my sister and I are making cards for our teachers and friends."},{"w":"year upon year","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"年復一年","s":"Year upon year, the old farmer plants rice in the same field and sells it at the market in town."},{"w":"put the blame upon","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 慣用語","c":"把責任推給","s":"It was not fair to put the blame upon the youngest player when the whole team played badly."},{"w":"upon","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 易混淆","c":"on (較正式)=在…上（正式）","s":"In the old story, the king placed his hand upon the shoulder of the brave young soldier and thanked him."},{"w":"once upon a time (固定說法, 不用 on)","p":"prep.","d":"upon · 易混淆","c":"從前（固定用 upon）","s":"Every story my grandmother tells at night starts with once upon a time, and we always ask for one more."},{"w":"write with a pen","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"用筆寫","s":"You should write with a pen on the test, because the teacher cannot read the words you wrote with a pencil."},{"w":"eat with chopsticks","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"用筷子吃","s":"My American friend learned to eat with chopsticks when he visited Taiwan, and now he uses them every day."},{"w":"see with one's own eyes","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"親眼看見","s":"I did not believe the river was so dirty until I saw it with my own eyes last weekend."},{"w":"with a smile","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"帶著微笑","s":"The shop owner greeted every customer with a smile, so people liked to buy bread from her small store."},{"w":"with care","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"小心地","s":"Please carry the glass plates with care, because they were a gift from my grandmother many years ago."},{"w":"with pleasure","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"樂意地","s":"I will help you clean the room after class with pleasure, because you helped me with my math homework last week."},{"w":"with ease","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"輕鬆地","s":"Lily passed the English test with ease because she reads English stories for thirty minutes every night."},{"w":"with luck","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"幸運的話","s":"With luck, the rain will stop before noon, and we can still have our picnic in the park this afternoon."},{"w":"with all my heart","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"全心全意","s":"I love my grandmother with all my heart, so I visit her every weekend and cook dinner for her."},{"w":"with difficulty","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"費力地","s":"The old man climbed the stairs with difficulty, so a kind young student helped him carry his heavy bag."},{"w":"with joy","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"高興地","s":"The children shouted with joy when their teacher said there would be no homework during the long holiday."},{"w":"with one's help","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"在某人的幫助下","s":"With my father's help, I finished the model plane in two hours and flew it in the park."},{"w":"with one voice","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"異口同聲","s":"When the teacher asked if we wanted a class trip to the beach, all the students answered yes with one voice."},{"w":"with open arms","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"熱情地","s":"My grandfather and grandmother welcomed us with open arms when we arrived at their farm for the summer holidays."},{"w":"with the lights on","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"開著燈","s":"My little sister is afraid of the dark, so she always sleeps with the lights on in her room."},{"w":"with your mouth full","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"嘴裡塞滿食物","s":"Mom told my brother not to talk with his mouth full, because it is not polite at the dinner table."},{"w":"with time","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"隨著時間","s":"With time, the pain in my leg became less, and after two months I could play basketball again."},{"w":"with age","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"隨著年齡","s":"My grandfather's hair turned white with age, but he still rides his bike to the market every morning."},{"w":"with the wind","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"順風","s":"The boat sailed with the wind across the lake, so we reached the other side in only ten minutes."},{"w":"with a view to","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"為了","s":"My brother is learning Japanese with a view to studying in Japan after he finishes high school next year."},{"w":"with respect to","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"關於","s":"With respect to the school trip, the teacher said we must bring a hat, water, and our lunch on Friday."},{"w":"with the help of","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"在…幫助下","s":"With the help of a kind police officer, the lost little girl found her mother at the night market."},{"w":"with no doubt","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"毫無疑問","s":"With no doubt, Mary is the best singer in our class, so she will sing at the school party."},{"w":"with a heavy heart","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"心情沉重地","s":"With a heavy heart, Tom said goodbye to his best friend, who was moving to Japan with his family."},{"w":"with one's eyes closed","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"閉著眼睛","s":"My brother can play that song on the piano with his eyes closed because he has practiced it a hundred times."},{"w":"with the door open","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"門開著","s":"Please do not leave the room with the door open, because the cold air from outside will come in."},{"w":"with a book in hand","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"手拿著書","s":"Every afternoon, my grandfather sits under the big tree with a book in hand and reads until dinner time."}]},{"unit":50,"theme":"with (2)","cards":[{"w":"with my family","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和我家人一起","s":"I usually go to the mountains with my family on the weekend, and we have a picnic by the river."},{"w":"go with you","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和你一起去","s":"I will go with you to the new bookstore after school if you help me finish my math homework first."},{"w":"come with me","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"跟我來","s":"Come with me to the kitchen, and I will show you how to make the noodles my grandmother taught me."},{"w":"dance with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和某人跳舞","s":"At the school party, Jack was too shy to dance with Mary, so he just stood by the window."},{"w":"play with friends","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和朋友玩","s":"After I finish my homework, Mom lets me play with friends in the park until it gets dark."},{"w":"talk with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和某人談話","s":"When I have a problem at school, I like to talk with my mother because she always listens carefully."},{"w":"stay with us","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和我們住","s":"My cousin from Tainan will stay with us for a week, so we are getting the small room ready for her."},{"w":"live with one's parents","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和父母同住","s":"My older brother still lives with our parents because houses in the city cost too much money these days."},{"w":"argue with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和某人爭論","s":"I argued with my sister about who should wash the dishes, so Mom made us do them together."},{"w":"fight with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和某人打架","s":"Peter fought with a boy in his class over a ball, and both of them had to see the teacher."},{"w":"agree with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"同意某人","s":"I agree with my mother that too much TV is bad, but I still want to watch one show a day."},{"w":"share with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與某人分享","s":"Lisa always shares her lunch with her friends, so everyone in the class likes to sit next to her."},{"w":"a girl with long hair","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"長頭髮的女孩","s":"The girl with long hair sitting in the front row is my cousin, and she sings very well."},{"w":"a man with a dog","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"帶著狗的男人","s":"A man with a big brown dog walks past our school every morning, and the children always wave to him."},{"w":"a house with a garden","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"有花園的房子","s":"My grandfather and grandmother live in a house with a garden, where they grow tomatoes and beautiful red roses."},{"w":"coffee with milk","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"加牛奶的咖啡","s":"My father drinks coffee with milk every morning, but my mother likes hers black with no sugar."},{"w":"a room with a view","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"有景觀的房間","s":"We paid a little more for a room with a view, and we could see the whole blue sea from our window."},{"w":"a boy with glasses","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"戴眼鏡的男孩","s":"The boy with glasses in the corner is the best student in our class, and he helps everyone with math."},{"w":"a shirt with a hole","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"有破洞的襯衫","s":"I cannot wear this shirt with a hole in it to school, so I need to buy a new one this weekend."},{"w":"with 100 dollars","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"帶著一百元","s":"With one hundred dollars, you can buy a bowl of noodles and a drink at the night market near our school."},{"w":"be angry with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"生某人的氣","s":"Mom was angry with me because I came home late and forgot to call her from my friend's house."},{"w":"be pleased with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"對…滿意","s":"My teacher was pleased with my English report, so she read part of it to the whole class."},{"w":"be happy with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"對…滿意","s":"I am happy with my new bike, because it is light and fast and was not very expensive."},{"w":"be satisfied with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"對…滿意","s":"The customers were satisfied with the food and the friendly service, so they came back to the restaurant again."},{"w":"be bored with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"對…感到無聊","s":"My brother is bored with his old video games, so he wants to spend his money on a new one."},{"w":"be busy with homework","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"忙於作業","s":"I was busy with homework all weekend, so I could not go to the movies with my friends."},{"w":"be careful with money","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"小心用錢","s":"My grandmother taught me to be careful with money, so I always write down what I buy each day."},{"w":"be filled with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"充滿","s":"The whole room was filled with happy voices when the teacher told us a funny story about her cat."},{"w":"be crowded with people","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"擠滿人","s":"The night market was crowded with people on Saturday, so we waited twenty minutes for a bowl of noodles."},{"w":"be popular with students","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"受學生歡迎","s":"The new PE teacher is very popular with students because he plays basketball with us after class."},{"w":"be patient with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"對…有耐心","s":"My mother is always patient with my little brother, even when he asks the same question ten times."},{"w":"be in love with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"愛上","s":"My older sister is in love with a boy from her music class, and she talks about him every day."},{"w":"be wrong with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"有問題","s":"Something is wrong with my phone, because it turns off by itself every time I try to take a picture."},{"w":"What's wrong with you?","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"你怎麼了？","s":"You have not said a word all morning, so what's wrong with you, and did something happen at home?"},{"w":"What's the matter with you?","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"你怎麼了？","s":"You look so tired and you did not eat your lunch at all, so tell me, what's the matter with you?"},{"w":"be done with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"做完","s":"When you are done with the computer, please turn it off, because your sister needs to use it later."},{"w":"be good with children","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"很會帶小孩","s":"My aunt is very good with children, so all the kids on our street love to visit her house."},{"w":"be good with one's hands","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"手很巧","s":"My grandfather is good with his hands, and he made this wood table and the chairs by himself."},{"w":"be friends with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和…是朋友","s":"I have been friends with Amy since first grade, and we still walk to school together every morning."},{"w":"be fine with me","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"我沒意見","s":"If you want to meet at the library instead of the park, that is fine with me, so just send a message."}]},{"unit":51,"theme":"with (3)","cards":[{"w":"be OK with it","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"可以接受","s":"Dad wants to have dinner at seven instead of six, and everyone in the family is OK with it."},{"w":"be honest with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"對…坦誠","s":"You should be honest with your parents about the broken window, because they will find out anyway."},{"w":"be gentle with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"溫柔對待","s":"Please be gentle with the baby rabbit, because it is very small and gets scared easily."},{"w":"be sick with a cold","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"感冒生病","s":"Jenny was sick with a cold last week, so she stayed in bed and missed the school sports day."},{"w":"be down with the flu","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"因流感病倒","s":"Half of my class was down with the flu in January, so the teacher moved the big test to February."},{"w":"be ill with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"患…病","s":"My grandfather has been ill with a bad cough for two weeks, so we are taking him to the doctor tomorrow."},{"w":"shake with fear","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"怕得發抖","s":"The little boy was shaking with fear when he saw the big black dog running toward him in the park."},{"w":"jump with joy","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"高興得跳起來","s":"My sister jumped with joy when she opened the box and found the new phone she had wanted for months."},{"w":"cry with pain","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"痛得哭","s":"Tom fell off his bike and cried with pain, so his father carried him home and put ice on his knee."},{"w":"die with hunger (錯) → die of hunger","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"死於飢餓（正確說法）","s":"During the long war with no food in the shops, many poor people in the town died of hunger."},{"w":"be red with anger","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"氣得臉紅","s":"Dad's face was red with anger when he saw that someone had broken the window of his new car."},{"w":"be white with fear","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"嚇得臉色發白","s":"Her face was white with fear when the lights went out and she heard a strange noise in the kitchen."},{"w":"be green with envy","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"羨慕得眼紅","s":"When Jack showed us his new game, his little brother was green with envy and asked Mom for one too."},{"w":"burst with pride","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"充滿驕傲","s":"My parents were bursting with pride when I walked up to the stage to get the first prize for English."},{"w":"help sb. with homework","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"幫某人做作業","s":"My older sister often helps me with my homework, especially when I do not understand the math problems."},{"w":"provide sb. with sth.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"提供某人某物","s":"The school provides every student with a hot lunch, so we do not have to bring food from home."},{"w":"fill the glass with water","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"把杯子裝滿水","s":"Please fill the glass with water for Grandma, because she needs to take her medicine after dinner."},{"w":"compare A with B","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"比較 A 和 B","s":"When you compare this phone with the old one, you can see that the new camera takes much better pictures."},{"w":"deal with the problem","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"處理問題","s":"Our teacher taught us how to deal with the problem in a kind way when we have a fight with a friend."},{"w":"do with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"處理；與…有關","s":"I do not know what to do with these old books, so maybe I will give them to the school library."},{"w":"have to do with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…有關","s":"The story we read in class today has to do with a boy who moves to a new city and feels lonely."},{"w":"have nothing to do with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…無關","s":"I had nothing to do with the broken window, because I was in the library all afternoon with my friends."},{"w":"get along with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…相處","s":"My brother and I get along with each other very well, and we almost never fight about anything."},{"w":"get away with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"逃過懲罰","s":"You cannot get away with cheating on the test, because the teacher watches every student very carefully."},{"w":"come up with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"想出","s":"After thinking for an hour, Lisa finally came up with a great idea for our class science project."},{"w":"fall in love with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"愛上","s":"My parents fell in love with each other in college, and they got married five years later."},{"w":"keep in touch with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"保持聯絡","s":"Although my best friend moved to America last year, we still keep in touch with each other by email every week."},{"w":"make friends with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…交朋友","s":"On the first day of school, I made friends with a girl who sits next to me and loves comic books."},{"w":"go out with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和…約會","s":"My cousin has been going out with a boy from her school for a year, and we all like him."},{"w":"break up with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和…分手","s":"Amy broke up with the boy she loved last month, so she spent the whole weekend crying in her room."},{"w":"side with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"支持某人","s":"When my brother and I argue, Mom never sides with either of us, so we have to talk and find an answer."},{"w":"stick with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"堅持；跟著","s":"Learning the guitar is hard at first, but if you stick with it, you will play well in a year."},{"w":"start with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"從…開始","s":"Let's start with the easy questions on the test paper, and then we can go back to the hard ones."},{"w":"begin with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"以…開始","s":"The teacher asked us to write a story that begins with a rainy morning and has a surprise at the end."},{"w":"end with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"以…結束","s":"Our school day always ends with a short clean-up time, and then we can go home or play sports."},{"w":"with that","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"說完那句話","s":"Jack said he had to catch the last bus, and with that, he picked up his bag and ran out the door."},{"w":"with this","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"隨著這個","s":"The bell rang for the last time this year, and with this, our summer holiday finally began for everyone."},{"w":"along with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"和…一起","s":"My mother packed some fruit along with the sandwiches, so we had a healthy lunch on the mountain."},{"w":"together with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"連同","s":"Please send the report together with the photos you took on the school trip before Friday afternoon."},{"w":"What with…and…","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"由於…又…","s":"What with the heavy rain and the long traffic jam, we got to the train station almost an hour late."}]},{"unit":52,"theme":"with (4)","cards":[{"w":"be with sb.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"支持某人；和某人在一起","s":"Don't worry about the big game tomorrow, because all your friends and teachers will be with you."},{"w":"I'm with you.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"我同意你。","s":"I'm with you on this one; we should wait for the rain to stop before we ride our bikes home."},{"w":"Are you with me?","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"你懂我意思嗎？","s":"If we leave at seven, we can catch the early bus and get there before the shop opens, are you with me?"},{"w":"with it","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"跟上潮流","s":"My grandmother is really with it; she uses her phone to watch videos and talk with her old friends."},{"w":"with child","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"懷孕","s":"My aunt is with child, so she cannot carry the heavy boxes up the stairs by herself this time."},{"w":"with the times","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"跟上時代","s":"Our old teacher tries hard to move with the times, and now she teaches English with games on the computer."},{"w":"with reason","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"有道理","s":"Mom got angry with reason, because I came home late again and did not call her first."},{"w":"with interest","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"有興趣地","s":"The children listened with interest when the old man told them stories about the sea and his ships."},{"w":"handle with care","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"小心搬運","s":"The box says handle with care, so please carry it slowly and do not drop it on the floor."},{"w":"with the best will in the world","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"即使有最大善意","s":"With the best will in the world, I cannot finish all this homework in one night before the test."},{"w":"leave it with me","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"交給我","s":"Leave it with me, and I will call the restaurant and book a table for your birthday dinner tonight."},{"w":"part with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"捨棄","s":"My little brother will not part with his old toy bear, even though it is dirty and has one eye."},{"w":"trust sb. with sth.","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"放心把某物交給某人","s":"My parents trust me with the house key now, so I can come home alone after school every day."},{"w":"charge sb. with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"控告某人","s":"The police charged the man with stealing a car, and he had to go to court the next week."},{"w":"be faced with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"面對","s":"When we were faced with a very difficult math problem, our teacher told us to work in groups."},{"w":"be armed with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"配備","s":"My uncle and his friends were armed with warm coats, maps, and lots of water before they climbed the high mountain."},{"w":"be blessed with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"有幸擁有","s":"Our class is blessed with a kind teacher who always stays after school to help us with our homework."},{"w":"be gifted with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"天生有…才能","s":"My cousin is gifted with a beautiful voice, so she sings for the whole school at every big event."},{"w":"be born with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"生來就有","s":"Some people are born with a good sense of direction, but I always get lost in a new city."},{"w":"be left with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"剩下","s":"After we paid for the train tickets and lunch, we were left with only fifty dollars for the whole afternoon."},{"w":"be stuck with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"被…困住","s":"Everyone else went to the movies, and I was stuck with the dishes and a kitchen full of dirty plates."},{"w":"be met with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"遭遇","s":"Her idea for a class picnic was met with loud cheers, and everyone started planning the food right away."},{"w":"be comfortable with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"對…感到自在","s":"My sister is comfortable with speaking English in front of people, but I still get nervous and quiet."},{"w":"be in line with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…一致","s":"The new school rules are in line with what most parents asked for at the meeting last month."},{"w":"be level with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…平齊","s":"Please hang the picture so that the top is level with the window, or the wall will look strange."},{"w":"be even with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…扯平","s":"I paid you back the money for lunch yesterday, so now we are even with each other again."},{"w":"get even with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"報復","s":"Tom hid his brother's shoes to get even with him for eating the last piece of cake."},{"w":"be quits with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"兩不相欠","s":"You bought the movie tickets and I paid for dinner, so I think we are quits with each other now."},{"w":"be at war with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…交戰","s":"In the story, the two small countries were at war with each other for more than ten years."},{"w":"be at peace with","p":"prep.","d":"with · 方式","c":"與…和平相處","s":"After a long talk, the two brothers are finally at peace with each other and share a room again."},{"w":"What's wrong with (非 for)","p":"prep.","d":"with · 易混淆","c":"怎麼了","s":"What's wrong with your leg today, because you walked very slowly up the stairs and looked like you were in pain?"}]},{"unit":53,"theme":"without","cards":[{"w":"without a word","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"一句話也不說","s":"After the teacher gave back the test papers, Jack picked up his bag and left the room without a word."},{"w":"without doubt","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"無疑地","s":"Without doubt, this is the best beef noodle shop in our town, and people wait in line for an hour."},{"w":"without question","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"毫無疑問","s":"Mary is without question the fastest runner in our school, and she wins every race on sports day."},{"w":"without fail","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"一定","s":"Grandpa walks to the park at six every morning without fail, even when it is cold and windy outside."},{"w":"without stopping","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不停地","s":"The little girl talked without stopping for the whole bus ride, and her mother just smiled and listened."},{"w":"without thinking","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不加思索","s":"When I saw the ball coming toward the baby, I ran and caught it without thinking about my own safety."},{"w":"without looking","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒看","s":"Never cross a busy street without looking, because the cars and scooters come very fast around that corner."},{"w":"without end","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"無止盡","s":"The rain seemed to go on without end last week, so we stayed inside and played cards every afternoon."},{"w":"without a care in the world","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"無憂無慮","s":"The children ran around the beach without a care in the world while their parents cooked dinner."},{"w":"without my help","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒有我的幫忙","s":"My little sister finished the hard puzzle without my help, and she was very proud of herself all day."},{"w":"without a doubt","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"毫無疑問","s":"Without a doubt, my grandmother makes the best dumplings in the family, and we all ask for more every time."},{"w":"without notice","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不另行通知","s":"The bus times may change without notice, so please check the sign at the stop before you go."},{"w":"without a break","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不休息","s":"The students practiced for the dance show for three hours without a break, and everyone was very tired."},{"w":"without sleep","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不睡覺","s":"My father went without sleep for two nights because the baby kept crying, so he fell asleep at dinner."},{"w":"without a friend","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒有朋友","s":"When Amy moved to the new school, she was without a friend for a month, but now she has many."},{"w":"without charge","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"免費","s":"Children under six can enter the museum without charge, but adults have to pay two hundred dollars."},{"w":"without saying goodbye","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒說再見","s":"Peter left the party without saying goodbye to anyone, so his friends were a little sad and surprised."},{"w":"go without food","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒東西吃","s":"The lost dog went without food for three days, so we gave it some rice and chicken when we found it."},{"w":"do without","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒有…也行","s":"We cannot do without water on a hot day like this, so please put two big bottles in the bag."},{"w":"It goes without saying.","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不用說。","s":"It goes without saying that you should wash your hands before dinner, especially after you played with the dog."},{"w":"leave without paying","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒付錢就走","s":"The man tried to leave without paying for his noodles, but the shop owner stopped him at the door."},{"w":"can't live without you","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒有你活不下去","s":"In the movie, the young man told the girl that he can't live without you, and the whole theater laughed."},{"w":"without so much as a thank you","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"連句謝謝都沒有","s":"I carried her heavy bags all the way home, and she walked away without so much as a thank you."},{"w":"be without a job","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"沒有工作","s":"My uncle has been without a job for six months, so he is learning to cook and wants to open a shop."},{"w":"not without reason","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不是沒有原因","s":"The teacher chose Lisa as class leader not without reason, because she is kind and always helps others."},{"w":"without a sound","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"一聲不響","s":"The cat jumped up on the table without a sound and ate the fish before anyone in the kitchen noticed."},{"w":"without any trouble","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"毫無困難","s":"We found the small restaurant without any trouble, because the map on my phone showed us the way."},{"w":"without a second thought","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"毫不猶豫","s":"When the old lady dropped her money, the boy picked it up and gave it back without a second thought."},{"w":"without rest","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"不休息","s":"The nurses worked without rest during the busy night, and many sick people thanked them in the morning."},{"w":"without number","p":"prep.","d":"without · 慣用語","c":"無數","s":"On a clear night in the mountains, you can see stars without number, and the sky looks like a picture."},{"w":"without saying a word (非 without say)","p":"prep.","d":"without · 易混淆","c":"一句話也不說","s":"The old man sat by the window without saying a word, and he watched the rain fall for an hour."},{"w":"without","p":"prep.","d":"without · 易混淆","c":"with no=沒有","s":"He arrived at the airport with no ticket and without his ID card, so he could not get on the plane."}]},{"unit":54,"theme":"within – than (1)","cards":[{"w":"within a week","p":"prep.","d":"within · 時間","c":"一週內","s":"The doctor said my brother's broken arm will feel much better within a week if he rests at home."},{"w":"within an hour","p":"prep.","d":"within · 時間","c":"一小時內","s":"If you order the pizza now, the shop will send it to our house within an hour, so let's wait."},{"w":"within the next few days","p":"prep.","d":"within · 時間","c":"接下來幾天內","s":"The teacher will tell us our test scores within the next few days, so please do not worry too much."},{"w":"within minutes","p":"prep.","d":"within · 時間","c":"幾分鐘內","s":"The fire trucks arrived within minutes after the man called for help, and nobody in the building was hurt."},{"w":"within the time limit","p":"prep.","d":"within · 時間","c":"在時限內","s":"You must finish all the questions within the time limit, or the computer will stop the test by itself."},{"w":"within living memory","p":"prep.","d":"within · 時間","c":"記憶所及","s":"Grandpa says this is the biggest storm within living memory, and even the old people in town have never seen one like it."},{"w":"within the city","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"在市內","s":"There are more than twenty night markets within the city, so visitors can try different snacks every evening."},{"w":"within walking distance","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"走路可到的距離","s":"Our new apartment is within walking distance of the school, so I do not need to take the bus anymore."},{"w":"within reach","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"伸手可及","s":"Keep a bottle of water within reach when you study late at night, so you do not have to get up."},{"w":"within sight","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"看得見的範圍內","s":"Please stay within sight when you play on the beach, because the waves can be very strong today."},{"w":"within the school","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"在校內","s":"Students are not allowed to use their phones within the school during class time, except for the lunch break."},{"w":"within 10 kilometers","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"十公里內","s":"There are three hospitals within 10 kilometers of our house, so help is never far away if someone gets sick."},{"w":"within the house","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"屋內","s":"It was raining hard outside, so the children stayed within the house and built a castle with the sofa pillows."},{"w":"within the limits","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"在限度內","s":"Please keep the party noise within the limits, because our neighbors have a baby who goes to bed at eight."},{"w":"stay within the lines","p":"prep.","d":"within · 地點","c":"不要畫出線外","s":"The art teacher asked the little kids to stay within the lines when they colored the pictures of animals."},{"w":"within the law","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"合法範圍內","s":"The shop owner always sells his goods within the law, so the police never have any problems with him."},{"w":"within one's power","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"能力範圍內","s":"I will do everything within my power to help you pass the English test, but you must also study hard."},{"w":"within the rules","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"規定範圍內","s":"You can wear any color of socks, as long as it stays within the rules of our school about clothes."},{"w":"live within one's means","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"量入為出","s":"My parents taught me to live within my means, so I never spend more money than I have each month."},{"w":"within reason","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"合情合理的範圍內","s":"Mom lets me stay up late on weekends within reason, but midnight is too late for a student like me."},{"w":"from within","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"從內部","s":"The tree looked healthy outside, but it was slowly getting sick from within because insects had eaten the wood."},{"w":"a voice from within","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"內心的聲音","s":"When I wanted to give up on the race, a voice from within told me to keep running to the finish line."},{"w":"within oneself","p":"prep.","d":"within · 慣用語","c":"在內心","s":"After the long talk with his grandfather, Jason felt a quiet peace within himself for the first time in weeks."},{"w":"taller than me","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"比我高","s":"My younger brother is already taller than me, even though he is only twelve years old and still growing."},{"w":"more than 100","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"超過一百","s":"More than 100 students joined the school running club this year, so we had to practice in two groups."},{"w":"rather than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"而不是","s":"On hot summer days, my grandmother likes to drink cold tea rather than coffee, because coffee makes her thirsty."},{"w":"other than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"除了","s":"Nobody other than my best friend knows about my plan to study music in Japan after high school."},{"w":"no other than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"正是","s":"The person who left the beautiful flowers on the teacher's desk was no other than the quiet boy in the back row."},{"w":"less than ten","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"少於十","s":"Fewer than ten tickets are left for the show, so less than ten minutes from now they will all be sold out."},{"w":"would rather A than B","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"寧願 A 而不要 B","s":"On a rainy Sunday, I would rather read a comic book at home than go shopping in the crowded mall."},{"w":"no sooner…than…","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"一…就…","s":"No sooner had we sat down for the picnic than it started to rain, so we ran back to the car."},{"w":"more often than not","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"通常","s":"More often than not, my father falls asleep on the sofa while he watches the late night news on TV."},{"w":"rather than + V/N","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"而不是","s":"My parents always walk to the market rather than drive there, because parking is hard to find on weekends."},{"w":"more than happy","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"非常樂意","s":"I would be more than happy to show you around Taipei when you visit Taiwan next summer with your family."},{"w":"more than enough","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"綽綽有餘","s":"Mom cooked ten dishes for only four people, so there was more than enough food for everyone at dinner."},{"w":"nothing more than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"只不過是","s":"Do not worry, that loud noise last night was nothing more than the wind hitting the old windows upstairs."},{"w":"no more than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"僅僅","s":"It takes no more than ten minutes to walk from my house to the train station, so I never leave early."},{"w":"not more than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"不超過","s":"The teacher said our story should be not more than two hundred words, so please count your words before Friday."},{"w":"no less than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"多達","s":"No less than fifty people came to my grandmother's birthday party, and the whole street was full of cars."},{"w":"not less than","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"不少於","s":"Please drink not less than eight glasses of water a day when the weather is this hot and you play sports."}]},{"unit":55,"theme":"than (2) – because of","cards":[{"w":"other than that","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"除此之外","s":"The hotel room was a little small, but other than that, our trip to the beach was perfect from start to finish."},{"w":"than ever before","p":"prep.","d":"than · 易混淆","c":"比以前任何時候","s":"After the new coach came, our basketball team played better than ever before and won the city final."},{"w":"everyone but me","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"除了我每個人","s":"Everyone but me finished the long test early, so I was the only student still writing when the bell rang."},{"w":"nothing but water","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"只有水","s":"The doctor told my father to drink nothing but water for one day before the health check at the hospital."},{"w":"anything but easy","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"一點也不簡單","s":"Learning to ride a bike was anything but easy for me, because I fell down more than ten times in one afternoon."},{"w":"all but one","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"除了一個以外全部","s":"All but one of the students passed the math test, and the teacher gave that boy extra help after class."},{"w":"the last but one","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"倒數第二","s":"Our team finished the last but one in the race, so only one team was slower than us that day."},{"w":"cannot help but laugh","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"忍不住笑","s":"When the puppy fell asleep in the shoe, we could not help but laugh and take pictures with our phones."},{"w":"no one but you","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"只有你","s":"No one but you knows the way to the secret beach, so please come with us and show us the path."},{"w":"have no choice but to go","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"別無選擇只能去","s":"The last bus had already left, so we had no choice but to go home on foot in the cold rain."},{"w":"but for your help","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"要不是你的幫忙","s":"But for your help with the science project, I would never have finished it before Monday morning."},{"w":"the next but one","p":"prep.","d":"but · 慣用語","c":"隔一個","s":"My house is the next but one from the corner store, so you will see it right after the blue gate."},{"w":"cannot but + V","p":"prep.","d":"but · 易混淆","c":"不得不","s":"When I saw the little boy crying alone in the park, I could not but stop and ask him what was wrong."},{"w":"but for","p":"prep.","d":"but · 易混淆","c":"without=要不是","s":"But for the kind driver who stopped his truck, the lost puppy would have been hit by a car on the road."},{"w":"two plus two","p":"prep.","d":"plus · 慣用語","c":"二加二","s":"My little brother is only five, but he already knows that two plus two is four and can count to one hundred."},{"w":"ten plus","p":"prep.","d":"plus · 慣用語","c":"十以上","s":"The small boat can carry ten plus people, so our whole class cannot go across the lake at the same time."},{"w":"a plus","p":"prep.","d":"plus · 慣用語","c":"優點","s":"Being able to speak both English and Japanese is a plus when you look for a job at the airport."},{"w":"on the plus side","p":"prep.","d":"plus · 慣用語","c":"好的一面","s":"We lost the game today, but on the plus side, we learned a lot and nobody on the team got hurt."},{"w":"plus or minus","p":"prep.","d":"plus · 慣用語","c":"加減；上下","s":"The trip will cost about three thousand dollars, plus or minus a few hundred for food and small gifts."},{"w":"plus size","p":"prep.","d":"plus · 慣用語","c":"大尺碼","s":"This clothes store sells plus size dresses in many colors, so my aunt can always find something nice there."},{"w":"ten minus three","p":"prep.","d":"minus · 慣用語","c":"十減三","s":"The teacher wrote ten minus three on the board, and the whole class shouted seven at the same time."},{"w":"minus ten degrees","p":"prep.","d":"minus · 慣用語","c":"零下十度","s":"It was minus ten degrees in Japan last winter, so we wore three coats and still felt very cold."},{"w":"a minus","p":"prep.","d":"minus · 慣用語","c":"缺點","s":"The apartment is close to the school, but the noisy street outside is a minus for people who sleep lightly."},{"w":"plus and minus","p":"prep.","d":"minus · 慣用語","c":"加減；優缺點","s":"Before you buy the new phone, write down the plus and minus of it, and then make your choice."},{"w":"come back minus one shoe","p":"prep.","d":"minus · 慣用語","c":"回來時少了一隻鞋","s":"My little sister came back from the beach minus one shoe, and she could not remember where she lost it."},{"w":"minus points","p":"prep.","d":"minus · 慣用語","c":"扣分","s":"You will get minus points on the test if you forget to write your name at the top of the paper."},{"w":"the minus sign","p":"prep.","d":"minus · 慣用語","c":"負號","s":"The minus sign in front of the number means it is less than zero, so the weather was really cold."},{"w":"because of you","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 慣用語","c":"因為你","s":"I joined the school music club because of you, and now I love playing the guitar with my new friends."},{"w":"because of the traffic","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 慣用語","c":"因為塞車","s":"We missed the first ten minutes of the movie because of the traffic, so we did not understand the story."},{"w":"because of his hard work","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 慣用語","c":"由於他的努力","s":"Jack got the top score in the whole school because of his hard work, and his parents were very proud."},{"w":"be late because of the bus","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 慣用語","c":"因公車而遲到","s":"Many students were late because of the bus this morning, so the teacher waited ten minutes before the test."},{"w":"cancel because of bad weather","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 慣用語","c":"因天候不佳取消","s":"The school had to cancel the sports day because of bad weather, and all the students were a little sad."},{"w":"because of that","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 慣用語","c":"因為那樣","s":"My brother broke my favorite cup last week, and because of that, I did not talk to him for two days."},{"w":"not because of money","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 慣用語","c":"不是因為錢","s":"My father chose this job not because of money, but because he loves teaching little children how to read."},{"w":"because of","p":"prep.","d":"because of · 易混淆","c":"due to = thanks to=由於（皆可）","s":"Our picnic was put off because of the heavy rain, so we played board games at my house all afternoon instead."}]},{"unit":56,"theme":"instead of – next to","cards":[{"w":"instead of coffee","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"而不是咖啡","s":"At breakfast my mother always drinks hot milk tea instead of coffee, because coffee makes her heart beat fast."},{"w":"go instead of me","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"代替我去","s":"I have a fever today, so could you please go instead of me to pick up the books at the library?"},{"w":"walk instead of driving","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"走路而不開車","s":"On sunny days, my parents walk to the market instead of driving, because it is good exercise and saves gas."},{"w":"stay home instead of going out","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"待在家而不出門","s":"When it rains hard on the weekend, we usually stay home instead of going out, and we watch old movies together."},{"w":"instead of that","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"而不是那樣","s":"Instead of that heavy jacket, you should wear this light sweater, because the weather will be warm this afternoon."},{"w":"use honey instead of sugar","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"用蜂蜜代替糖","s":"My grandmother likes to use honey instead of sugar when she makes tea, because she thinks it is healthier."},{"w":"Instead of crying, do something.","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"別哭了，做點事。","s":"Instead of crying about the lost game, do something useful like practicing your shots for the next match."},{"w":"study instead of playing games","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 慣用語","c":"讀書而不玩遊戲","s":"If you study instead of playing games every evening this week, you will surely do well on the big test."},{"w":"instead of going out","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 易混淆","c":"而不出門","s":"Instead of going out for dinner, we cooked a big pot of soup at home and invited our neighbors over."},{"w":"instead of","p":"prep.","d":"instead of · 易混淆","c":"in place of=代替","s":"The teacher used a short video instead of the textbook today, and the whole class understood the lesson much better."},{"w":"in front of the school","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"在學校前面","s":"Every morning hundreds of students wait in front of the school gate, and the street gets very busy with cars and scooters."},{"w":"stand in front of the class","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"站在全班面前","s":"Amy was so nervous when she had to stand in front of the class and read her short story aloud."},{"w":"park in front of the house","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"停在房子前面","s":"My father always parks his old blue car in front of the house because our garage is full of boxes."},{"w":"in front of the TV","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"在電視機前","s":"Grandpa likes to sit in front of the TV after dinner and watch the baseball game with a cup of tea."},{"w":"right in front of you","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"就在你眼前","s":"You do not need to look for your glasses anymore because they are right in front of you on the desk."},{"w":"the car in front of us","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"我們前面的車","s":"The car in front of us stopped suddenly, so Dad stopped our car quickly and we all shouted in surprise."},{"w":"in front of everyone","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"在大家面前","s":"Jack fell off his bike in front of everyone at school, but he just laughed and got up again."},{"w":"sit in front of the computer","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 地點","c":"坐在電腦前","s":"If you sit in front of the computer for too many hours, your eyes will feel tired and dry."},{"w":"a tree in front of the house","p":"prep.","d":"in front of · 易混淆","c":"屋前的樹","s":"There is a tall tree in front of the house, and in summer we enjoy sitting under its cool leaves."},{"w":"next to the door","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 地點","c":"在門旁邊","s":"Put your wet umbrella next to the door, and then come into the kitchen for some hot soup."},{"w":"sit next to me","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 地點","c":"坐在我旁邊","s":"Come and sit next to me at lunch, and I will share my mom's delicious fried chicken with you."},{"w":"the house next to ours","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 地點","c":"我們隔壁的房子","s":"The house next to ours is empty now because the old couple moved to Taichung last month."},{"w":"next to the window","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 地點","c":"靠窗","s":"Our table next to the window is perfect because we can watch the rain while we eat dessert."},{"w":"the shop next to the bank","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 地點","c":"銀行隔壁的店","s":"The shop next to the bank sells cheap notebooks, so students often go there after school."},{"w":"stand next to each other","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 地點","c":"並排站著","s":"The two sisters stood next to each other in the photo, and nobody could tell which one was Ann."},{"w":"next to nothing","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 慣用語","c":"幾乎沒有","s":"I know next to nothing about cooking, so I asked my grandmother to teach me this weekend."},{"w":"next to impossible","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 慣用語","c":"幾乎不可能","s":"It is next to impossible to finish this long report in one night, so let us start right now."},{"w":"cost next to nothing","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 慣用語","c":"幾乎不花錢","s":"These sweet tomatoes cost next to nothing at the night market, so my mom bought two big bags."},{"w":"know next to nothing","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 慣用語","c":"幾乎一無所知","s":"Although Tom lived in Japan for a year, he still knows next to nothing about Japanese food."},{"w":"next to new","p":"prep.","d":"next to · 慣用語","c":"幾乎全新","s":"My uncle's bike looks next to new because he cleans it carefully every Sunday after breakfast."}]},{"unit":57,"theme":"in spite of – according to","cards":[{"w":"in spite of the rain","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"儘管下雨","s":"In spite of the rain, hundreds of fans stood outside the hall and waited for the singer to arrive."},{"w":"in spite of the cold","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"儘管寒冷","s":"In spite of the cold, my grandfather swims in the sea every morning before the sun comes up."},{"w":"in spite of everything","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"儘管如此","s":"In spite of everything that happened this year, Judy still smiles and says she is lucky to have friends."},{"w":"in spite of his age","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"儘管他年紀大","s":"In spite of his age, Mr. Lin runs five kilometers every day and beats many young people in races."},{"w":"in spite of the pain","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"儘管疼痛","s":"In spite of the pain in her leg, the brave girl finished the race and received a big prize."},{"w":"in spite of what you said","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"儘管你那樣說","s":"In spite of what you said yesterday, I still believe our team can win the final game on Saturday."},{"w":"in spite of oneself","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"不由自主地","s":"The movie was so funny that my serious father laughed in spite of himself and dropped his popcorn."},{"w":"in spite of the price","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 慣用語","c":"儘管價格高","s":"In spite of the price, Helen bought the beautiful red dress because she wanted to wear it to the party."},{"w":"in spite of the fact that","p":"prep.","d":"in spite of · 易混淆","c":"儘管事實是","s":"In spite of the fact that he was tired, Dad drove three hours to take us to the beach."},{"w":"thanks to you","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"多虧了你","s":"Thanks to you, I passed the math test today, so let me buy you a cup of milk tea after school."},{"w":"thanks to his help","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"多虧他的幫忙","s":"Thanks to his help, we finished all the work in the whole room before the bell rang at four o'clock."},{"w":"thanks to the good weather","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"多虧天氣好","s":"Thanks to the good weather, our picnic by the river was wonderful and everyone took lots of photos."},{"w":"thanks to the Internet","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"多虧有網路","s":"Thanks to the Internet, my cousin in Canada can talk to our grandmother every night and see her face."},{"w":"thanks to hard work","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"多虧努力","s":"Thanks to hard work, Jenny went from the worst student in English class to the best one this year."},{"w":"Thanks to the rain, the game was off.","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"因為下雨，比賽取消了。（反諷）","s":"Thanks to the heavy rain, the baseball game was off, and we had to stay home and do our homework."},{"w":"thanks to modern science","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"多虧現代科學","s":"Thanks to modern science, doctors today can help many sick children who could not get better in the past."},{"w":"thanks to my teacher","p":"prep.","d":"thanks to · 慣用語","c":"多虧我的老師","s":"Thanks to my teacher, I am not afraid of speaking English anymore, and I even gave a speech at school."},{"w":"according to the news","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"根據新聞","s":"According to the news, a strong typhoon will hit Taiwan this weekend, so we should buy some food today."},{"w":"according to the teacher","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"根據老師所說","s":"According to the teacher, the test next week will cover only the first three lessons of the book."},{"w":"according to the plan","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"按照計畫","s":"According to the plan, we will visit the museum in the morning and go shopping in the afternoon."},{"w":"according to the map","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"根據地圖","s":"According to the map, the train station is only ten minutes away from the night market on foot."},{"w":"according to the rules","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"依規定","s":"According to the rules, students cannot use their phones in class unless the teacher says it is all right."},{"w":"according to the weather report","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"根據氣象報告","s":"According to the weather report, it will be sunny and hot tomorrow, so bring a hat to the beach."},{"w":"according to him","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"據他說","s":"According to him, the new restaurant near the park is cheap and delicious, so let us try it tonight."},{"w":"according to size","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"按尺寸","s":"Mom put the shirts in the closet according to size, with the small ones on the left side."},{"w":"according to the law","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"依法","s":"According to the law, children under twelve must sit in the back seat when they ride in a car."},{"w":"according to my watch","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 慣用語","c":"照我的手錶","s":"According to my watch, the movie started five minutes ago, so we need to run to the theater now."},{"w":"according to sb. (非 according to me)","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 易混淆","c":"據某人說（不用於自己）","s":"According to Lisa, the final exam was very easy, but the other students said it was hard for them."},{"w":"in my opinion (非 according to me)","p":"prep.","d":"according to · 易混淆","c":"依我看","s":"Do not say according to me when you share your idea; say in my opinion, the movie is boring."}]},{"unit":58,"theme":"along with – away from","cards":[{"w":"along with his friends","p":"prep.","d":"along with · 慣用語","c":"和他的朋友一起","s":"Jason went to the night market along with his friends, and they ate fried chicken and played games."},{"w":"along with the letter","p":"prep.","d":"along with · 慣用語","c":"連同這封信","s":"Grandma sent a box of her own cookies along with the letter, and we finished them in one day."},{"w":"along with everything else","p":"prep.","d":"along with · 慣用語","c":"連同其他一切","s":"When we moved to the new house, we lost my favorite toy along with everything else in that old box."},{"w":"go along with the idea","p":"prep.","d":"along with · 慣用語","c":"贊同這個想法","s":"At first Dad did not like our plan, but he finally went along with the idea of a trip to Japan."},{"w":"along with that","p":"prep.","d":"along with · 慣用語","c":"隨之而來","s":"Mike got a new job in Taipei, and along with that came a busy life and a very small apartment."},{"w":"send it along with the gift","p":"prep.","d":"along with · 慣用語","c":"連同禮物一起寄","s":"Please write a short card for Grandpa, and I will send it along with the gift before his birthday."},{"w":"ahead of time","p":"prep.","d":"ahead of · 慣用語","c":"提前","s":"The students arrived ahead of time, so they had a few minutes to review their notes before the test."},{"w":"ahead of the others","p":"prep.","d":"ahead of · 慣用語","c":"領先其他人","s":"Nancy finished the puzzle ahead of the others because she had practiced with her dad every night this week."},{"w":"walk ahead of me","p":"prep.","d":"ahead of · 慣用語","c":"走在我前面","s":"Please do not walk ahead of me in the dark forest because I am afraid of getting lost."},{"w":"be ahead of the times","p":"prep.","d":"ahead of · 慣用語","c":"走在時代前面","s":"My grandfather bought a computer in 1985, so his friends said he was always ahead of the times."},{"w":"go ahead of the group","p":"prep.","d":"ahead of · 慣用語","c":"走在隊伍前面","s":"The guide told us not to go ahead of the group because the mountain path was dangerous and wet."},{"w":"two points ahead of","p":"prep.","d":"ahead of · 慣用語","c":"領先兩分","s":"Our basketball team was two points ahead of the other school when the last minute of the game began."},{"w":"ahead of the game","p":"prep.","d":"ahead of · 慣用語","c":"占上風","s":"Sandy always reads the next lesson before class, so she stays ahead of the game in every subject."},{"w":"far from home","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"離家很遠","s":"When Sam studied in a city far from home, he called his mother every night because he missed her."},{"w":"far from perfect","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"離完美很遠","s":"My English is far from perfect, but I still try to talk to foreign visitors in the night market."},{"w":"far from happy","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"一點也不開心","s":"Linda was far from happy when she saw the low score on her science test this morning."},{"w":"far from it","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"完全不是","s":"Do you think I am angry with you? Far from it, I am just too tired to talk tonight."},{"w":"far from easy","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"一點也不容易","s":"Learning to ride a bike was far from easy for me, and I fell down more than ten times."},{"w":"be far from the truth","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"與事實相去甚遠","s":"The story in that newspaper is far from the truth, so do not believe everything you read in the news."},{"w":"not far from the station","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"離車站不遠","s":"Our new apartment is not far from the station, so my father can walk to work in five minutes."},{"w":"far from being over","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 慣用語","c":"遠未結束","s":"The rain stopped for a while, but the typhoon is far from being over, so stay inside tonight."},{"w":"far from here (距離)","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 易混淆","c":"離這很遠","s":"The zoo is far from here, so we should take the MRT first and then change to a bus."},{"w":"far from easy (絕非)","p":"prep.","d":"far from · 易混淆","c":"絕非容易","s":"Making a cake without any help is far from easy, and my first one looked like a big brown rock."},{"w":"stay away from the fire","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"遠離火","s":"Stay away from the fire when you cook outside, because the strong wind can blow the hot smoke into your face."},{"w":"keep away from the dog","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"離狗遠一點","s":"Keep away from the big dog by the gate because it barks at strangers and might bite you."},{"w":"run away from home","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"逃家","s":"After a big fight with his parents, the boy wanted to run away from home, but his sister stopped him."},{"w":"walk away from the problem","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"逃避問題","s":"You cannot walk away from the problem all the time, so talk to your teacher about the missing homework today."},{"w":"be away from school","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"不在學校","s":"Jenny will be away from school for a week because she is going to visit her grandmother in Japan."},{"w":"get away from it all","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"遠離一切","s":"After a busy year, my parents went to a quiet mountain village to get away from it all for a weekend."},{"w":"turn away from","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"轉身不看","s":"The sad movie made Lucy turn away from the screen, and she cried quietly into her brother's shoulder."},{"w":"look away from the screen","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"把視線移開螢幕","s":"The doctor told me to look away from the screen every twenty minutes and rest my eyes for a while."},{"w":"a mile away from here","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"離這裡一英里","s":"The nearest supermarket is about a mile away from here, so let us drive there instead of walking."},{"w":"far away from the city","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"離城市很遠","s":"My grandfather lives on a farm far away from the city, where the air is clean and the nights are quiet."},{"w":"back away from","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"後退遠離","s":"When the little girl saw the snake on the path, she started to back away from it slowly and quietly."},{"w":"shy away from","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"迴避","s":"Peter is a quiet boy who likes to shy away from big parties, but he loves small dinners with friends."},{"w":"take away from","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"拿走；減損","s":"The rain did not take away from the fun of our trip, and we still laughed all the way home."},{"w":"stay away from trouble","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"別惹麻煩","s":"Mom always tells my brother to stay away from trouble at school and to choose his friends carefully."},{"w":"away from home","p":"prep.","d":"away from · 慣用語","c":"離家在外","s":"My aunt works away from home most of the year, so she only sees her children on holidays."}]},{"unit":59,"theme":"such as – aside from","cards":[{"w":"fruits such as apples and bananas","p":"prep.","d":"such as · 慣用語","c":"像蘋果、香蕉等水果","s":"Fruits such as apples and bananas are good for your health, so eat some every day after lunch."},{"w":"sports such as baseball","p":"prep.","d":"such as · 慣用語","c":"像棒球這類運動","s":"My brother loves sports such as baseball and basketball, and he plays with his friends every weekend."},{"w":"animals such as cats and dogs","p":"prep.","d":"such as · 慣用語","c":"貓狗之類的動物","s":"Animals such as cats and dogs make great pets because they are friendly and love being with people."},{"w":"countries such as Japan","p":"prep.","d":"such as · 慣用語","c":"像日本等國家","s":"Many students want to visit countries such as Japan and Korea because they love the food and the music."},{"w":"hobbies such as reading","p":"prep.","d":"such as · 慣用語","c":"像閱讀這類嗜好","s":"Quiet hobbies such as reading and drawing help me rest after a long and busy day at school."},{"w":"subjects such as math","p":"prep.","d":"such as · 慣用語","c":"像數學這類科目","s":"Subjects such as math and science are hard for me, but I enjoy history and English very much."},{"w":"such as it is","p":"prep.","d":"such as · 易混淆","c":"雖然不怎麼樣","s":"My cooking, such as it is, is ready, so please sit down and try the soup before it gets cold."},{"w":"as for the price","p":"prep.","d":"as for · 慣用語","c":"至於價格","s":"The new phone looks great and takes clear pictures, but as for the price, it is too high for me."},{"w":"as for the rest","p":"prep.","d":"as for · 慣用語","c":"至於其餘的","s":"We finished half of the homework at school, and as for the rest, we can do it together tonight."},{"w":"as for the weather","p":"prep.","d":"as for · 慣用語","c":"至於天氣","s":"The hotel was clean and the food was great, but as for the weather, it rained every single day."},{"w":"as for your question","p":"prep.","d":"as for · 慣用語","c":"至於你的問題","s":"As for your question about the school trip, the teacher will give us the answer tomorrow morning."},{"w":"as for that","p":"prep.","d":"as for · 慣用語","c":"至於那個","s":"I have already chosen my new school bag, and as for that red one, you can have it if you like."},{"w":"apart from that","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"除此之外","s":"The new apartment is small, but apart from that, it is perfect for our family and close to the MRT station."},{"w":"apart from the price","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"除了價格以外","s":"Apart from the price, there is nothing wrong with this bike, so I think I will buy it on Saturday."},{"w":"apart from Tom, everyone came","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"除了湯姆，大家都來了","s":"Apart from Tom, everyone came to the party, and we all asked why our best friend did not show up."},{"w":"apart from English, she speaks French","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"除了英文她還會法文","s":"Apart from English, she speaks French, so she can help the visitors from Paris find their hotel."},{"w":"live apart from one's family","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"與家人分開住","s":"My uncle has lived apart from his family for two years because he works on a ship in another country."},{"w":"stand apart from the others","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"與眾不同","s":"Her bright pictures stand apart from the others in the art room, so visitors always notice them first."},{"w":"tell A apart from B","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"分辨 A 與 B","s":"The two brothers look so alike that even their teacher cannot tell Jim apart from Jack on some days."},{"w":"far apart from each other","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"彼此相距很遠","s":"My two best friends now live far apart from each other, one in Taipei and the other in Kaohsiung."},{"w":"set apart from","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"使與眾不同","s":"Her kind heart and warm smile set her apart from the other students, so everyone wants to be her friend."},{"w":"apart from work","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 慣用語","c":"工作之外","s":"Apart from work, my father spends most of his time in the garden, growing tomatoes and sweet peppers."},{"w":"apart from","p":"prep.","d":"apart from · 易混淆","c":"aside from=除了（皆可）","s":"Apart from the long bus ride, the trip was perfect, and aside from that, we had no problems at all."},{"w":"aside from that","p":"prep.","d":"aside from · 慣用語","c":"除此之外","s":"The hotel room was a little small, but aside from that, our trip to Japan was wonderful and fun."},{"w":"aside from the cost","p":"prep.","d":"aside from · 慣用語","c":"除了費用之外","s":"Aside from the cost, the summer camp sounds great, so I will ask my parents about it tonight."},{"w":"aside from a few mistakes","p":"prep.","d":"aside from · 慣用語","c":"除了幾個錯誤","s":"Aside from a few mistakes in spelling, your English letter is very good, and your teacher will be proud."},{"w":"aside from being late","p":"prep.","d":"aside from · 慣用語","c":"除了遲到以外","s":"Aside from being late on the first day, Kevin has done a great job at his new part-time job."},{"w":"aside from work","p":"prep.","d":"aside from · 慣用語","c":"工作之外","s":"Aside from work, my mother loves to cook, and her chicken soup is the best thing in our house."},{"w":"aside from the weather","p":"prep.","d":"aside from · 慣用語","c":"除了天氣","s":"Aside from the weather, everything about our beach trip was perfect, and we want to go back next summer."}]},{"unit":60,"theme":"together with – in case of","cards":[{"w":"together with my friends","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"和我朋友一起","s":"I went to the movies together with my friends on Sunday, and we shared a very big bag of popcorn."},{"w":"together with the letter","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"連同這封信","s":"Lisa sent some photos of her new school together with the letter so her grandmother could see her new friends."},{"w":"send it together with the bill","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"連同帳單一起寄","s":"The shop will send the new TV together with the bill, so please check both of them when they arrive."},{"w":"together with his family","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"和家人一起","s":"Every Chinese New Year, my uncle travels back to Tainan together with his family to visit our grandmother."},{"w":"together with the price","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"連同價格","s":"The clerk wrote down the name of each dish together with the price, so we could check our order."},{"w":"get together with","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"和…聚會","s":"On weekends I like to get together with my old friends from high school and play basketball."},{"w":"work together with","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"和…合作","s":"Our class will work together with the students from another school to clean the beach this Saturday."},{"w":"live together with","p":"prep.","d":"together with · 慣用語","c":"和…同住","s":"Mike lives together with his grandmother in a small house near the river, and he helps her every day."},{"w":"on top of the hill","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"在山頂上","s":"We climbed for two hours, and from the small house on top of the hill we could see the whole city."},{"w":"on top of the box","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"在盒子上面","s":"The cat likes to sleep on top of the box by the window because the afternoon sun keeps it warm."},{"w":"on top of the world","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"非常開心","s":"Amy felt on top of the world when she heard that she had won first prize for her English speech."},{"w":"on top of that","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"除此之外","s":"It rained all day during our trip, and on top of that, I lost my wallet somewhere on the bus."},{"w":"on top of everything else","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"在其他一切之外","s":"I have a math test tomorrow and piano practice tonight, and on top of everything else, my computer stopped working."},{"w":"be on top of things","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"掌控一切","s":"Our class leader is always on top of things, so she never forgets to hand in the homework list on time."},{"w":"stay on top of the news","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"隨時掌握新聞","s":"My grandfather reads two newspapers every morning because he likes to stay on top of the news in Taiwan."},{"w":"on top of each other","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"疊在一起","s":"The books were piled on top of each other on the floor, so I could not find my English textbook."},{"w":"put it on top of the shelf","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"放在架子頂上","s":"Mom asked me to put the cookie box on top of the shelf so that my little brother could not reach it."},{"w":"on top of one's game","p":"prep.","d":"on top of · 慣用語","c":"狀態絕佳","s":"Jenny was on top of her game in the final, and she hit every ball back over the net with ease."},{"w":"in addition to English","p":"prep.","d":"in addition to · 慣用語","c":"除了英文之外（還有）","s":"In addition to English, Linda is learning Japanese at a night school, so she can talk with her friend from Japan."},{"w":"in addition to that","p":"prep.","d":"in addition to · 慣用語","c":"除此之外","s":"The hotel has a big swimming pool, and in addition to that, guests can use the bikes for free."},{"w":"in addition to his job","p":"prep.","d":"in addition to · 慣用語","c":"除了工作以外","s":"In addition to his job at the bank, my uncle teaches guitar to children on Saturday mornings for fun."},{"w":"in addition to the price","p":"prep.","d":"in addition to · 慣用語","c":"除了價格之外","s":"You need to pay for food and drinks on the train in addition to the price of the ticket, so bring enough cash."},{"w":"in addition to being late","p":"prep.","d":"in addition to · 慣用語","c":"除了遲到以外","s":"In addition to being late for class, Peter forgot his homework, so the teacher was not happy with him at all."},{"w":"in case of rain","p":"prep.","d":"in case of · 慣用語","c":"如果下雨","s":"In case of rain, the sports day will be moved to the gym, so please listen for the news on Friday morning."},{"w":"in case of an accident","p":"prep.","d":"in case of · 慣用語","c":"如果發生意外","s":"In case of an accident on the highway, you should call the police and stay inside your car until help comes."},{"w":"in case of trouble","p":"prep.","d":"in case of · 慣用語","c":"如有麻煩","s":"In case of trouble during the trip, students should find a teacher at once and never try to deal with it alone."},{"w":"in case of need","p":"prep.","d":"in case of · 慣用語","c":"如有需要","s":"There is extra water in the back of the bus in case of need, so tell the driver if you are thirsty."},{"w":"in case of doubt","p":"prep.","d":"in case of · 慣用語","c":"如有疑問","s":"In case of doubt about the homework, you can send a message to Ms. Lin, and she will answer you tonight."},{"w":"in case of bad weather","p":"prep.","d":"in case of · 慣用語","c":"如遇壞天氣","s":"The school will cancel the picnic in case of bad weather, and we will watch a movie in the hall instead."}]},{"unit":61,"theme":"in charge of – as to","cards":[{"w":"be in charge of the class","p":"prep.","d":"in charge of · 慣用語","c":"負責這個班","s":"Ms. Chen is in charge of the class this year, and she wants every student to arrive before eight o'clock."},{"w":"be in charge of the shop","p":"prep.","d":"in charge of · 慣用語","c":"負責這家店","s":"My aunt is in charge of the shop when the owner is away, so she has to count the money every night."},{"w":"in charge of cooking","p":"prep.","d":"in charge of · 慣用語","c":"負責煮飯","s":"Dad is in charge of cooking on weekends, and his beef noodles are the best thing in our house."},{"w":"close to the station","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"靠近車站","s":"The new bookstore is close to the station, so I can buy a book and catch my train in five minutes."},{"w":"live close to school","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"住在學校附近","s":"Lucy lives close to school, so she can walk there in three minutes and never worries about being late."},{"w":"sit close to the fire","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"靠近火坐","s":"It was cold at the camp that night, so we sat close to the fire and told stories until midnight."},{"w":"close to the sea","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"靠海","s":"My grandmother lives in a small house close to the sea, and I love hearing the waves at night."},{"w":"stand close to me","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"站在我附近","s":"Stand close to me when we cross the busy street, because many cars and scooters do not stop here."},{"w":"close to each other","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"彼此靠近","s":"The two kittens slept close to each other in the box to stay warm on the cold winter night."},{"w":"close to the top","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"接近頂端","s":"We are close to the top of the mountain, so let's rest for ten minutes and then finish the climb."},{"w":"close to home","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 地點","c":"離家近；切中要害","s":"The story about the sick dog hit close to home for Amy, because her own dog died last winter."},{"w":"close to 100 people","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"接近一百人","s":"Close to 100 people came to the school show on Friday night, so we had to bring more chairs from the gym."},{"w":"close to midnight","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"接近午夜","s":"It was close to midnight when the party ended, so my father drove over to pick us up from Tom's house."},{"w":"be close to tears","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"快要哭了","s":"Mary was close to tears when she lost her grandmother's necklace, but her brother found it under the sofa."},{"w":"be close to giving up","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"快要放棄","s":"Jack was close to giving up on the math problem, but his sister showed him an easy way to solve it."},{"w":"be close to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"與某人親近","s":"I am very close to my cousin Ivy, and we tell each other everything, even our biggest secrets."},{"w":"close to the truth","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"接近事實","s":"The police officer felt the boy's story was close to the truth, but he still asked a few more questions."},{"w":"come close to winning","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"差一點就贏","s":"Our team came close to winning the game, but the other side scored in the last ten seconds."},{"w":"close to one's heart","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"對某人很重要","s":"The old park is close to my heart because my grandfather took me there to fly kites every Sunday."},{"w":"be close to death","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 慣用語","c":"瀕臨死亡","s":"The old man was close to death after the accident, but the doctors worked all night and saved his life."},{"w":"close to the school","p":"prep.","d":"close to · 易混淆","c":"near the school=靠近學校","s":"My house is close to the school and near the park, so I can walk to both places in a few minutes."},{"w":"as to the price","p":"prep.","d":"as to · 慣用語","c":"關於價格","s":"As to the price, the manager said we could pay less if we bought five tickets together for the show."},{"w":"as to what to do","p":"prep.","d":"as to · 慣用語","c":"至於該做什麼","s":"Our teacher gave us no clear answer as to what to do next, so we just waited quietly in our seats."},{"w":"as to the time","p":"prep.","d":"as to · 慣用語","c":"關於時間","s":"As to the time of the meeting, nobody is sure yet, but it will probably be on Friday after school."},{"w":"as to how","p":"prep.","d":"as to · 慣用語","c":"至於如何","s":"Linda knows she wants to open a bakery, but as to how she will get the money, she has no idea."},{"w":"as to the reason","p":"prep.","d":"as to · 慣用語","c":"至於原因","s":"Kevin did not come to practice today, and as to the reason, nobody on the team knows anything at all."},{"w":"a question as to","p":"prep.","d":"as to · 慣用語","c":"關於…的疑問","s":"Many students have a question as to whether the test on Monday will cover the last two lessons too."},{"w":"be at a loss as to","p":"prep.","d":"as to · 慣用語","c":"對…不知所措","s":"When the bus did not come, the visitors were at a loss as to how to get back to their hotel."}]},{"unit":62,"theme":"up to – except for","cards":[{"w":"up to 100 people","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"最多一百人","s":"The small restaurant can hold up to 100 people, so it is a good place for our class party next month."},{"w":"up to ten years","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"長達十年","s":"A well-made bike can last up to ten years if you clean it often and keep it out of the rain."},{"w":"be up to no good","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"沒幹好事","s":"The two boys were talking quietly behind the tree, and I knew they were up to no good from their smiles."},{"w":"What are you up to?","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"你在做什麼？","s":"What are you up to this weekend, and would you like to join us for a picnic in the park near the river?"},{"w":"be up to the job","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"勝任這工作","s":"The new worker is young, but she is up to the job, and she finishes every order before the shop closes."},{"w":"up to the end","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"直到最後","s":"The movie was long, but we stayed up to the end because we wanted to know who stole the gold."},{"w":"up to my neck in work","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"工作忙得不可開交","s":"My father is up to his neck in work this week, so he comes home after we are already asleep."},{"w":"live up to one's name","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"名副其實","s":"The restaurant called Happy Garden lives up to its name, because everyone there smiles and the food is great."},{"w":"feel up to doing","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"有精神做","s":"I do not feel up to playing basketball today because I have a headache and I slept badly last night."},{"w":"be up to sb. to decide","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"由某人決定","s":"It is up to you to decide which movie we watch tonight, but please choose one that is not too long."},{"w":"up to and including","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"直到並包括","s":"The sale lasts up to and including Sunday, so you still have three days to buy the shoes you want."},{"w":"up to the minute","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"最新的","s":"This news channel gives you up to the minute reports about the typhoon, so watch it before you leave home."},{"w":"walk up to sb.","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"走向某人","s":"A little girl walked up to me in the park and asked if I had seen her small brown dog."},{"w":"come up to me","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"走過來我這","s":"The teacher came up to me after class and said my English speech was the best in the whole school."},{"w":"go up to the top","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"上到頂端","s":"We went up to the top of the tower by the stairs, and from there we could see the whole city."},{"w":"up to a point","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"某種程度上","s":"I agree with you up to a point, but I still think we should ask the teacher before we change the plan."},{"w":"up to one's old tricks","p":"prep.","d":"up to · 慣用語","c":"又耍老把戲","s":"My little brother is up to his old tricks again, hiding my shoes before school so that I will be late."},{"w":"inside of a week","p":"prep.","d":"inside of · 慣用語","c":"一週內","s":"The doctor says my leg will be fine inside of a week, so I can play soccer again next Sunday."},{"w":"inside of the box","p":"prep.","d":"inside of · 慣用語","c":"在盒子裡面","s":"There is a red bike inside of the box, and it is a birthday gift for my little brother."},{"w":"the inside of the house","p":"prep.","d":"inside of · 慣用語","c":"房子的內部","s":"The inside of the house was dark and dirty, but after we washed the floor and walls, it looked bright and new."},{"w":"inside of me","p":"prep.","d":"inside of · 慣用語","c":"在我內心","s":"Inside of me, I knew the answer was wrong, but I was too shy to say anything in front of the class."},{"w":"inside of a year","p":"prep.","d":"inside of · 慣用語","c":"一年內","s":"My cousin learned to speak good Japanese inside of a year because she practiced with her friends from Japan every day."},{"w":"inside of (美式口語)","p":"prep.","d":"inside of · 易混淆","c":"inside=在…裡面（口語）","s":"Americans often say the cat is inside of the house, but in writing it is better to say inside the house."},{"w":"except for a few mistakes","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 慣用語","c":"除了幾個錯誤","s":"Except for a few mistakes in spelling, your English letter was very good, and I enjoyed reading it."},{"w":"except for Tom","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 慣用語","c":"除了湯姆","s":"Except for Tom, everyone in our class went on the trip to the mountains, because he had a bad cold."},{"w":"except for the price","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 慣用語","c":"除了價格","s":"The new phone is perfect except for the price, which is much higher than most students can pay."},{"w":"except for one thing","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 慣用語","c":"除了一件事","s":"I like my new school except for one thing, and that is the cold lunch they serve every day."},{"w":"except for that","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 慣用語","c":"除了那個","s":"The hotel room was small, but except for that, our trip to Japan was wonderful from start to finish."},{"w":"except for the noise","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 慣用語","c":"除了噪音","s":"Except for the noise from the street, the apartment is a nice place to live, and the rent is low."},{"w":"except for me","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 慣用語","c":"除了我","s":"Everyone in my family can swim well except for me, so I am taking lessons at the pool this summer."},{"w":"Except for Tom, we all came.","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 易混淆","c":"除了湯姆，我們都來了。","s":"Except for Tom, we all came to the party on time, and he finally arrived after the cake was gone."},{"w":"except for","p":"prep.","d":"except for · 易混淆","c":"apart from = aside from=除了（皆可）","s":"Except for the cold weather, I enjoyed the trip, and apart from a little rain, every day was sunny."}]},{"unit":63,"theme":"out of","cards":[{"w":"out of the room","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"離開房間","s":"The teacher asked Jack to go out of the room because he kept talking and laughing during the test."},{"w":"out of the house","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"出了屋子","s":"We were out of the house by seven this morning because we wanted to catch the first train to Taipei."},{"w":"out of the car","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"下車","s":"Please do not get out of the car until it stops, because the road is busy and very dangerous here."},{"w":"out of school","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"放學；離校","s":"When the kids get out of school at four, they usually buy a snack from the vendor near the gate."},{"w":"out of bed","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"起床","s":"It is hard for me to get out of bed on cold winter mornings, so my mother has to call me three times."},{"w":"out of hospital","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"出院","s":"My grandfather came out of hospital yesterday, and the doctor told him to rest and walk a little every day."},{"w":"out of the country","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"出國","s":"My father is out of the country on business this week, so he will miss my birthday party on Saturday."},{"w":"out of love","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"出於愛","s":"My mother gets up at five every day to make our breakfast out of love, not because she has to."},{"w":"out of anger","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"出於憤怒","s":"Ben threw his book across the room out of anger, but later he felt sorry and said so to his mother."},{"w":"nine times out of ten","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"十之八九","s":"Nine times out of ten, my dog waits by the door at six because he knows I will come home then."},{"w":"made out of wood","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"用木頭做的","s":"This cute little boat is made out of wood, and my grandfather built it with his own hands many years ago."},{"w":"keep out of trouble","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"別惹麻煩","s":"Our teacher told us to keep out of trouble during the trip and to stay with our group at all times."},{"w":"stay out of it","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"別插手","s":"When my two sisters argue about the TV, I stay out of it and read a book in my room instead."},{"w":"talk sb. out of","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"說服某人不做","s":"Mary wanted to quit the swimming team, but her coach talked her out of it and she won a race later."},{"w":"grow out of","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"長大而不再","s":"My little brother grew out of his shoes in just six months, so Mom had to buy him a bigger pair."},{"w":"be out of one's mind","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"瘋了","s":"You must be out of your mind to swim in the sea during a typhoon; the waves could carry you away."},{"w":"out of the ordinary","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"不尋常","s":"Nothing out of the ordinary happened at school today, but I still had fun playing basketball with my friends."},{"w":"out of the corner of one's eye","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"用眼角餘光","s":"Out of the corner of my eye, I saw a cat jump on the kitchen table and steal a piece of fish."},{"w":"out of thin air","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"無中生有","s":"The magician made a white rabbit appear out of thin air, and all the children in the park cheered loudly."},{"w":"out of touch","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"失去聯絡","s":"I have been out of touch with my old friends since we moved to Tainan, but I still think about them."},{"w":"out of season","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"非當季","s":"Strawberries are out of season in summer, so they cost a lot more than they do in the winter months."},{"w":"out of character","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"不像平常的作風","s":"It was out of character for quiet Tom to tell jokes in class, so everyone looked at him in surprise."},{"w":"out of hand","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"失控","s":"The party got out of hand when fifty people showed up, so the neighbors called the police after midnight."},{"w":"out of bounds","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"禁區；越界","s":"The ball went out of bounds, so the other team got it and scored a point in the last minute."},{"w":"out of pocket","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"自掏腰包","s":"I paid for the broken window out of pocket because I did not want my parents to know about it."},{"w":"out of this world","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"太棒了","s":"The chocolate cake at that new bakery is out of this world, so we bought three pieces for the whole family."},{"w":"out of the woods","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"脫離險境","s":"My grandmother is feeling better after the operation, but the doctor says she is not out of the woods yet."},{"w":"out of the running","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"沒機會了","s":"After Tom hurt his ankle in the first race, he was out of the running for the final prize."},{"w":"out of favor","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"失寵","s":"That old pop song is out of favor with teenagers now, but my parents still love to sing it at parties."},{"w":"out of focus","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"失焦","s":"The photo of my cat is out of focus because I moved the camera when I pushed the button."},{"w":"out of step","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"不一致","s":"My grandfather's ideas about phones are out of step with the times, and he still thinks kids should write letters."},{"w":"out of line","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"過分","s":"It was out of line for Jack to shout at the waiter, so his mother asked him to say sorry at once."},{"w":"out of turn","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"不按順序","s":"Please do not speak out of turn in class; wait until the teacher calls your name and then give your answer."},{"w":"out of interest","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"出於興趣","s":"Out of interest, Lily asked the old farmer how many years he had worked on the land near the river."},{"w":"out of the way (偏遠)","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"偏遠的","s":"My uncle lives in an out of the way village in the mountains, so we visit him only once a year."},{"w":"out of a job","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"失業","s":"Mr. Wang has been out of a job since the factory closed, so his family is careful with money now."},{"w":"out of gas","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"沒油","s":"Our car ran out of gas on the highway, so we had to walk two kilometers to the nearest gas station."},{"w":"out of use","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"不再使用","s":"The old train station has been out of use for ten years, and grass now grows between the tracks."},{"w":"out of sorts","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 慣用語","c":"不舒服；心情不好","s":"Amy felt out of sorts this morning, so she did not eat breakfast and stayed in bed until almost noon."},{"w":"made out of","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 易混淆","c":"made of=用…製成（皆可）","s":"This chair is made out of old wood, and the table next to it is made of the same wood."},{"w":"look out of the window (非 look out the window, 正式)","p":"prep.","d":"out of · 易混淆","c":"看窗外","s":"On rainy days, I like to look out of the window and watch people walk by with their colorful umbrellas."}]}];
